Rep. Lolita T. Javier: and licensing.

asr-000627
00:29:42.840 --> 00:29:44.820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At patuloy pa rin po sila,

asr-000628
00:29:44.840 --> 00:29:46.340
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: isang nag-i-inspeksyon.

asr-000629
00:29:48.340 --> 00:29:50.420
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At meron din pong mga

asr-000630
00:29:50.420 --> 00:29:52.500
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: hearing ng mga admin cases.

asr-000631
00:29:54.060 --> 00:29:56.080
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Napaka-importante po nito dahil may

asr-000632
00:29:56.080 --> 00:29:58.120
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: continuing public interest

asr-000633
00:29:58.120 --> 00:30:00.360
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa protection of intellectual property.

asr-000634
00:30:01.110 --> 00:30:11.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pero nagbago po ang paraan ng piracy at distribusyon ng content. Kailangang malinaw kung ang current institutional structure ay tugma sa problema ang sinusubukan nating solusyonan.

asr-000635
00:30:12.140 --> 00:30:25.000
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Follow-up question lamang po, Madam Sponsor. Ano pong specific functions ng OMB na sa tingin ninyo ay hindi sapat na ma-assume ng ibang existing agencies tulad ng Intellectual Property Office of the Philippines?

asr-000636
00:30:25.000 --> 00:30:37.920
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Um, kagaya nga nang sinabi ko po kanina, ang office po ng OMB ay hindi pa rin naman po tumitigil yung mandate po nila na mag-inspeksyon at magbigay ng mga lisensya.

asr-000637
00:30:38.520 --> 00:30:50.240
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Um, hindi po sila magbibigay na nila ng license kung hindi nila nakikita kung ano yung content ng mga iikot na materials sa ating bansa.

asr-000638
00:30:51.680 --> 00:30:54.920
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang next question ko po ay may kinalaman sa

asr-000639
00:30:55.000 --> 00:31:10.480
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: 53.5 million budget. Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, ang proposed 2027 budget ng OMB ay mahigit 53.4 million mula sa 47.0 million sa 2026 GAA.

asr-000640
00:31:11.720 --> 00:31:22.840
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Sa gitna po ng mga panukhalang i-abolish ang OMB, ano ang kongkretong additional activities or capabilities na pupunduhan ng proposed 2027 budget?

asr-000641
00:31:23.580 --> 00:31:24.980
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker.

asr-000642
00:31:25.000 --> 00:31:40.140
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Um, um, nag-increase po talaga yung, uh, salary. Alam naman natin na may wage increase tayo. At yung basic operations. Yung M-O-O-E po ang nag-increase.

asr-000643
00:31:41.740 --> 00:31:53.800
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Agripo ko, Madam. Uh, kasi po napakalaga po nito habang may legislative review, sa future structure ng agency, kailangan natin makita kung ang dagdag na pondo ay tumutugon.

asr-000644
00:31:53.800 --> 00:31:54.220
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa actual

asr-000656
00:31:55.000 --> 00:32:00.140
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: enforcement needs o nagpapatuloy lamang sa existing administrative operations.

asr-000657
00:32:00.840 --> 00:32:04.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang susunod na katulungan ko po ay may kinalaman sa 50% vacancy.

asr-000658
00:32:05.700 --> 00:32:14.980
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, sa 2027 Stopping Summary ng OMB, may 92 authorized positions pero 46 lamang ang field.

asr-000659
00:32:17.080 --> 00:32:20.480
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ibig sabihin, kalahati ng plantilla positions ay vacant.

asr-000660
00:32:20.480 --> 00:32:28.020
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ano po ang dahilan ng napakataas na vacancy rate at anong impact nito sa enforcement ng operations ng OMB?

asr-000661
00:32:28.720 --> 00:32:35.880
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker, kagaya nga po ng sagot ko po kanina, dahil nga po OIC lahat ang head natin,

asr-000662
00:32:36.420 --> 00:32:45.320
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: naglipatan na po lahat ng mga empleyado natin at ang OIC ay wala rin pong power to hire, to acquire.

asr-000663
00:32:48.040 --> 00:32:50.300
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat po, Madam Sponsor.

asr-000664
00:32:50.300 --> 00:32:55.760
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang susunod na katulungan ko po ay may kaugnayan sa 3,000 inspection orders.

asr-000665
00:32:56.540 --> 00:33:04.880
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, sa 2027 Performance Targets, target ng OMB na maka-act sa 3,000 inspection orders,

asr-000666
00:33:05.860 --> 00:33:12.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: served on optical media establishments with 100% acted upon within the prescribed time frame.

asr-000667
00:33:12.960 --> 00:33:20.220
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pero kung kalahati ng authorized positions ay vacant, sapat po ba ang manpower ng OMB para ma-maintain ang

asr-000668
00:33:20.300 --> 00:33:22.660
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: 3,000 inspection order target?

asr-000669
00:33:23.780 --> 00:33:40.700
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker, yan nga po ang malaking problema ng board, kaya po humihingi sila ng funding ng pondo para po mapatuloy natin ang mandato para po sa ahensya na ito.

asr-000670
00:33:42.240 --> 00:33:48.160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang susunod na katanungan ko naman po, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, ay may kinalaman sa 301 watch list.

asr-000671
00:33:49.340 --> 00:33:50.280
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang pangunahin,

asr-000672
00:33:50.300 --> 00:34:00.520
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang pangunahing outcome indicator po ng OMB ay ang pagpapanatili na hindi mapasama ang Pilipinas sa U.S. Trade Representative o sa USTR Section 301 watch list.

asr-000673
00:34:01.300 --> 00:34:04.760
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ito rin ang target for vote 2026 and 2027.

asr-000674
00:34:05.760 --> 00:34:10.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Sa panahon po ngayon kung saan malaking bahagi ng piracy ay lumilipat sa digital platforms,

asr-000675
00:34:11.460 --> 00:34:17.860
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sapat po ba ang pagiging wala sa watch list bilang pangunahing indicator ng effectiveness ng OMB?

asr-000676
00:34:18.340 --> 00:34:19.860
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At may domestic indicator?

asr-000677
00:34:20.300 --> 00:34:27.440
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: May indicators po ba ang OMB na sumukat kung nababawasan ang piracy copyright infringement of the Philippines?

asr-000678
00:34:29.260 --> 00:34:32.500
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ibig sabihin po na wala tayo sa watch list.

asr-000679
00:34:33.860 --> 00:34:46.240
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ang pinapahihwating lang po ng OMB na ginagampanin pa rin nila ang kanilang tuntunin mga gawain, kaya tayo po ay wala sa watch list.

asr-000680
00:34:47.240 --> 00:34:50.240
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat po, Madam Sponsor.

asr-000681
00:34:50.300 --> 00:34:58.680
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, nagpapasalamat po tayo sa Optical Media Board at sa mahalagang layunin nitong protektahan ang intellectual property rights.

asr-000682
00:34:59.420 --> 00:35:04.360
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Sa harap ng mabilis na pagdipat ng piracy mula sa physical media patungo sa digital environment,

asr-000683
00:35:04.960 --> 00:35:12.900
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: mahalaga po na mapanatili ang enforcement capability ng pamahalan at matiyak ng maayos na transition kung magkakaroon naman ng institutional changes.

asr-000684
00:35:13.240 --> 00:35:19.480
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Umaasa tayo na anuman na maging structure ng Optical Media Board ay patuloy pa rin na mapalakas laban,

asr-000685
00:35:20.300 --> 00:35:27.580
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa kontra-piracy, at maprotektahan ng ating mga Pilipino creators at legitimate creative industries.

asr-000686
00:35:27.860 --> 00:35:28.680
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000687
00:35:29.640 --> 00:35:43.020
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, in behalf of the minority, I move to terminate the sponsorship and debate of the budget deliberation of the proposed budget of the Optical Media Board.

asr-000688
00:35:43.640 --> 00:35:45.140
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: So move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000689
00:35:45.460 --> 00:35:47.900
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you to the minority. What does the House say?

asr-000690
00:35:48.300 --> 00:35:50.280
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority.

asr-000691
00:35:50.300 --> 00:35:55.540
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: We join the minority in the motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of the Optical Media Board.

asr-000692
00:35:56.260 --> 00:36:02.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of the Optical Media Board.

