Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: budget reflects our continuing commitment

asr-000713
00:37:24.520 --> 00:37:26.400
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: to strengthen the capacity

asr-000714
00:37:26.400 --> 00:37:27.940
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: of Congress as an institution

asr-000715
00:37:27.940 --> 00:37:30.440
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: so that we may effectively carry

asr-000716
00:37:30.440 --> 00:37:32.460
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: out our constitutional mandate of

asr-000717
00:37:32.460 --> 00:37:34.360
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: legislation, representation,

asr-000718
00:37:34.900 --> 00:37:36.740
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: and oversight. I earnestly

asr-000719
00:37:36.740 --> 00:37:38.400
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: appeal to this August Chamber for

asr-000720
00:37:38.400 --> 00:37:40.240
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: your full support and approval

asr-000721
00:37:40.240 --> 00:37:42.360
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: of the proposed budget of the Congress of the

asr-000722
00:37:42.360 --> 00:37:43.960
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Philippines for fiscal year

asr-000723
00:37:43.960 --> 00:37:46.180
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: 2027. Thank you, Mr. Speaker,

asr-000724
00:37:46.720 --> 00:37:47.700
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: and this representation

asr-000725
00:37:47.700 --> 00:37:50.000
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: is now prepared to respond

asr-000726
00:37:50.000 --> 00:37:52.340
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: to any questions or clarifications

asr-000727
00:37:52.340 --> 00:37:54.440
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: from our esteemed colleagues.

asr-000728
00:37:54.760 --> 00:37:55.580
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Magandang salamat,

asr-000729
00:37:55.980 --> 00:37:58.600
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Wapa Kongbesuman Kay, Majority Leader.

asr-000730
00:38:01.000 --> 00:38:02.180
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000731
00:38:03.300 --> 00:38:04.380
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: we have no

asr-000732
00:38:04.380 --> 00:38:05.940
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: interpolators from the minority.

asr-000733
00:38:08.480 --> 00:38:10.500
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: May I request that the minority,

asr-000734
00:38:11.160 --> 00:38:12.360
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: Honorable Presley

asr-000735
00:38:12.360 --> 00:38:14.500
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: De Jesus, be recognized,

asr-000736
00:38:14.740 --> 00:38:15.540
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: Mr. Speaker.

asr-000736-split-2
00:38:15.540 --> 00:38:16.600
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Honorable Presley

asr-000737
00:38:16.600 --> 00:38:18.400
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: De Jesus is hereby recognized.

asr-000755
