Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Session resumed. The Honorable Presley De Jesus is hereby recognized.

asr-000758
00:41:20.000 --> 00:41:27.000
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Session resumed. The Honorable Presley De Jesus is again recognized.

