00:41:27.000 --> 00:41:49.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, there being no members present for the minority who wish to interpellate, I move to terminate the period of sponsorship and debate for the budget of the Congress of the Philippines. I so move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000759
00:41:50.000 --> 00:41:55.380
Rep. Marlyn L. Primicias-Agabas: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of the Congress of the Philippines.

asr-000759-split-2
00:41:55.380 --> 00:42:07.480
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of the House of Representatives. Any objection? There is none. The interpellation on the proposed budget of the House of Representatives is hereby terminated.

asr-000759-split-3
00:42:07.480 --> 00:42:09.040
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000759-split-4
