Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Thank you, distinguished colleagues.

asr-000759-split-7
00:42:10.820 --> 00:42:12.380
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader.

asr-000759-split-5
