Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ating distinguished sponsor at

asr-001916
01:59:41.720 --> 01:59:43.400
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yes, that would be best.

asr-001917
01:59:43.740 --> 01:59:46.260
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yes, kung we will,

asr-001918
01:59:46.540 --> 01:59:48.080
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: the DFA will forward it to the

asr-001919
01:59:48.080 --> 01:59:50.120
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: office of our good colleague, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001920
01:59:50.940 --> 01:59:52.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, Mr. Speaker,

asr-001921
01:59:52.460 --> 01:59:54.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil marami din pong lumalapit

asr-001922
01:59:54.720 --> 01:59:56.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa inyong representasyon

asr-001923
01:59:56.100 --> 01:59:58.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa ganitong tipo

asr-001924
01:59:58.500 --> 01:59:59.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga requests.

asr-001925
02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:07.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na marami talaga silang kahirapan kung paano ba makakatulong din yung ibang mga jurisdictions

asr-001926
02:00:07.300 --> 02:00:14.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa panahon na may ganitong treaty in effect na pwede namang may mutual legal assistance

asr-001927
02:00:14.680 --> 02:00:22.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero hirap pa rin sila na mahabol kung sino ba yung dapat mahabol pagdating sa child or spousal support.

asr-001928
02:00:22.720 --> 02:00:28.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Mr. Speaker, pagdating naman sa mga gender and development focal persons

asr-001929
02:00:28.180 --> 02:00:35.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kada embahada o sa mga consulates at offices ng DFA sa ibang bansa.

asr-001930
02:00:37.380 --> 02:00:45.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we know from the distinguished sponsor, how does the DFA ensure that responses of all these embassies

asr-001931
02:00:45.340 --> 02:00:49.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and consulates to gender-based issues within their offices

asr-001932
02:00:49.700 --> 02:00:57.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and to those brought up to them by Filipinos abroad are gender-responsive and gender-sensitive?

asr-001933
02:00:58.180 --> 02:01:21.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, for 2025 and 2026, there's approximately 7.1 million annually allocated for gender and development

asr-001934
02:01:21.960 --> 02:01:27.400
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: under the office of the DFA and among the events organized,

asr-001935
02:01:28.180 --> 02:01:34.900
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: include Women in Diplomacy Book, Regional Training on GAD Planning,

asr-001936
02:01:35.560 --> 02:01:42.040
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Conduct of Various GAD CODI Meetings and Hearings, International Women's Month Celebrations,

asr-001937
02:01:42.700 --> 02:01:48.360
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Training on Harmonized GAD Guidelines, Procurement of Learning Kits, Supplies and Equipment,

asr-001938
02:01:48.360 --> 02:01:53.640
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: National Women's Month Celebration, Gender-Responsive Leadership Training, GAD Regional Training,

asr-001939
02:01:54.080 --> 02:01:57.740
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: and Support for GAD Activities of FSPS, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001940
02:01:58.180 --> 02:02:01.260
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, just like any other activities being conducted here in the Philippines,

asr-001941
02:02:02.020 --> 02:02:06.660
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: dumadaan po ito sa proseso, Mr. Speaker, through a project proposal,

asr-001942
02:02:07.320 --> 02:02:14.060
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: and after the activity, there's a post-evaluation, and the expenses po dumadaan din po sa Commission on Audit, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001943
02:02:14.740 --> 02:02:19.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, bukod dun sa mismong training na binibigay natin,

asr-001944
02:02:19.000 --> 02:02:22.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: narinig ko ho, may leadership training tungkol sa gender sensitivity,

asr-001945
02:02:23.180 --> 02:02:28.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kaalaman din sa awareness tungkol sa iba't-ibang mga issues na may kinalaman sa gender,

asr-001946
02:02:28.180 --> 02:02:32.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and development, meron din po ba tayong referral system sa ngayon?

asr-001947
02:02:33.240 --> 02:02:38.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, kapag may lumapit, magsumbong, nagreklamo sa ating mga offices,

asr-001948
02:02:38.720 --> 02:02:45.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sino po ang mga partners po ninyo para matiyak na kung kailangan ng psychosocial support,

asr-001949
02:02:45.900 --> 02:02:56.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung kailangan ng legal assistance, ay meron po nga na ibibigay po tayong information kung saan lalapit ang ating mga kababayan?

asr-001950
02:02:58.180 --> 02:03:08.900
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, there is a point person for these activities and for concerns raised by our kababayans na nagpapatulong po

asr-001951
02:03:08.900 --> 02:03:15.260
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: for violence and other forms of attacks, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001952
02:03:15.260 --> 02:03:22.240
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And yung partner po ng DFA, one of the partners is the Philippine Commission on Women, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001953
02:03:22.680 --> 02:03:28.060
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: In fact, the department was recognized by the PCW as one of the top three performers,

asr-001954
02:03:28.180 --> 02:03:38.680
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: performing agencies out of more than 300 national government agencies, Mr. Speaker, for the fiscal year 2024.

asr-001955
02:03:39.680 --> 02:03:41.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Ginong Speaker.

asr-001956
02:03:41.840 --> 02:03:49.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At napaabot din po sa representasyon na ito, halimbawa, ng DMW, para dun sa mga lugar na meron silang offices,

asr-001957
02:03:49.200 --> 02:03:56.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagre-request po sila ng dagdag na pondo para sa health care professionals

asr-001958
02:03:56.600 --> 02:04:07.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pwede nilang matap, na meron silang pondo, na pwede nilang mapagkunan sa panahon na kinakailangan nilang magtap

asr-001959
02:04:07.300 --> 02:04:11.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng professional based on a particular jurisdiction.

asr-001960
02:04:12.020 --> 02:04:17.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa party po ba ng DFA, para dun sa mga lugar na wala pa tayong migrant workers office,

asr-001961
02:04:17.900 --> 02:04:23.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may ganito rin ba na parehong kahilingan na matiyak na meron kayong mapagkukunang pondo

asr-001962
02:04:23.600 --> 02:04:26.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa panahon na kinakailangan nilang magtap.

asr-001963
02:04:26.600 --> 02:04:32.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa mga professionals based on that area, para po agaran yung maibigay natin na tulong.

asr-001964
02:04:33.480 --> 02:04:47.560
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, sakaling magkukulang po yung GED budget which is mandated to be 5% of the total budget of the department

asr-001965
02:04:47.560 --> 02:04:55.220
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: for the MOOE, Mr. Speaker, sakaling kailangan po ng additional na pondo

asr-001966
02:04:55.220 --> 02:04:56.580
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: or

asr-001967
02:04:56.600 --> 02:05:00.700
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: may mga nangangailangan po tayo, may mga kababayan po tayo nangangailangan ng tulong.

asr-001968
02:05:01.920 --> 02:05:08.900
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Doon na po ginagamit yung ATN Fund and Legal Assistance Fund, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001969
02:05:09.900 --> 02:05:14.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Ginoong Speaker. At nakita rin po natin sa utilization ng ATN.

asr-001970
02:05:14.320 --> 02:05:19.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron pa tayong mga maaaring magamit. Kaya sana po kapag may dumulog sa atin,

asr-001971
02:05:19.940 --> 02:05:25.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at marami din po kami sa inyong mai-endorse kung sakali, pinag-uusapan lang po namin ng DMW

asr-001972
02:05:25.900 --> 02:05:32.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung paano po ang maayos na referral system, pero pa naway makasama rin po namin ng DFA

asr-001973
02:05:32.020 --> 02:05:41.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para wala po tayong maiwan na lugar pagdating sa mga nangangailangan na agad na tulong sa mga kaso ng gender-based violence.

asr-001974
02:05:42.160 --> 02:05:49.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, pagdating po sa nilabas na Gender Development Agenda for 2023 hanggang 2028 ng DFA,

asr-001975
02:05:51.240 --> 02:05:55.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang layunin po ba ng GAD agenda na ito, as sa tingin ninyo ay naaabot sa ngayon?

asr-001976
02:05:55.900 --> 02:06:05.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, ano-ano pa yung mga hakbang at mga plano ng DFA para mapatupad ang layunin ng GAD agenda na ito hanggang 2028?

asr-001977
02:06:06.360 --> 02:06:17.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron din po kayong ulat kung ilan bang mga domestic violence at gender-based violence cases ang nahandle ng DFA simula 2022,

asr-001978
02:06:18.140 --> 02:06:21.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay hihiligin po ito ng representasyon mula Gabriela Women's Party.

asr-001979
02:06:21.500 --> 02:06:23.440
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Sige po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001980
02:06:25.900 --> 02:06:31.280
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: With the complete data to the office of the good congressman, Mr. Speaker,

asr-001981
02:06:31.440 --> 02:06:40.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: and as far as in response to the query of the good congresswoman about the plans for the GAD program of DFA,

asr-001982
02:06:41.160 --> 02:06:48.840
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: tuloy-tuloy po yung training na gagawin ng department in the next two years, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001983
02:06:49.980 --> 02:06:55.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bilang pagtugon sa aming kahilingan noong nakaraang deliberasyon sa DFA,

asr-001984
02:06:55.900 --> 02:07:04.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagbigay po ang inyong kagawaran ng ulat tungkol sa overseas voting and registration.

asr-001985
02:07:05.160 --> 02:07:11.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kanina po, napag-usapan na rin ito, natalakay ng ating kasamahan mula sa minority.

asr-001986
02:07:12.200 --> 02:07:23.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kasama sa ulat ang mga aksyon ng inyong kagawaran sa pagkondukta ng registration.

asr-001987
02:07:23.820 --> 02:07:25.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa ngayon,

asr-001988
02:07:25.900 --> 02:07:37.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nabanggit po kanina sa interpellation na may lack of confidence dun sa voting process

asr-001989
02:07:37.780 --> 02:07:43.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at may mga doubts sa impact ng kanilang voting.

asr-001990
02:07:43.340 --> 02:07:55.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Base dito ang lack of confidence ay nangyayari dahil sa seemingly ang kawalan po ng tiwala ng mga buboto sa epekto o visa ng kanilang pagboto.

asr-001991
02:07:56.600 --> 02:07:57.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama po ba ito?

asr-001992
02:07:57.920 --> 02:07:59.400
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yes, that's correct, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001993
02:08:00.080 --> 02:08:10.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasabi rin ang ating ginoong sponsor na kailangan paalam sa mga voters natin na bawat boto ay mahalaga.

asr-001994
02:08:11.580 --> 02:08:12.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Every vote counts.

asr-001995
02:08:13.400 --> 02:08:18.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano po ito mapapakita ng DFA sa kanilang mga sariling awareness campaigns?

asr-001996
02:08:18.780 --> 02:08:25.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bukod sa overseas online voting,

asr-001997
02:08:25.240 --> 02:08:30.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na consistently mababa, lalong-lalong na pag midterm elections.

asr-001998
02:08:30.580 --> 02:08:35.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa tingin nyo po ba, mga ngailangan ngayon ng hybrid pa na pamamaraan ulit,

asr-001999
02:08:36.120 --> 02:08:40.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mabalik natin na meron pa rin option para sa in-person voting,

asr-002000
02:08:41.420 --> 02:08:47.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron pa rin option by post, at ngayon may bago ng modality ng voting.

asr-002001
02:08:47.980 --> 02:08:50.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede na rin bumoto online.

asr-002002
02:08:50.540 --> 02:08:56.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ba ay susuportahan ng DFA na magkaroon tayo ng pagtulak sa Kongreso

asr-002003
02:08:56.800 --> 02:09:02.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na tiyakin na lahat ng available na modes, depende sa jurisdiction,

asr-002004
02:09:04.060 --> 02:09:07.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: available, accessible sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002005
02:09:08.460 --> 02:09:16.400
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, the thrust of the COMELEC, which is the lead agency in the conduct of elections,

asr-002006
02:09:16.400 --> 02:09:18.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: is to go 100% online.

asr-002007
02:09:18.960 --> 02:09:21.280
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Except for three countries.

asr-002008
02:09:21.840 --> 02:09:28.700
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And the DFA supports this initiative sa pamamagitan po ng pagkandak ng mga nasabi po,

asr-002009
02:09:28.780 --> 02:09:33.020
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: mga training and information campaigns and dissemination outreach,

asr-002010
02:09:33.540 --> 02:09:41.120
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: personally communicating with our kababayan OFWs to inform them,

asr-002011
02:09:41.240 --> 02:09:48.120
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: to explain to them of the process and the importance and the sanctity of their votes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002012
02:09:48.960 --> 02:09:56.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, maaaring bang mag-host ng mga focus group discussions or consultation ang DFA tungkol dito?

asr-002013
02:09:56.480 --> 02:10:03.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi po, kung sa bahagi lang po namin at i-share po namin sa inyong office na marami po talagang nananawagan

asr-002014
02:10:03.740 --> 02:10:13.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kung pwede maging available pa rin yung ibang forma ng mga pagboto para sa mga Filipinos living and working overseas.

asr-002015
02:10:13.680 --> 02:10:17.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mahalaga po na marinig mismo yung kanilang mga pangangailangan.

asr-002016
02:10:17.520 --> 02:10:18.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tulad ng nasabi ng atin,

asr-002017
02:10:18.880 --> 02:10:26.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ating distinguished sponsor, maaaring varying degrees po yan ng necessity pagdating sa variety sa iba't ibang mga lugar.

asr-002018
02:10:27.400 --> 02:10:35.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, ang maganda lang, yung pinakaunang dapat natin makausap tungkol sa bagay na ito ay nakonsulta natin.

asr-002019
02:10:36.680 --> 02:10:44.080
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, the Comelec discusses, consults with the DFA,

asr-002020
02:10:44.080 --> 02:10:48.740
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: pero yung nag-de-decide po talaga,

asr-002021
02:10:48.880 --> 02:10:50.020
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: is the Comelec.

asr-002022
02:10:50.840 --> 02:11:04.260
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, the DFA, they just merely inform the OFWs or the registered voters on the process approved by the Comelec, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002023
02:11:05.160 --> 02:11:09.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat. At ginaw, Speaker, ang ulat sa atin ng Comelec, ang laki din ng budget cut nila

asr-002024
02:11:09.980 --> 02:11:16.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa public information, voters' education, lalong-lalo na sa online.

asr-002025
02:11:16.180 --> 02:11:18.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Wala po silang pondo para mag-conduct.

asr-002026
02:11:18.880 --> 02:11:21.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mga satellite registration sa ibang bansa.

asr-002027
02:11:21.560 --> 02:11:25.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dito pa lang sa Pilipinas, hirap na sila mag-conduct ng satellite registration.

asr-002028
02:11:25.360 --> 02:11:26.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano pa kaya sa ibang bansa?

asr-002029
02:11:27.120 --> 02:11:33.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para tumulong sa DFA, para magkaroon din ng dagdag na effort, not only for registration but enrollment.

asr-002030
02:11:33.800 --> 02:11:36.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun po kasi ang difference ngayon ng online voting system.

asr-002031
02:11:37.040 --> 02:11:43.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi sapat na registered ka, kailangan mo pang mag-enroll dun sa mismo system kung saan ka buboto.

asr-002032
02:11:43.160 --> 02:11:48.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayan, kaya ho, ibabalik ko po ang hamon siguro dito sa ating kapulungan.

asr-002033
02:11:48.880 --> 02:11:55.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na bigyang prioridad yung pag-aaral ng kung paano natin mas mapapataas pa yung turnout

asr-002034
02:11:55.460 --> 02:12:01.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa dami ng mga Pilipino na nabubuhay at nagtatrabaho po sa iba yung dagat.

asr-002035
02:12:01.940 --> 02:12:10.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman at bilang panghuli, kasama din sa ulat ng DFA yung tungkol sa pagkondukta ng diplomatic actions,

asr-002036
02:12:10.860 --> 02:12:17.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na kapag may kinalaman sa International Maritime Organization.

asr-002037
02:12:17.640 --> 02:12:18.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tungkol sa...

asr-002038
02:12:18.880 --> 02:12:23.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kapalaran at kapakanan ng ating mga Filipino seafarers.

asr-002039
02:12:23.660 --> 02:12:33.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa mga usapang diplomatiko, meron ba ang DFA na hakbang upang masigurado na kapag ang mga Filipino seafarers ay protektado sa blacklisting,

asr-002040
02:12:35.480 --> 02:12:38.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kapag ginamit nila ang right to refuse sailing?

asr-002041
02:12:39.960 --> 02:12:48.580
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yes, Mr. Speaker, tuloy-tuloy po ang communication ng DFA with other countries,

asr-002042
02:12:48.880 --> 02:12:58.920
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: on how to protect the welfare of all, not just the seafarers, but of all overseas Filipinos working abroad, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002043
02:12:59.880 --> 02:13:07.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat. At ang panawagan natin, palakasin natin yung mga mekanismo para protektahan talaga sa blacklisting itong mga seafarers.

asr-002044
02:13:07.260 --> 02:13:15.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi ang nangyayari daw kapag sila ay meron ng record na sila ay inexercise ang kanilang right to refuse sailing,

asr-002045
02:13:15.960 --> 02:13:18.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagbalik po nila dito sa Pilipinas, pag-aalis na sila ulit.

asr-002046
02:13:18.880 --> 02:13:27.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, nagkakagulatan na lang na bawal na sila, umalis o na-blacklist na sila, o hindi na po sila makapag-readme ng kanilang mga kontrata.

asr-002047
02:13:28.380 --> 02:13:39.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na ilapit na rin natin ito sa DMW at naway makasama din po natin ang DFA sa pagpapalakas ng proteksyon, pagtataguyod ng karapatan ng ating Filipino seafarers.

asr-002048
02:13:39.460 --> 02:13:43.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat sa ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-002049
02:13:43.380 --> 02:13:48.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At would the distinguished sponsor and the DFA commit to a dialogue?

asr-002050
02:13:48.880 --> 02:13:57.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And to strengthen the protections and ensure that the voices of the Filipino seafarers are heard on this important matter?

asr-002051
02:13:58.220 --> 02:13:58.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

asr-002052
02:13:59.040 --> 02:14:01.320
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you very much, Honorable Elago, Majority Leader.

asr-002053
02:14:02.140 --> 02:14:10.520
