02:53:42.040 --> 02:53:49.440
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Vice Chair Lolita T. Javier of the 2nd District of Leyte

asr-003137
02:53:49.440 --> 02:53:57.140
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: as the Vice Chairman of the Committee on Appropriations to answer questions on the proposed budget of MTRCB.

asr-003138
02:53:57.160 --> 02:54:01.160
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The Honorable Lolita Javier is recognized.

asr-003139
02:54:01.800 --> 02:54:03.720
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Vice Chair, you have the floor.

asr-003140
02:54:05.280 --> 02:54:10.740
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker, distinguished members of the House of Representatives,

asr-003141
02:54:11.840 --> 02:54:12.940
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: ladies and gentlemen,

asr-003142
02:54:13.380 --> 02:54:16.260
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: maupay nga aga haatan nga tanan.

asr-003143
02:54:17.340 --> 02:54:25.180
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: It is my privilege to sponsor the proposed budget of the Movie Television Review and Classification Board

asr-003144
02:54:25.180 --> 02:54:27.140
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: for Fiscal Year 2020.

asr-003145
02:54:27.160 --> 02:54:35.000
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: MTRCB, by virtue of Presidential Decree No. 1986,

asr-003146
02:54:36.080 --> 02:54:44.340
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: is mandated to review and classify film and television programs as to audience suitability.

asr-003147
02:54:45.260 --> 02:54:51.580
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: The MTRCB's strategic direction focuses on enhancing efficiency,

asr-003148
02:54:52.800 --> 02:54:55.020
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: modernizing operations,

asr-003149
02:54:55.680 --> 02:54:57.000
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: engaging the public,

asr-003150
02:54:57.160 --> 02:54:59.700
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: and ensuring regulatory effectiveness

asr-003151
02:54:59.700 --> 02:55:03.980
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: to meet the evolving needs of the media industry

asr-003152
02:55:03.980 --> 02:55:09.440
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: and safeguard the interest and welfare of our viewers.

asr-003153
02:55:10.440 --> 02:55:12.640
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Being a self-sustaining agency,

asr-003154
02:55:14.000 --> 02:55:22.840
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: the MTRCB is allowed to utilize its income to fund its MOUE and capital outlay.

asr-003155
02:55:22.840 --> 02:55:26.840
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Hence, only the amount of $49,000,

asr-003156
02:55:27.160 --> 02:55:38.000
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: $9,987 million for personal services is being asked for approval by Congress today.

asr-003157
02:55:39.000 --> 02:55:39.860
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003158
02:55:40.920 --> 02:55:41.880
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: dear colleagues,

asr-003159
