asr-004210
03:45:51.000 --> 03:45:54.940
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: The Honorable Vice Chair Dolita Javier is recognized.

asr-004211
03:45:56.080 --> 03:46:00.820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Members of the House of Representatives,

asr-004212
03:46:01.860 --> 03:46:05.580
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ladies and Gentlemen, Maupay Nga Kulop Haton Nga Tanan,

asr-004213
03:46:06.620 --> 03:46:15.860
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: It is my privilege to sponsor the proposed budget of the Film Development Council of the Philippines for Fiscal Year 2027.

asr-004214
03:46:16.300 --> 03:46:20.860
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: The FDCP, which was created by virtue of Republic Touch,

asr-004215
03:46:21.000 --> 03:46:23.700
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Act No. 9167,

asr-004216
03:46:24.340 --> 03:46:28.940
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: encourages the creation of quality films and content,

asr-004217
03:46:29.420 --> 03:46:31.580
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: from development to production,

asr-004218
03:46:32.360 --> 03:46:34.080
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: exhibition and distribution.

asr-004219
03:46:35.180 --> 03:46:40.800
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: The FDCP also conducts film-related events

asr-004220
03:46:40.800 --> 03:46:44.900
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: that enhance the skills of Filipino talents

asr-004221
03:46:44.900 --> 03:46:50.820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: and amplify economic and cultural opportunities for film industry,

asr-004222
03:46:51.000 --> 03:46:54.940
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: as well as the participation of the FDCP's stakeholders.

asr-004223
03:46:54.940 --> 03:46:56.240
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: In addition,

asr-004224
03:46:56.240 --> 03:47:00.580
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: the FDCP leads the film markets and film festivals

asr-004225
03:47:00.580 --> 03:47:06.340
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: to promote and position Philippine cinema to be globally competitive.

asr-004226
03:47:06.340 --> 03:47:12.220
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: The Council also works to preserve and protect films

asr-004227
03:47:12.220 --> 03:47:17.260
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: as part of the country's national and cultural heritage

asr-004228
03:47:17.260 --> 03:47:19.660
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: through film archiving.

asr-004229
03:47:19.660 --> 03:47:20.940
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: For Fiscal Year 2027,

asr-004230
03:47:20.940 --> 03:47:28.180
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: the FDCP proposed a budget of P311,743 million.

asr-004231
03:47:28.940 --> 03:47:31.900
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: It is P55.606 million,

asr-004232
03:47:32.240 --> 03:47:43.660
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: or 15.14% lower compared to the Fiscal Year 2026 budget of P367.349 million.

asr-004233
03:47:44.340 --> 03:47:46.860
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Speaker, my dear colleagues,

asr-004234
03:47:46.860 --> 03:47:50.300
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: I solicit your kind support for the approval

asr-004235
03:47:50.300 --> 03:47:50.920
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: of the FDCP's budget for the Fiscal Year 2026.

asr-004236
03:47:50.920 --> 03:47:51.620
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: I also request the approval of the budget

asr-004237
03:47:51.620 --> 03:47:54.420
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: of the Film Development Council of the Philippines.

asr-004238
03:47:55.300 --> 03:47:58.780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: This representation is now ready for interpolation.

