Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: Mr. Speaker,

asr-004920
04:41:46.180 --> 04:41:47.140
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: for

asr-004921
04:41:47.140 --> 04:41:48.660
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: 2027, we have

