asr-005168
05:06:25.780 --> 05:06:35.900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Children, senior citizen, PWDs at mga kababaihan ay hindi lamang mga tinatawag nating generic beneficiaries,

asr-005169
05:06:36.240 --> 05:06:47.180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kundi tinatrato sila na specific groups na may specific climate risk at dapat may specific budget need din na nailalaan.

asr-005170
05:06:47.520 --> 05:06:54.440
