asr-005178
05:07:38.160 --> 05:07:48.240
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: Kasama din yung water natin para sa interagency meeting para ma-advance yung national adaptation plan at saka in coordination with the different LGUs.

asr-005179
05:07:48.660 --> 05:07:52.540
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: Meron namang mga series of meetings together with the Commission and the LGUs.

asr-005180
05:07:52.740 --> 05:07:53.280
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: Mr. Speaker.

asr-005181
05:07:54.900 --> 05:07:55.760
