asr-005185
05:08:13.420 --> 05:08:17.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Are we actively preparing project pipelines and evidence-based claims?

asr-005186
05:08:17.640 --> 05:08:25.240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Or are we simply waiting for international mechanisms to mature while communities continue to absorb the damage?

asr-005187
05:08:25.780 --> 05:08:27.380
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005188
05:08:27.540 --> 05:08:33.060
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: The Commission is currently having a negotiation and kasalipan yan sa development plan ng Commission.

asr-005189
05:08:33.500 --> 05:08:34.020
Rep. John Geesnell "Baba" Yap: Mr. Speaker.

asr-005190
05:08:34.740 --> 05:08:36.900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-005191
05:08:37.560 --> 05:08:45.740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: In closing, the issue before us is not whether climate change is real nor whether the Climate Change Commission has an important mandate.

asr-005192
05:08:46.220 --> 05:08:52.520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Those questions have already been settled by law, by science, and by the lived experiences of our people.

asr-005193
05:08:52.520 --> 05:08:55.520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: The issue before Congress is whether the FY2020...

asr-005194
05:08:55.780 --> 05:09:06.460
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ...FY2027 budget gives the Commission the resources, discipline, and accountability mechanisms needed to turn climate policy into protection on the ground.

asr-005195
05:09:06.460 --> 05:09:22.320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: The KBKP supports the provision of adequate funding for the Commission, but at the same time challenges it to demonstrate that their budget will not merely sustain an office,

asr-005196
05:09:22.660 --> 05:09:25.340
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: but strengthen the country's capacity to survive.

asr-005198
05:09:25.800 --> 05:09:31.900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: adapt and protect the most vulnerable communities from accelerating climate crisis.

asr-005199
05:09:32.820 --> 05:09:37.240
