05:34:11.940 --> 05:34:21.200
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, may we acknowledge the presence of the heads and officials of the Commission on the Filipino Language.

asr-005494
05:34:22.540 --> 05:34:37.060
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: They are Chairperson-Attorney Marites Barrios-Taran, Commissioner Carmelita Abduman, Commissioner Benjamin Mendilio Jr., and Chief Administrative Officer Salvador Sagadal.

asr-005495
05:34:37.060 --> 05:34:49.940
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: We acknowledge the presence of the heads and officials of the Commission on the Filipino Language, headed by Chairperson-Attorney Marites Barrios-Taran.

asr-005496
05:34:50.900 --> 05:34:52.700
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Welcome to the House of Representatives.

asr-005497
05:34:52.740 --> 05:34:55.780
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: You are the Leader.

asr-005498
05:34:57.320 --> 05:35:12.220
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Vice Chair Ed Christopher Go, Vice Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriations, to answer questions on the proposed budget of the Commission on the Filipino Language.

asr-005499
05:35:12.780 --> 05:35:16.660
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Honorable Vice Chair Ed Christopher Go is recognized.

asr-005500
05:35:18.660 --> 05:35:22.660
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, it is my privilege to sponsor the proposed budget of the Commission.

asr-005501
05:35:22.800 --> 05:35:49.740
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: ng Wikang Filipino for fiscal year 2027. The Komisyon sa Wikang Filipino carries the important mandate of preserving and promoting the Filipino language, as well as our other indigenous languages across the archipelago, languages that embody the soul of our people. The Commission's approved budget allocation for fiscal year 2027 is around 120 million, but the Commission has identified an additional 27.5 million

asr-005502
05:35:49.780 --> 05:35:52.120
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: For priority programs which are as follows.

asr-005503
05:35:52.740 --> 05:36:04.660
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Pagbuo ng otografiya para sa sampung matinding nanganganib na wika, pagtatayo ng limang bantayog wika, and implementation of the Filipino Sign Language Visual Communication Assessment for the Deaf.

asr-005504
05:36:06.620 --> 05:36:14.940
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, the Commission ng Wikang Filipino wishes that its budget allocation will be augmented for the proper implementation of its priority programs.

asr-005505
05:36:15.660 --> 05:36:21.920
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: These programs are important in ensuring that our languages remain alive, accessible, and responsive to the needs of our people.

asr-005506
05:36:21.920 --> 05:36:27.080
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: We are hopeful that the Commission's proposed additional funding will be given great consideration.

asr-005507
05:36:27.800 --> 05:36:30.300
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: We are ready to answer questions. Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005508
05:36:31.160 --> 05:36:31.880
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Majority Leader.

asr-005509
05:36:32.480 --> 05:36:43.340
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Renee Louise Co of Kabataan Partylist to interpellate as sponsor on the proposed budget of the Commission on the Filipino Language.

asr-005510
05:36:43.700 --> 05:36:46.840
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: The Honorable Renee Louise Co is recognized.

asr-005511
05:36:47.540 --> 05:36:49.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005512
05:36:49.760 --> 05:36:51.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good afternoon to our sponsor.

asr-005513
05:36:51.920 --> 05:37:00.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And to the Commission ng Wikang Filipino, will the gentleman yield to a couple of questions in relation to the budget of KWF?

asr-005514
05:37:00.640 --> 05:37:00.860
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes.

asr-005515
05:37:01.800 --> 05:37:03.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Good sponsor.

asr-005516
05:37:04.540 --> 05:37:19.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang tatanong natin ay tungkol po sa FSL unit na ginawa sa Commission sa Wikang Filipino, na ang pagbuo nito ay may basihan sa enactment ng Republic Act No. 11106, or the Filipino Sign Language Act.

asr-005517
05:37:19.160 --> 05:37:19.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay.

asr-005518
05:37:19.820 --> 05:37:21.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: By recognizing FSL as the...

asr-005519
05:37:21.920 --> 05:37:28.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: National and Official Sign Language of the country, it is a groundbreaking law even from an international perspective.

asr-005520
05:37:28.420 --> 05:37:41.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: It is also comprehensive in its scope of six language domains of education, justice, health, workplace, media, and all other public transactions, services, and facilities.

asr-005521
05:37:42.000 --> 05:37:51.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: It is likewise an unusual law, which accepts that the visual, spatial language used by Filipinos is true and legitimate.

asr-005522
05:37:51.120 --> 05:37:51.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And,

asr-005523
05:37:51.920 --> 05:37:53.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: par with spoken languages.

asr-005524
05:37:54.020 --> 05:37:55.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaya po, ang tanong natin dito,

asr-005525
05:37:56.400 --> 05:37:57.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-005526
05:37:58.480 --> 05:38:00.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: una, magkano po ba

asr-005527
05:38:00.320 --> 05:38:02.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang appropriated and

asr-005528
05:38:02.060 --> 05:38:04.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: obligated by the KWF

asr-005529
05:38:04.920 --> 05:38:06.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: since 2023

asr-005530
05:38:06.600 --> 05:38:08.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and prospectively

asr-005531
05:38:08.320 --> 05:38:10.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for 2027 para po

asr-005532
05:38:10.800 --> 05:38:12.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa FSL

asr-005533
05:38:12.360 --> 05:38:13.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: unit na ito?

asr-005534
05:38:21.920 --> 05:38:33.620
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, roughly around

asr-005535
05:38:33.620 --> 05:38:35.340
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: 3.1 million per year po.

asr-005536
05:38:37.320 --> 05:38:38.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: How much, Mr. Speaker?

asr-005537
05:38:39.100 --> 05:38:41.300
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Roughly around 3.1 million per year.

asr-005538
05:38:41.780 --> 05:38:43.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Per year. So, since

asr-005539
05:38:43.240 --> 05:38:45.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2023 up to

asr-005540
05:38:45.160 --> 05:38:47.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2027, wala pong pagbabago.

asr-005541
05:38:47.260 --> 05:38:49.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 3 million per year, more or less?

asr-005542
05:38:49.580 --> 05:38:50.900
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Nag-a-average po tayo

asr-005543
05:38:50.900 --> 05:38:51.760
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: ang data.

asr-005544
05:38:51.920 --> 05:38:55.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-005545
05:38:55.480 --> 05:38:57.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung maaari ay makasumiti po ng

asr-005546
05:38:57.060 --> 05:38:59.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: report para po doon

asr-005547
05:38:59.460 --> 05:39:00.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa breakdown

asr-005548
05:39:00.560 --> 05:39:03.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng pondo. But I'd like

asr-005549
05:39:03.180 --> 05:39:05.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to go in further

asr-005550
05:39:05.380 --> 05:39:07.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: detail, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-005551
05:39:08.220 --> 05:39:09.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magkano po ba

asr-005552
05:39:09.140 --> 05:39:10.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang nakalaan to support

asr-005553
05:39:10.760 --> 05:39:12.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the use of FSL

asr-005554
05:39:12.740 --> 05:39:14.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in early education?

asr-005555
05:39:14.680 --> 05:39:16.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na po sa engagements

asr-005556
05:39:16.380 --> 05:39:18.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with ECCDC.

asr-005557
05:39:19.060 --> 05:39:20.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At para rin po ma-address

asr-005558
05:39:20.900 --> 05:39:21.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung posibling

asr-005559
05:39:21.660 --> 05:39:22.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: language deprivation

asr-005560
05:39:22.960 --> 05:39:25.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: among those 0 to 7

asr-005561
05:39:25.800 --> 05:39:27.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: years old deaf children

asr-005562
05:39:27.420 --> 05:39:30.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na gusto nating

asr-005563
05:39:30.000 --> 05:39:31.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: maalala yan, yung

asr-005564
05:39:31.760 --> 05:39:33.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pag-ensure na

asr-005565
05:39:33.720 --> 05:39:35.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nade-develop yung kanilang language skills.

asr-005566
05:39:49.780 --> 05:39:50.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker,

asr-005567
05:39:50.700 --> 05:39:52.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: as of now po,

asr-005568
05:39:52.700 --> 05:39:54.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: wala pong budget na naka-allocate.

asr-005569
05:39:54.700 --> 05:39:56.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Wala pong budget na naka-allocate.

asr-005570
05:39:56.700 --> 05:39:58.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May I ask,

asr-005571
05:39:58.700 --> 05:40:00.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: why is this so?

asr-005572
05:40:00.700 --> 05:40:02.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, according

asr-005573
05:40:02.700 --> 05:40:04.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: to nasa wishlist

asr-005574
05:40:04.700 --> 05:40:06.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: po nila, but then hindi po

asr-005575
05:40:06.700 --> 05:40:08.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: nalagyan ng budget.

asr-005576
05:40:08.700 --> 05:40:10.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May mga ibang taon po bang may budget

asr-005577
05:40:10.700 --> 05:40:12.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pong nakalaan dito?

asr-005578
05:40:14.700 --> 05:40:16.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Ever since, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005579
05:40:16.700 --> 05:40:18.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: wala pong budget na

asr-005580
05:40:18.700 --> 05:40:20.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: na-allocate dito.

asr-005582
05:40:35.700 --> 05:40:37.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, sa early education,

asr-005583
05:40:37.700 --> 05:40:39.940
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: wala pa po, since

asr-005584
05:40:39.940 --> 05:40:41.940
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: wala pa pong na-budget.

asr-005585
05:40:41.940 --> 05:40:43.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-005586
05:40:43.420 --> 05:40:45.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nakaka-alarma po yun, dahil

asr-005587
05:40:45.420 --> 05:40:47.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sayang naman kung binigay

asr-005588
05:40:47.420 --> 05:40:49.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa KWF yung mandatong ito.

asr-005589
05:40:49.420 --> 05:40:50.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At,

asr-005590
05:40:50.700 --> 05:41:00.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kinikilala ng batas ang pangailangan nito pero hindi po napupondohan sa kasaysayan ng pagkakaroon ng ganitong endeavor at ganitong pagkilala

asr-005591
05:41:00.440 --> 05:41:09.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung paano nahahawakan ng mga bata, yung FSL, bilang tool to express themselves.

asr-005592
05:41:10.880 --> 05:41:20.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magkano naman po ang nakalaan o nakalaan sa kasaysayan sa paggamit ng FSL sa higher education?

asr-005593
05:41:20.700 --> 05:41:28.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Para maka-coordinate ng support for the accessibility needs of deaf youth for college enrollment, especially in SUCs.

asr-005594
05:41:28.920 --> 05:41:32.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kasama na rin po yung UP pero ang iba pa rin mga universidad din sana.

asr-005595
05:41:38.540 --> 05:41:41.180
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Sadly po, Mr. Speaker, wala rin po.

asr-005596
05:41:41.700 --> 05:41:43.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa kasaysayan din nito, wala?

asr-005597
05:41:44.800 --> 05:41:46.220
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005598
05:41:46.220 --> 05:41:46.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay.

asr-005599
05:41:47.540 --> 05:41:50.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Paano naman po ang use of FSL?

asr-005600
05:41:50.700 --> 05:41:59.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: FSL in media, in coordination, monitoring, and overall engagement with the MTRCV, DepEd, and ECCDC.

asr-005601
05:42:01.080 --> 05:42:09.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: For example, sa pagbuo ng minimum standards for the National Information and Communication Policy for the Deaf and Filipino Sign Language.

asr-005602
05:42:10.480 --> 05:42:12.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po bang nakalaan ditong pondo?

asr-005604
05:42:20.700 --> 05:42:24.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Unfortunately po, Mr. Speaker, wala rin pong nakalagay na budget.

asr-005605
05:42:25.020 --> 05:42:27.280
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: But kasama rin po ito sa budget request.

asr-005606
05:42:29.160 --> 05:42:43.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Paano naman po kung ang pagpinansa or pagfinans ng National Council for Children's Television para po maging platform ito ng alternative learning systems, lalo na ng mga kabataan?

asr-005607
05:42:43.380 --> 05:42:44.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Wala rin po bang pondo dito?

asr-005622
05:43:21.800 --> 05:43:24.100
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: So wala rin po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005623
05:43:24.160 --> 05:43:29.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This is the case for, for example, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026?

asr-005624
05:43:29.900 --> 05:43:30.920
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005625
05:43:30.920 --> 05:43:47.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro ang panghuli, Mr. Speaker, for implementation, evaluation of policies and guidelines for the creation of disaster-related advisories, announcements, information campaigns, crisis advisories,

asr-005626
05:43:47.700 --> 05:44:00.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na sana accessible for deaf viewers, including deaf children, na dahil nga hindi po nila as naririnig yung mga announcements kung ito po ay delivered in teams,

asr-005627
05:44:00.920 --> 05:44:13.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: TV, or in announcements, makikita sana in, na may FSL practitioner gumagawa nito, may nakalaan po bang pondo, may ganoon po bang programa na naginawa ang KWF?

asr-005628
05:44:18.540 --> 05:44:26.280
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, we agree with you, but ang pinakakasya lang po nila is yung kanilang 3.1 million for all their programs.

asr-005629
05:44:27.760 --> 05:44:30.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, is this also the case?

asr-005630
05:44:30.920 --> 05:44:46.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This is for addressing the needs of deaf children and youth in the BARM, historically na bababa talaga yung pondo dito, pero dumadami din po yung poverty incidents, education crisis sa children in BARM.

asr-005631
05:44:47.560 --> 05:44:48.400
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005632
05:44:49.840 --> 05:44:59.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, nakakalungkot na marinig na ganoon po kakaunti ang pondo na hindi po nagagawa yung mga sanang naaabot.

asr-005633
05:45:00.000 --> 05:45:09.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga accessibility services na inaasahan natin yung FSL unit ng KWF na makakapagbigay ng serbisyo.

asr-005634
05:45:10.480 --> 05:45:17.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang huli na lang pong tanong, ano-ano po ba ang mga nagawang programa at aktibitad ng KWF para sa deaf children and youth?

asr-005635
05:45:17.820 --> 05:45:20.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Katuwang ng Council for the Welfare of Children.

asr-005636
05:45:31.400 --> 05:45:50.200
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, sa kasalukuyan po, meron po silang IAC na regular pong nagmi-meet. And yung funding po na ginagamit dito ay nanggagaling lang din po doon sa 3.1 million na allocation po.

asr-005637
05:45:50.200 --> 05:46:00.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sir Speaker, kung maaari na lang po lahat ng mga naibigay na sagot sa atin, pati rin po yung mga aktibidad na para nakasentro sa kabataan at sa bata,

asr-005638
05:46:00.800 --> 05:46:20.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: maibigay bilang report from the KWF sa opisina ng representasyon na ito, sana po sa lunes ay available na para po magamit natin sa mga ating paghahain ng mga requests for additional budget, if any.

asr-005639
05:46:20.200 --> 05:46:23.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At yung sinabi pong wish list, kung pwede rin pong maibigay.

asr-005640
05:46:23.760 --> 05:46:25.100
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Noted. And this, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005641
05:46:26.320 --> 05:46:27.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-005642
05:46:28.140 --> 05:46:33.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa huli, sumusuporta tayo sa paglaan ng sapat na pondo para sa pagpapaunlad ng ating mga wika.

asr-005643
05:46:33.960 --> 05:46:40.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang pambansang wikang Filipino man yan, o ang marami nating wikang katutubo, maging ang Filipino Sign Language.

asr-005644
05:46:41.480 --> 05:46:48.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sana nakikita natin kung paano nagagawa ng KWF yung kanilang mandato sa mga programa

asr-005645
05:46:48.680 --> 05:46:56.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na pwede nilang gawin para po maibigay itong mga serbisyo, lalo na po sa mga kabata, ang pinaka-nangangailangan nito.

asr-005646
05:46:57.540 --> 05:47:04.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We will lobby at the proper time for the increase in the budget of the programs of KWF, especially for our deaf youth and children.

asr-005647
05:47:05.460 --> 05:47:13.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Though, let it be on public record, show na maraming inaasahan sa KWF at marami rin pong hindi nahatid po ito sa ngayon.

asr-005648
05:47:13.940 --> 05:47:17.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, for yielding.

asr-005649
05:47:18.680 --> 05:47:20.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: A few minutes of your time to answer our questions.

asr-005650
05:47:21.760 --> 05:47:22.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

asr-005651
05:47:23.460 --> 05:47:24.120
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Majority Leader.

asr-005652
05:47:25.120 --> 05:47:34.220
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate, I move to recognize Representative Antonio Tinio of ACT Teachers Partylist.

asr-005653
05:47:35.080 --> 05:47:38.780
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Honorable Antonio Tinio is recognized. To interpellate the sponsor.

asr-005654
05:47:48.680 --> 05:47:52.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005655
05:47:53.360 --> 05:47:59.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ilang mga katanungan po tungkol sa budget ng Commission sa Wikang Filipino.

asr-005656
05:48:00.560 --> 05:48:05.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa budget, sa General Appropriations Bill, nakalagay dito Commission on the Filipino Language.

asr-005657
05:48:08.880 --> 05:48:17.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 115.714 million pesos ang nihinging budget. Napakaliit na budget.

asr-005658
05:48:18.680 --> 05:48:38.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa isang komisyon na napakahalaga ng mandato, yan ang pagpapaunlad, pagpapalago, pagpapalaganap sa gamit ng Pilipino bilang pambansang wika at mga wikang Pilipino.

asr-005659
05:48:38.800 --> 05:48:45.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang realidad po, isang multilingual na lipunan ng ating bansa.

asr-005660
05:48:45.800 --> 05:48:48.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngunit, tila hindi pa kinikilala

asr-005661
05:48:48.680 --> 05:48:55.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at umaangkop ang mga institusyon ng ating lipunan sa realidad na ito.

asr-005662
05:48:56.420 --> 05:49:05.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mula sa mga paaralan, sa mass media, at unang-una na ang gobyerno. Multilingual tayo.

asr-005663
05:49:06.560 --> 05:49:15.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, dapat umangkop ang gobyerno at ang budget para dito.

asr-005664
05:49:15.480 --> 05:49:18.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, tingnan po.

asr-005665
05:49:18.680 --> 05:49:36.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tingnan po natin yung budget, 115 million pesos, at isa ang programa, Filipino and Other Philippine Languages Development Program.

asr-005666
05:49:39.220 --> 05:49:42.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede po bang paliwanag ng sponsor?

asr-005667
05:49:43.520 --> 05:49:47.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano-ano po ba ang mga programa at ano ang ginagawa?

asr-005668
05:49:48.680 --> 05:50:00.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nang KWF para isulong ka ang kanyang mandato kaugnay sa wikang Pilipino at mga wika ng Pilipinas.

asr-005669
05:50:01.220 --> 05:50:03.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano-ano yung ginagawa nila under this program?

asr-005670
05:50:12.720 --> 05:50:17.800
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, pagbuo po ng otografiya, pagbuo po ng mga glosaryo,

asr-005671
05:50:18.680 --> 05:50:28.040
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: diksyonaryo, pananaliksik, aral, at sa etno-linguistic communities.

asr-005672
05:50:28.560 --> 05:50:38.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Anong mga wika po ang sinusuportahan ng Komisyon sa Wikang Pilipino? Aling mga wika yan?

asr-005673
05:50:39.380 --> 05:50:42.580
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Meron po tayong 135 po na wika.

asr-005674
05:50:42.920 --> 05:50:47.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo, 135. Pero, gustuhin man natin.

asr-005675
05:50:48.680 --> 05:50:57.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Magpakatotoo tayo, hindi natututukan ng KWF ang lahat ng wikang yan.

asr-005676
05:50:57.120 --> 05:51:08.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung mga programa, lalo na para sa proposed budget, ang actual na budget ay 85.3 million pesos lamang.

asr-005677
05:51:09.820 --> 05:51:14.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ang mga kongkretong gagawin yan sa 2027?

asr-005678
05:51:14.920 --> 05:51:15.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you very much.

asr-005679
05:51:18.680 --> 05:51:20.280
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Ang pinag-protectan po ay 10 wika.

asr-005680
05:51:20.600 --> 05:51:23.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 10 wika? Ano-ano po yun?

asr-005681
05:51:23.200 --> 05:51:24.620
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Ang pinakamalubhang nanganganib.

asr-005682
05:51:25.220 --> 05:51:26.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano-ano po yun?

asr-005683
05:51:40.140 --> 05:51:44.780
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, noted on this, we will let the agency submit to the Committee for Media Compliance.

asr-005684
05:51:46.180 --> 05:51:47.240
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Isusumiti na lang po namin.

asr-005685
05:51:47.280 --> 05:51:48.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ay, isusumiti po. Okay.

asr-005686
05:51:48.680 --> 05:51:49.600
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Pero, ito po.

asr-005687
05:51:53.600 --> 05:52:12.300
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Isa po ay buniking binukignon, bukidnon, mahagat, amatikanon, inata, inete, kabalyanon, kaluyanen, karulano, malaynon, at orohanon.

asr-005688
05:52:13.000 --> 05:52:18.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, mukhang ang focus po na binabanggit nyo ngayon ay yung mga endangered.

asr-005689
05:52:18.680 --> 05:52:20.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang pinag-protecting na wika, ganun po ba?

asr-005690
05:52:21.240 --> 05:52:21.720
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Tama po.

asr-005691
05:52:22.260 --> 05:52:24.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At karamihan ay nasa Mindanao.

asr-005692
05:52:25.380 --> 05:52:29.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mga wika ng indigenous groups, tama po ba?

asr-005693
05:52:31.560 --> 05:52:32.220
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Tama po.

asr-005694
05:52:32.220 --> 05:52:48.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Gusto lang po natin malaman, ano yung particular na budget at programa kung meron man ang Commission sa Wikang Filipino para sa Filipino Sign Language?

asr-005695
05:52:48.680 --> 05:53:08.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nabanggit po ito ng unang nag-interpelate, si representative ko, nais ko pong banggitin din, kaya po ako nagtatanong dahil isang, ako po ang principal author ng Republic Act 11106, Filipino Sign Language Act.

asr-005696
05:53:09.520 --> 05:53:14.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At minamandato po doon, ang lead agency dito ay ang Commission sa Wikang Filipino.

asr-005697
05:53:14.940 --> 05:53:18.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, magkano ang ilalaan?

asr-005698
05:53:18.680 --> 05:53:31.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang pondo ng KWF para sa implementasyon ng Filipino Sign Language Act. Kung meron man.

asr-005699
05:53:37.140 --> 05:53:40.940
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: 4.7 million po for 2027.

asr-005700
05:53:40.940 --> 05:53:48.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4.7 million pesos. At para saan po yan? Ano po ang specific na gamit dito?

asr-005701
05:53:48.680 --> 05:53:51.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang makalit na halaga na po. Para saan po yan?

asr-005702
05:53:53.300 --> 05:53:59.020
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: For the interpreting systems po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005703
05:54:00.160 --> 05:54:04.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Interpreting. So, FSL, Filipino Sign Language Interpreting.

asr-005704
05:54:06.340 --> 05:54:06.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-005705
05:54:06.620 --> 05:54:06.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-005706
05:54:07.140 --> 05:54:08.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-005707
05:54:12.340 --> 05:54:18.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sapat na po ba yan? Ang pondo na yan ay sapat na para ma-fulfill ang managin?

asr-005708
05:54:18.680 --> 05:54:22.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Andato sa KWF?

asr-005709
05:54:22.780 --> 05:54:27.720
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, hindi po ito sapat. Ang tutuusin. Pero pinakakasa po ng Commission.

asr-005710
05:54:28.260 --> 05:54:31.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi sapat. Magkano ang dagdag na kailangan ng FSL?

asr-005711
05:54:33.620 --> 05:54:35.680
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: 27 million po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005712
05:54:35.880 --> 05:54:38.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 27 million.

asr-005713
05:54:38.540 --> 05:54:39.100
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005714
05:54:39.100 --> 05:54:42.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 27 million ang kailangan. 4 million lang ang nakalaan.

asr-005716
05:54:46.920 --> 05:54:48.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Handa po ba

asr-005717
05:54:48.680 --> 05:55:00.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At nagsubmit po ba ang FSL ng Kaukulang Request for Institutional Amendment sa Committee on Appropriations para mapunuan ito?

asr-005718
05:55:01.740 --> 05:55:02.700
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005719
05:55:02.700 --> 05:55:09.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, may submission po. So, in other words, maaaring matalakay ito sa iko-convene na BARC.

asr-005720
05:55:09.840 --> 05:55:10.140
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005721
05:55:10.320 --> 05:55:14.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Budget Amendments Review Subcommittee ng Committee on Appropriations.

asr-005722
05:55:14.980 --> 05:55:17.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, okay. Asahan niyo po na susuportahan po natin.

asr-005723
05:55:17.500 --> 05:55:18.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For as long as na-submit niyo yung

asr-005724
05:55:18.680 --> 05:55:22.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: institutional amendment, ay susuportahan po natin ito.

asr-005725
05:55:22.980 --> 05:55:29.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mabanggit ko na rin po na bilang bahagi ng implementation ng Filipino Sign Language Act,

asr-005726
05:55:29.680 --> 05:55:36.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron pong dalawang deaf officers ang KWF.

asr-005727
05:55:36.500 --> 05:55:40.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero mga job order or contract of service.

asr-005728
05:55:41.540 --> 05:55:43.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba? Do you confirm this?

asr-005729
05:55:44.220 --> 05:55:45.040
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005730
05:55:45.040 --> 05:55:45.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-005731
05:55:48.680 --> 05:55:58.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala po bang proposal ang KWF para mabigyan ng plantilla positions,

asr-005732
05:55:58.160 --> 05:56:03.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: mag-create ng plantilla positions for the positions of deaf officers?

asr-005733
05:56:04.000 --> 05:56:05.980
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Obviously, meron po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005734
05:56:06.400 --> 05:56:08.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kailangan. Para ma-implement yung batas, kailangan.

asr-005735
05:56:08.940 --> 05:56:17.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, meron po. Kasama po ba dun sa inyong proposal na 27 million ang plantilla positions para sa dalawang ito?

asr-005736
05:56:18.680 --> 05:56:19.520
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005737
05:56:20.180 --> 05:56:23.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes. Okay. So, salamat po kung gayon.

asr-005738
05:56:24.560 --> 05:56:35.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At asahan po ninyo na susuportahan natin ang mungkahing Institutional Amendments for additional 27 million.

asr-005739
05:56:35.040 --> 05:56:44.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napakaliit na halaga na lang po ito para sa Filipino deaf, mga kababayan nating bingi sa buong bansa.

asr-005740
05:56:45.960 --> 05:56:48.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At now, let me move on.

asr-005741
05:56:48.680 --> 05:56:49.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let me move on to another topic.

asr-005742
05:56:50.500 --> 05:57:01.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito po ay sumulat po sa amin at kahit po sa, alam ko, kahit sa commission kay KWF Chair,

asr-005743
