Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit nakaipit pa rin yung libro?

asr-005761
05:59:20.680 --> 05:59:25.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ito? Hindi katanggap-tanggap. Kaya nga pinabawi yung memo eh, dahil censorship po ito.

asr-005762
05:59:26.640 --> 05:59:35.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And red tagging, wala namang basis para tawaging subersibo o red tagging.

asr-005763
05:59:36.140 --> 05:59:38.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang akda, red tag, ang akda.

asr-005764
05:59:39.000 --> 05:59:39.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang update dito?

asr-005765
05:59:41.540 --> 05:59:47.580
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, KWF will act on this after going through the ISO.

asr-005766
05:59:47.740 --> 05:59:49.800
