Rep. Gil "KabarangayJr" Acosta: I move to recognize Representative Presley C. De Jesus, Partylist, PHILRECA, for his interpellation.

asr-005989
06:18:22.300 --> 06:18:32.200
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentleman from PHILRECA Party-list, Honorable Presley De Jesus. If the sponsor is ready, you may start, sir.

asr-005997
06:18:32.240 --> 06:18:46.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. And of course, to the good sponsor who is my boss, not only an environmentalist, but also when it comes to energy, he's the master. Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Good morning, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005998
06:18:46.580 --> 06:19:11.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Good afternoon. Sorry. Question. Is the good sponsor aware that during the recent haze episode, some parts of the country recorded 24-hour PM2.5 levels of 48 and 46 micrograms per cubic meter on September 1 and 2?

asr-005999
06:19:11.120 --> 06:19:16.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Some parts recorded PM2.5 air quality index.

asr-006000
06:19:16.580 --> 06:19:23.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Readings ranging from 203 to 245 up to approximately 211.

asr-006001
06:19:26.740 --> 06:19:44.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, Mr. English Colleague, yung haze na yan, galing yan sa Indonesia. Ang tanging makakatanggal dyan, Mr. Speaker, isang malakas lang na ulan. Iyong ulan na ngayon eh. So ulan na yun. Kalimutan na natin muna yun.

asr-006002
06:19:45.740 --> 06:19:46.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Diba?

asr-006003
06:19:46.580 --> 06:19:49.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kung walang ulan, we have to worry.

asr-006004
06:19:50.240 --> 06:19:55.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. I told you. Magdating dyan, magaling talaga si Don Pipito.

asr-006005
06:19:58.460 --> 06:20:02.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Follow up. As a brief context, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006006
06:20:03.960 --> 06:20:14.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: These readings are significant because PM2.5 consists of very fine particles that can penetrate deep into the lungs and enter the bloodstream.

asr-006007
06:20:14.480 --> 06:20:16.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: With cardiovascular and...

asr-006008
06:20:16.580 --> 06:20:17.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Respiratory effects.

asr-006009
06:20:17.860 --> 06:20:33.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, to clarify those readings, exceeded the 35 micrograms per cubic meter, 24-hour limits cited by Environmental Management Bureau under DAO 2020-14.

asr-006010
06:20:35.640 --> 06:20:37.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But again, you mentioned...

asr-006011
06:20:37.860 --> 06:20:43.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Na ba yun, Mr. Speaker? We are aware of that. 25 micrograms.

asr-006012
06:20:43.860 --> 06:20:46.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, talagang mabigat yan.

asr-006013
06:20:46.580 --> 06:20:51.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pag it subsists for 24 hours, eh kawawa naman tayo dito sa Manila.

asr-006014
06:20:51.680 --> 06:21:00.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That's why may warning na tayo na habang nandyan yung haze na yan, but the 25 micrograms, eh, only persisted for a while.

asr-006015
06:21:01.420 --> 06:21:06.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: It did not last long. So pagkatapos ng ulan, heavy rain will wipe it out.

asr-006016
06:21:07.000 --> 06:21:13.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I suppose the rains are welcome in order to answer for your concerns.

asr-006017
06:21:13.300 --> 06:21:16.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I told you, Mr. Speaker, it's good.

asr-006018
06:21:17.480 --> 06:21:20.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Follow-up question, Mr. Speaker, this yung sponsor.

asr-006019
06:21:20.940 --> 06:21:25.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Those readings are classified as very unhealthy. Is it true?

asr-006020
06:21:26.240 --> 06:21:26.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tama.

asr-006021
06:21:28.160 --> 06:21:30.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Very unhealthy yan. Tama yan.

asr-006022
06:21:33.260 --> 06:21:44.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And DNR-EMB attributed at least part of this episode to possible transboundary smoke from forests and landfires in Kalimantan, Indonesia.

asr-006023
06:21:46.280 --> 06:21:46.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kalimantan.

asr-006024
06:21:46.580 --> 06:21:49.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kalimantan is not so much, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006025
06:21:50.300 --> 06:21:53.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang sunog talaga sa Indonesia, nagsisimula yan doon.

asr-006026
06:21:53.180 --> 06:21:59.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi hanggang ngayon, nagpuputol pa sila ng second growth para magtanim ng klapasawit, yung palm oil.

asr-006027
06:22:00.300 --> 06:22:04.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung ang hangin ngayon papunta rin sa atin, eh talagang magsasaper tayo.

asr-006028
06:22:04.380 --> 06:22:06.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That's why nga, we are praying always for the rain.

asr-006029
06:22:06.800 --> 06:22:12.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But your sighting of 25 micrograms, mabigat yun.

asr-006030
06:22:12.040 --> 06:22:15.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, talagang hindi namin pa nandito ang DNR.

asr-006031
06:22:15.120 --> 06:22:16.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya, Mr. Speaker,

asr-006032
06:22:16.580 --> 06:22:17.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: distinguished sponsor,

asr-006033
06:22:17.980 --> 06:22:24.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: tagdagan natin, nakita mo yung budget ng DNR, napakaliit para sa pag-safeguard ng ating kapaligiran,

asr-006034
06:22:24.560 --> 06:22:27.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yung ating hangin na hinihinga.

asr-006035
06:22:27.600 --> 06:22:28.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, tulungan mo naman ito.

asr-006036
06:22:30.060 --> 06:22:33.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Imbis na lumaki, noong 2025, 26 lang.

asr-006037
06:22:33.220 --> 06:22:34.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 2026, naging 27.

asr-006038
06:22:35.740 --> 06:22:39.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At 2024 pala, 2025, naging 26.

asr-006039
06:22:39.900 --> 06:22:43.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngayon, 2026 tayo, naging 27.

asr-006040
06:22:43.100 --> 06:22:46.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa 2027, 28 lang ang hinihingi.

asr-006041
06:22:46.580 --> 06:22:48.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sos, napakaliit nito.

asr-006042
06:22:48.960 --> 06:22:52.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Paano naman yung ating mga kababayan sa buong Pilipinas,

asr-006043
06:22:53.020 --> 06:22:57.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: pag ganyan ang nag-persist yan ng dalawang araw, maraming talagang magkakasakit, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006044
06:22:58.520 --> 06:22:59.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006045
06:23:00.280 --> 06:23:03.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And I agree 100% to the distinguished sponsor.

asr-006046
06:23:04.620 --> 06:23:08.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My follow-up question, in fact, EMB Region 12 itself acknowledged

asr-006047
06:23:08.980 --> 06:23:16.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: that at the time, only its Coronadal station could analyze PM 2.5.

asr-006048
06:23:16.320 --> 06:23:23.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Meaning, that similarly elevated pollution in other areas could be difficult to detect or quantify.

asr-006049
06:23:24.400 --> 06:23:26.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is this accurate, Mr. Speaker?

asr-006050
06:23:28.440 --> 06:23:33.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron silang DNR in order to warn our populace.

asr-006051
06:23:33.920 --> 06:23:35.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron silang daily advisory.

asr-006052
06:23:36.200 --> 06:23:39.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung talagang ganyan, pag lumabas ka, eh, maglagay ka na ng maskara.

asr-006053
06:23:40.620 --> 06:23:43.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung hindi mo mapigilan lumabas ng bahay.

asr-006054
06:23:43.360 --> 06:23:46.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero kung lumabas ka lang, makaosyoso ka lang.

asr-006055
06:23:46.320 --> 06:23:49.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Huwag ka na manigarilyo sa labas. Huwag ka na manigarilyo sa labas.

asr-006056
06:23:49.660 --> 06:23:51.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mas grabe yun, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006057
06:23:52.700 --> 06:23:58.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Distinguished colleague, pigilan natin yan na yung advisories ng DNR sundin natin

asr-006058
06:23:58.420 --> 06:24:02.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: para huwag na lumabas yung pag may ganyan na talagang mataas na yung pollutants.

asr-006059
06:24:02.980 --> 06:24:03.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006060
06:24:04.020 --> 06:24:06.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-006061
06:24:07.260 --> 06:24:10.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, the issue presented here

asr-006062
06:24:10.580 --> 06:24:15.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: is not merely whether DNR can record deteriorating air quality,

asr-006063
06:24:16.320 --> 06:24:21.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: but whether its monitoring network is sufficiently extensive

asr-006064
06:24:21.320 --> 06:24:26.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and whether dangerous readings actually trigger timely public warnings,

asr-006065
06:24:27.580 --> 06:24:30.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: health coordination, and pollution control measures.

asr-006066
06:24:30.700 --> 06:24:32.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Would the distinguished sponsor agree with me?

asr-006067
06:24:35.340 --> 06:24:42.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: As of 12 o'clock today, yung Kutabato na talagang doon ang malapit masyado pumunta yung haze.

asr-006068
06:24:42.660 --> 06:24:44.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, fair na yung...

asr-006069
06:24:44.660 --> 06:24:45.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Fair na yung...

asr-006070
06:24:46.320 --> 06:24:47.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kapaligiran.

asr-006071
06:24:47.840 --> 06:24:50.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Medyo makakahinga na sila doon ng tama.

asr-006072
06:24:50.760 --> 06:24:53.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Only in Mindanao area, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006073
06:24:54.320 --> 06:24:54.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mindanao area.

asr-006074
06:24:54.740 --> 06:24:56.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Aba't in Metro Manila, wala na po.

asr-006075
06:24:56.720 --> 06:24:59.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala masyado na ito. The rains will wipe it out.

asr-006076
06:25:00.600 --> 06:25:01.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Through rain.

asr-006077
06:25:02.540 --> 06:25:03.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That's why we need the rain.

asr-006078
06:25:04.480 --> 06:25:04.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

asr-006079
06:25:05.580 --> 06:25:05.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Follow up.

asr-006080
06:25:06.020 --> 06:25:11.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: When these thresholds were breached, what specific DNR protocol was activated?

asr-006081
06:25:11.760 --> 06:25:15.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can the good sponsor please inform us?

asr-006082
06:25:15.040 --> 06:25:22.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: To the specific of the protocol, the date it was activated, the public health advisories issued,

asr-006083
06:25:23.200 --> 06:25:26.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the LGUs formally noticed, whether DOH was formally noticed,

asr-006084
06:25:27.500 --> 06:25:32.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and whether DNR initiated any action under the Asian Transboundary Haze Mechanism.

asr-006085
06:25:33.240 --> 06:25:36.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito po ba eh, well coordinated po among our agencies?

asr-006086
06:25:36.560 --> 06:25:40.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, pinapalaganap natin yung information, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006087
06:25:40.840 --> 06:25:42.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Radio, sa TV,

asr-006089
06:25:43.420 --> 06:25:45.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: continuous naman yung air quality,

asr-006090
06:25:45.040 --> 06:25:47.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: quality monitoring from the 10 in the evening,

asr-006091
06:25:48.600 --> 06:25:50.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ayun, naging 2.5 na ngayon.

asr-006092
06:25:51.320 --> 06:25:54.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tapos yung mga daily, through daily advisories,

asr-006093
06:25:54.480 --> 06:25:56.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and radio programs,

asr-006094
06:25:57.400 --> 06:25:59.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: na-advise natin yung general public.

asr-006095
06:26:01.040 --> 06:26:05.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-006096
06:26:05.520 --> 06:26:13.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In connection with this, the NEP sets a 2027 target of 80% of highly urbanized cities

asr-006097
06:26:13.160 --> 06:26:15.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and major urban centers.

asr-006098
06:26:15.040 --> 06:26:19.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Within the Ambient Air Quality Guideline Values.

asr-006099
06:26:20.020 --> 06:26:23.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The reported actual in 2025 was 71%.

asr-006100
06:26:23.720 --> 06:26:26.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is this correct, Mr. Speaker?

asr-006101
06:26:26.580 --> 06:26:27.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tama po yan.

asr-006102
06:26:36.500 --> 06:26:43.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung monitoring ng DNR, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, ambient lang, meaning to say, outside lang talaga.

asr-006103
06:26:44.160 --> 06:26:44.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-006104
06:26:45.040 --> 06:26:48.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, can you explain what's this 80% compliance means?

asr-006105
06:26:49.240 --> 06:26:51.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What is the denominator?

asr-006106
06:26:52.520 --> 06:26:59.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That is, how many highly urbanized cities and major urban centers are covered by this indicator?

asr-006107
06:26:59.620 --> 06:27:04.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How many cities does 80% actually represent?

asr-006108
06:27:04.820 --> 06:27:09.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And which cities failed the standard in the latest complete reporting year?

asr-006113
06:27:23.280 --> 06:27:30.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, hindi pa sila nakaka-100% pero information, 70% pa lang.

asr-006114
06:27:31.120 --> 06:27:31.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 70%?

asr-006115
06:27:32.700 --> 06:27:37.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Which cities po ang hindi pa failed po?

asr-006116
06:27:38.060 --> 06:27:42.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Do you have the cities who failed this test?

asr-006117
06:27:44.020 --> 06:27:44.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron pa tayo?

asr-006118
06:27:45.040 --> 06:27:51.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: As far as the monitoring, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, yung kanilang mga monitoring aparatos, okay naman yun.

asr-006119
06:27:51.660 --> 06:27:55.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya lang, siyempre, they cannot be present everywhere.

asr-006120
06:27:55.740 --> 06:27:57.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At saka yung haze, we cannot determine.

asr-006121
06:27:58.160 --> 06:28:02.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: It depends kung alin ang umiiral na hangin, habagat ba o amihan ba.

asr-006122
06:28:03.080 --> 06:28:04.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngayon, habagat pa tayo eh.

asr-006123
06:28:04.340 --> 06:28:06.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Before the end of the month, titira na yung amihan.

asr-006124
06:28:07.180 --> 06:28:07.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pababa na.

asr-006125
06:28:08.160 --> 06:28:10.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Doon na naman sa amin, sa Palawan, dadalhin yung haze.

asr-006126
06:28:11.840 --> 06:28:13.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya, mabuti na lang.

asr-006127
06:28:13.560 --> 06:28:16.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mabuti na lang, meron kami arplano sa Palawan.

asr-006128
06:28:16.880 --> 06:28:17.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Takbo ko agad ako dito.

asr-006129
06:28:18.400 --> 06:28:21.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya, nandito sa Kongreso, walang masyadong haze dito, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006130
06:28:22.820 --> 06:28:24.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-006131
06:28:25.400 --> 06:28:28.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Now, let me go to water resources, resource issues.

asr-006132
06:28:29.440 --> 06:28:36.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can the good sponsor confirm that the Angat Dam fell into its minimum operating level this year?

asr-006133
06:28:37.540 --> 06:28:38.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Angat Dam?

asr-006134
06:28:38.460 --> 06:28:39.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Angat Dam.

asr-006135
06:28:39.420 --> 06:28:40.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napuno na nga yun eh.

asr-006136
06:28:40.520 --> 06:28:43.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nung ilang linggo tayo.

asr-006137
06:28:43.560 --> 06:28:44.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napuno na nga yun.

asr-006138
06:28:44.600 --> 06:28:45.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nag-release nga sila ng tubig.

asr-006139
06:28:46.020 --> 06:28:51.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya, nagreklamo si Kongresman Bundok na nagbaha doon sa Pampanga.

asr-006140
06:28:51.700 --> 06:28:54.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dahil doon, hindi mo ba alam yun, Mr. Speaker, Kongres?

asr-006141
06:28:55.280 --> 06:29:02.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, hindi pala totoo itong report ko.

asr-006142
06:29:02.840 --> 06:29:04.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Talagang nag-overflow pa.

asr-006143
06:29:04.940 --> 06:29:06.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nag-overflow nga, kaya nagbukas eh.

asr-006144
06:29:06.640 --> 06:29:09.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya nag-alit si Kongresman Bundok dito, nagmamuras.

asr-006145
06:29:10.560 --> 06:29:12.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pinasipay ko lang, huwag ka na mag-alit.

asr-006146
06:29:12.400 --> 06:29:13.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi ulan man yan.

asr-006147
06:29:13.560 --> 06:29:19.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi natin pwedeng pigilin yung ulan, Mr. Speaker, Mr. English Colleague.

asr-006148
06:29:20.540 --> 06:29:23.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I was telling you, Mr. Speaker, it's good.

asr-006149
06:29:25.060 --> 06:29:34.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Lastly, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, what reservoir elevation does the government currently target for December 31, 2026?

asr-006150
06:29:34.460 --> 06:29:41.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And what is NWRB's current assessment of the probability or risk category for supply restrictions

asr-006151
06:29:41.700 --> 06:29:43.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: during the 2026?

asr-006152
06:29:43.560 --> 06:29:45.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 2027, dry season.

asr-006153
06:29:54.500 --> 06:29:59.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At least ngayon, Mr. Speaker, Mr. English Colleague, 212 meters para.

asr-006154
06:30:00.000 --> 06:30:03.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But nung before sa zona, 150 lang yun.

asr-006155
06:30:04.400 --> 06:30:05.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Grabe talaga ulan.

asr-006156
06:30:06.480 --> 06:30:11.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, Mr. Speaker, during the dry season, that would be suffice?

asr-006157
06:30:13.660 --> 06:30:15.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon naman ang kabantay doon.

asr-006158
06:30:15.180 --> 06:30:18.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi naman yung payagan na talagang mag-overflow yun.

asr-006159
06:30:18.240 --> 06:30:20.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Baka sirain pa yung dam na yan. Napakasayang.

asr-006160
06:30:21.400 --> 06:30:26.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tsaka pag-alita na naman ni Congresswoman Gundok si San Miguel sa airport niya.

asr-006161
06:30:27.900 --> 06:30:29.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006162
06:30:30.000 --> 06:30:34.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsor, in connection to this, Mr. Speaker, the department's program,

asr-006163
06:30:35.700 --> 06:30:40.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the NWRB Water Resource Vulnerability and Sustainability Assessment Program,

asr-006164
06:30:41.120 --> 06:30:49.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: produce science-based information on water availability, water quality, groundwater, and climate risks.

asr-006165
06:30:50.120 --> 06:30:50.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is this correct?

asr-006166
06:30:52.180 --> 06:30:58.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kanyo, kanyo, Mr. Speaker, kanyo, distinguished colleague, yung water quality, yung question mo, kanyo.

asr-006167
06:30:58.040 --> 06:31:00.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I don't get it.

asr-006168
06:31:02.260 --> 06:31:04.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can you restate the question, please?

asr-006169
06:31:04.180 --> 06:31:04.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-006170
06:31:04.460 --> 06:31:16.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In connection to this, Mr. Speaker, the department's program, the NWRB Water Resources Vulnerability and Sustainability Assessment Program,

asr-006171
06:31:17.340 --> 06:31:25.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: produce science-based information on water availability, water quality, groundwater, and climate risks.

asr-006172
06:31:27.100 --> 06:31:27.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is this correct?

asr-006173
06:31:28.040 --> 06:31:29.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, that is correct.

asr-006174
06:31:29.940 --> 06:31:31.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That's done by NWRB.

asr-006175
06:31:33.320 --> 06:31:34.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In the person of...

asr-006176
06:31:36.260 --> 06:31:43.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Was this the program allocated approximately 137.3 million in 2026?

asr-006177
06:31:44.140 --> 06:31:46.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Napondono ba natin ng 2026 to?

asr-006178
06:31:48.400 --> 06:31:49.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes.

asr-006179
06:31:50.440 --> 06:31:53.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how about next year's budget?

asr-006180
06:31:53.300 --> 06:31:57.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Did we increase from 137 million?

asr-006181
06:31:58.040 --> 06:32:10.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Actually, NWRB is requesting for more, but because of the fiscal space, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, medyo nabawasan nga lahat eh.

asr-006182
06:32:10.840 --> 06:32:14.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, it went down from 137, it went down to 100.6 million?

asr-006183
06:32:15.400 --> 06:32:16.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, Mr. Speaker, yes.

asr-006184
06:32:16.740 --> 06:32:17.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What's the reason behind?

asr-006185
06:32:17.920 --> 06:32:23.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How come, as we know, DNR is very important and very close to my heart.

asr-006186
06:32:23.200 --> 06:32:24.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Bakit po bumaba?

asr-006187
06:32:25.300 --> 06:32:28.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How come it was reduced from 137?

asr-006188
06:32:28.040 --> 06:32:29.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: From 137 to 100 million.

asr-006189
06:32:30.960 --> 06:32:31.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ang budget?

asr-006190
06:32:35.940 --> 06:32:48.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: This is true all across the board, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, but yung in particular, NWRB, bumaba talaga from 132, naging 95 na lang, 0.999.

asr-006191
06:32:49.320 --> 06:32:50.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006192
06:32:51.260 --> 06:32:57.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, wala tayong magawa kung the executive has mandated everyone to reduce budget.

asr-006193
06:32:57.340 --> 06:32:58.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: They have to live with it.

asr-006194
06:32:59.300 --> 06:33:09.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maganda sana yung progressive na paket na yung gamit ng pera para matugunan lahat ng pangangailangan, but we have to heed the fiscal restraint.

asr-006195
06:33:10.140 --> 06:33:13.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pati NWRB, bumaba, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006196
06:33:14.020 --> 06:33:25.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, but again, meanwhile, the Water Resources Management Program increases from approximately 20 million to 50 million or 154.5%.

asr-006197
06:33:25.640 --> 06:33:27.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, baka dito napunta naman.

asr-006198
06:33:27.320 --> 06:33:29.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung pondo nabawas.

asr-006199
06:33:30.580 --> 06:33:34.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Because there's a difference of something like 30 million.

asr-006200
06:33:35.000 --> 06:33:35.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Are they correlated?

asr-006201
06:33:39.360 --> 06:33:43.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In the listing, there are water-related projects.

asr-006202
06:33:44.740 --> 06:33:47.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If I will enumerate, masyadong matagal po ito.

asr-006203
06:33:48.380 --> 06:33:55.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But, ginawa nalang nila ng paraan, prioritize na lang kung saan nila magagamit yung pondo.

asr-006204
06:33:55.660 --> 06:33:56.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para magkapanan naman yung...

asr-006205
06:33:57.320 --> 06:33:59.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006206
06:33:59.580 --> 06:34:02.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung pangangailangan natin doon sa NWRB.

asr-006207
06:34:02.140 --> 06:34:04.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: You mean, Mr. Speaker, order of priority.

asr-006208
06:34:05.040 --> 06:34:09.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, again, I think the Water Resources Management Program increases.

asr-006209
06:34:09.440 --> 06:34:11.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, mas importante siguro ito ngayon.

asr-006210
06:34:11.800 --> 06:34:16.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya nga, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, I really ask your help.

asr-006211
06:34:17.540 --> 06:34:22.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung gusto mo, meron silang request na 668 million additional.

asr-006212
06:34:23.440 --> 06:34:24.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi tinanggalan eh.

asr-006213
06:34:24.440 --> 06:34:26.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, maliit masyado yung...

asr-006214
06:34:27.320 --> 06:34:29.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sila ngayon, tanggalan pa natin.

asr-006215
06:34:30.200 --> 06:34:32.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, very major na nga yung budget.

asr-006216
06:34:33.380 --> 06:34:35.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And we are asking too much from them.

asr-006217
06:34:36.180 --> 06:34:37.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006218
06:34:38.620 --> 06:34:41.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-006219
06:34:43.140 --> 06:34:51.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Which activities will not be conducted because of the 36.7 million reduction in vulnerability and sustainability assessment?

asr-006220
06:34:51.560 --> 06:34:56.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How many river basins, aquifers, groundwater assessments?

asr-006221
06:34:57.320 --> 06:35:03.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Vulnerability maps or monitoring activities were programmed under the 2026 level?

asr-006222
06:35:04.540 --> 06:35:08.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how many will be delivered under the 2027 proposal?

asr-006223
06:35:11.900 --> 06:35:18.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung general assessment sa lahat ng mga katubigan natin, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006224
06:35:19.220 --> 06:35:24.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang hindi nila mapiperforma yun, katulad nung Pampanga Basin na yan, all the way to the north.

asr-006225
06:35:24.940 --> 06:35:27.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, there is no such thing.

asr-006226
06:35:27.320 --> 06:35:29.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nothing as water as coming from the underground.

asr-006227
06:35:29.840 --> 06:35:33.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lahat po ng tubig, eh, gagaling yan sa ulan, nag-infiltrate papunta sa baba.

asr-006228
06:35:34.740 --> 06:35:39.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: When there is so much extraction of water from the underground, nagkukulang yun dyan.

asr-006229
06:35:40.080 --> 06:35:46.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, DNR is mandated to find a way how to recharge it with recharging the underground aquifer,

asr-006230
06:35:47.040 --> 06:35:52.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: whether from the river or from the rain or whatever, at meron silang measurement.

asr-006231
06:35:52.280 --> 06:35:56.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Iyon po ang magsasaper ngayon, that's equivalent to 36 million na tinanggal.

asr-006232
06:35:56.460 --> 06:35:58.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006233
06:35:58.980 --> 06:36:00.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006234
06:36:01.180 --> 06:36:08.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, I support the budget of the DNR because they're a good sponsor.

asr-006235
06:36:09.140 --> 06:36:10.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Hindi ko pwedeng tanggiyan, no? Napakagaling.

asr-006236
06:36:11.120 --> 06:36:13.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Not only environmentalist, but it's energy.

asr-006237
06:36:13.880 --> 06:36:18.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And of course, to the secretary, you have a good team.

asr-006238
06:36:18.260 --> 06:36:22.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The USEC, the assistant secretaries, look at them, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006239
06:36:22.680 --> 06:36:26.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Of course, Mr. Miguel Labina, their consultant.

asr-006240
06:36:26.460 --> 06:36:28.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At isa rin sa pinakamagalya.

asr-006241
06:36:28.300 --> 06:36:34.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, for the 2027 budget of the DNR, I fully support po ang budget.

asr-006242
06:36:34.340 --> 06:36:40.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Dapat dagdagan po natin ito kasi ito po ang ating pinakaimportanteng department.

asr-006243
06:36:40.440 --> 06:36:41.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006244
06:36:41.680 --> 06:36:42.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006245
06:36:43.060 --> 06:36:44.900
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you very much, Honorable Presley De Jesus.

asr-006246
06:36:45.740 --> 06:36:46.500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader.

asr-006247
06:36:46.940 --> 06:36:48.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sana pakinggan po tayo ng...

asr-006248
06:36:48.840 --> 06:36:49.460
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader.

asr-006249
06:36:49.460 --> 06:36:56.020
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor, I move to recognize...

asr-006250
06:36:56.460 --> 06:37:01.820
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Representative Dadah Kiram Ismula from Partylist, Akbayan.

asr-006251
06:37:02.000 --> 06:37:02.900
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: So move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006252
06:37:03.140 --> 06:37:08.160
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentlelady from Partylist, Akbayan, Representative Dadah Kiram Ismula,

asr-006253
06:37:08.420 --> 06:37:12.320
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Assalamu alaikum, you may now interpolate our sponsor.

asr-006254
06:37:12.340 --> 06:37:16.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, request permission to speak in the vernacular.

asr-006255
06:37:19.700 --> 06:37:25.260
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Very short, and if you can, the gentleman from Palawan,

asr-006256
06:37:26.460 --> 06:37:30.360
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: after you speak, translate in Tagalog or English

asr-006257
06:37:30.360 --> 06:37:35.220
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: so that other people present in the plenary will be able to understand.

asr-006258
06:37:35.220 --> 06:37:37.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Problema, Mr. Speaker, bisaya man kami, parehas.

asr-006259
06:37:37.680 --> 06:37:39.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So magbinisayaan lang kami dito.

asr-006260
06:37:40.740 --> 06:37:41.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para mabilis ba?

asr-006261
06:37:42.080 --> 06:37:44.670
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung hindi nakakaintindi, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006261-split-2
06:37:44.670 --> 06:37:47.040
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Pasensya na lang. The sponsor and the interpellator are both Bisaya,

asr-006262
06:37:47.180 --> 06:37:48.260
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: that they could speak bisaya.

asr-006263
06:37:48.260 --> 06:37:53.140
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: It would be difficult because those who are recording our meeting

asr-006264
06:37:53.140 --> 06:37:55.580
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: would be having a hard time because they do not understand bisaya.

asr-006265
06:37:55.940 --> 06:37:56.660
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Please continue.

asr-006268
06:37:57.440 --> 06:37:58.000
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Honorable

asr-006269
06:37:58.000 --> 06:37:58.920
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Ismula, please.

asr-006270
06:37:59.620 --> 06:38:02.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamu alaikum, marahmatullahi wabarakatuhu.

asr-006271
06:38:03.040 --> 06:38:08.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Lisod ka ayo i-bisaya kay naka-Englishman ng akong kwestyon, no?

asr-006272
06:38:09.240 --> 06:38:10.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So mag-English na lang ta.

asr-006273
06:38:12.140 --> 06:38:15.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

asr-006274
06:38:15.760 --> 06:38:21.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa aking katanungan, unahin ko ang usapin ng karapatan ng ating mga katutubo.

asr-006275
06:38:21.960 --> 06:38:24.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

asr-006276
06:38:24.280 --> 06:38:26.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: can you confirm that...

asr-006277
06:38:26.460 --> 06:38:32.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ...projects under the DNR's jurisdiction require free, prior, and informed consent

asr-006278
06:38:32.240 --> 06:38:37.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kapag ito ay within or overlaps with an ancestral domain?

asr-006279
06:38:39.640 --> 06:38:41.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006280
06:38:42.440 --> 06:38:44.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: FPIC is always required.

asr-006281
06:38:45.000 --> 06:38:45.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006282
06:38:46.380 --> 06:38:54.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor, ano po ang examples ng mga projects na kadalasan nangangailangan ng mga FPIC

asr-006283
06:38:54.020 --> 06:38:56.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kapag ito ay within or...

asr-006284
06:38:56.460 --> 06:38:58.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ...overlaps an ancestral domain.

asr-006285
06:38:58.880 --> 06:39:01.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung within, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-006286
06:39:02.480 --> 06:39:03.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ano mga projects?

asr-006287
06:39:03.640 --> 06:39:06.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Water system, hydroelectric plants,

asr-006288
06:39:07.320 --> 06:39:12.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: eh, yung malawakang pagtanim sa dalawang kanti o kansi.

asr-006289
06:39:12.960 --> 06:39:15.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kailangan, unahin mo muna yung isa.

asr-006290
06:39:15.900 --> 06:39:20.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pwedeng ipagsabay mo yung FPIC sa dalawang magkatabing kansi o kanti.

asr-006291
06:39:20.220 --> 06:39:26.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para magkaroon ka ng dalawang approval para yung overlapping plantation mo sa...

asr-006292
06:39:26.340 --> 06:39:26.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ...kabila.

asr-006293
06:39:27.020 --> 06:39:32.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Limbawa, pagkatanim ng kape dito sa kansi, sa may kansi dito, kumuha mong FPIC ka rin sa kabila.

asr-006294
06:39:33.080 --> 06:39:36.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, yan po ang procedure.

asr-006295
06:39:36.820 --> 06:39:39.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po yun, no, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006296
06:39:40.560 --> 06:39:49.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the DENR confirm if the 2027 budget includes a specific allocation for FPIC monitoring and enforcement?

asr-006297
06:39:50.960 --> 06:39:51.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bah!

asr-006298
06:39:51.800 --> 06:39:52.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sandali lang, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006299
06:39:54.460 --> 06:39:56.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: FPIC, hindi DENR ang gumagastos noon.

asr-006300
06:39:56.340 --> 06:39:57.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: NCIP dapat, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006301
06:39:58.340 --> 06:39:59.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006302
06:40:00.740 --> 06:40:03.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: For monitoring and enforcement purposes.

asr-006303
06:40:03.600 --> 06:40:07.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pwede sila mag-present kasi sila yung issue ng CADC at saka CADT.

asr-006304
06:40:07.520 --> 06:40:10.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pwede sila mag-present doon kasama ng NCIP.

asr-006305
06:40:10.780 --> 06:40:15.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But principal, basta may CADC at saka CADT, lalo na overlapping, NCIP talaga yun.

asr-006306
06:40:15.980 --> 06:40:18.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang DENR observer lang po doon, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006307
06:40:18.020 --> 06:40:26.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, ibig sabihin po, distinguished sponsor, wala pong nakalaang budget para sa monitoring ng FPIC.

asr-006308
06:40:26.340 --> 06:40:28.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And enforcement nito sa DENR.

asr-006309
06:40:28.600 --> 06:40:30.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: FPIC, observe lang sila doon.

asr-006310
06:40:31.080 --> 06:40:36.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero yung, if your project is big enough, kailangan ka ng ECC, di ba?

asr-006311
06:40:36.860 --> 06:40:38.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ECC is a planning tool.

asr-006312
06:40:38.840 --> 06:40:41.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ayun, DENR doon, may budget sila para doon.

asr-006313
06:40:41.900 --> 06:40:42.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron,

asr-006313-split-2
06:40:42.520 --> 06:40:42.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: okay.

asr-006314
06:40:43.060 --> 06:40:46.680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: How much po ang nakalaan para dito sa NEP ng 2027?

asr-006315
06:40:54.580 --> 06:40:56.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pakaliit pa lang nito, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006316
06:40:56.340 --> 06:41:03.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero, yung AMB, MGV, NWRB, 726 million lang sa 2026, ga-a.

asr-006317
06:41:04.220 --> 06:41:09.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngayon, we're asking for 816 sa 2027 NEP.

asr-006318
06:41:10.300 --> 06:41:12.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Distinguish sa colleague, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006319
06:41:14.160 --> 06:41:20.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naka-line item po ba ito o nakapaloob lamang sa general monitoring funds ng DENR?

asr-006320
06:41:22.380 --> 06:41:24.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nakapaloob, Mr. Speaker, sa general fund.

asr-006321
06:41:24.600 --> 06:41:26.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor.

asr-006322
06:41:26.340 --> 06:41:31.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya ako ito, tinatanong ko, dahil kung walang malinaw na budget line,

asr-006323
06:41:31.700 --> 06:41:40.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: paano po masisiguro ng DENR na ang FPIC ay fully implemented at hindi magiging token ng compliance lamang?

asr-006324
06:41:40.940 --> 06:41:49.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, I will now proceed with the tools na mahalaga para sa environmental oversight naman po.

asr-006325
06:41:49.000 --> 06:41:54.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang Executive Order No. 79, dated July 7 of 2012,

asr-006326
06:41:54.860 --> 06:42:01.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at Executive Order No. 130, dated April 14 of 2021,

asr-006327
06:42:02.460 --> 06:42:08.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: call for the updating and issuance of updated unified maps of mining areas,

asr-006328
06:42:09.400 --> 06:42:13.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: geohazard areas, protected areas, and watersheds.

asr-006329
06:42:13.700 --> 06:42:18.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naproduce po ba ng DENR ang unified map na ito?

asr-006330
06:42:18.620 --> 06:42:21.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon bang map na yan?

asr-006331
06:42:23.440 --> 06:42:24.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ah, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006332
06:42:24.860 --> 06:42:34.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: As distinguished colleague, mayroong updated map by virtue of that Executive Order na laganap po nilang naplane yung tungkol sa MINA at sa mga boundaries.

asr-006333
06:42:35.560 --> 06:42:36.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006334
06:42:37.500 --> 06:42:39.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So may unified na map po tayo.

asr-006335
06:42:39.760 --> 06:42:50.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mayroon bang line item din po dito na for 2027 budget sa DENR ang inalocate para naman po makontinue yung unified map na ito at magkano?

asr-006336
06:42:50.800 --> 06:42:51.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon?

asr-006337
06:42:51.860 --> 06:42:52.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Saan?

asr-006338
06:43:11.800 --> 06:43:13.350
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006339
06:43:13.440 --> 06:43:13.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-006340
06:43:13.940 --> 06:43:19.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang amount para po magtuloy-tuloy yan, 713 million.

asr-006341
06:43:20.460 --> 06:43:21.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

asr-006342
06:43:21.260 --> 06:43:28.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung naproduce po ito, nakascade na po ba ito sa mga LGUs para po for their own use?

asr-006343
06:43:29.960 --> 06:43:30.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Oo.

asr-006343-split-2
06:43:30.220 --> 06:43:30.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung MAPA.

asr-006344
06:43:31.780 --> 06:43:37.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ah, yung MAPA, nabigyan na yung mga concerned LGUs na po.

asr-006345
06:43:38.440 --> 06:43:41.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sir Speaker, distinguished colleague. Mayroon, nabigyan po sila.

asr-006346
06:43:41.280 --> 06:43:41.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

asr-006347
06:43:41.960 --> 06:43:50.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, patuloy pa rin ba ang DENR sa pag-supervise ng mine audits?

asr-006348
06:43:50.780 --> 06:43:55.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kung patuloy pa rin ito, magkano ang budget na nakalaan para dito?

asr-006349
06:43:55.780 --> 06:43:59.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Under what line item for 2027 budget po?

asr-006350
06:43:59.900 --> 06:44:00.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mine audit?

asr-006351
06:44:01.540 --> 06:44:01.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala?

asr-006352
06:44:04.660 --> 06:44:06.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi ko alam magkano budget po.

asr-006353
06:44:12.800 --> 06:44:14.380
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Sorry, time pa lang.

asr-006354
06:44:14.380 --> 06:44:14.500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Okay.

asr-006355
06:44:17.400 --> 06:44:17.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dali lang.

asr-006356
06:44:18.440 --> 06:44:19.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dali, ako pa 6 minutes.

asr-006361
06:44:28.780 --> 06:44:30.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006362
06:44:31.160 --> 06:44:38.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung strengthening doon sa, ayun, para magpatuloy, maliit man ito, nakakahiya.

asr-006363
06:44:38.900 --> 06:44:46.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 23 million, baka manipaigo, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, para mapatuloy yung mapping na yun.

asr-006364
06:44:46.540 --> 06:44:47.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po.

asr-006365
06:44:47.140 --> 06:44:49.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tingin ko po, ito'y kulang din po, no?

asr-006366
06:44:50.020 --> 06:44:50.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Oo.

asr-006367
06:44:50.380 --> 06:45:00.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para mapagpatuloy nila yung patungkol sa budget na ito para masupervise nila yung pag-audit sa mga...

asr-006368
06:45:00.000 --> 06:45:29.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, kaugnay pa rin po sa mining, ano ang status of the mining in Sibuyan Island owned by Altai Minerals Development Corporation, nakarating po sa aking opisina na ito ay temporarily nahinto dahil sa barikada ng mga mamamayan at mismo ang LGU at local residents ang nagpapatawag na i-cancel na ang mining contract.

asr-006369
06:45:30.000 --> 06:45:40.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, di ba yung Sibuyan Island, maliit lang nga yun eh. So dapat talaga i-suspendihin. As of now, suspended yun, Mr. Speaker, I'm distinguished colleague.

asr-006370
06:45:40.760 --> 06:45:43.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May plano po ba ang DNR na i-resume ito?

asr-006371
06:45:44.460 --> 06:45:45.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pa, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006372
06:45:45.880 --> 06:45:47.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006373
06:45:47.200 --> 06:45:52.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hinding-hindi dapat maging kapalit ng mining ang karapatan at mabuting kalagayan ng mga komunidad.

asr-006374
06:45:53.880 --> 06:45:59.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang kahit anong economic activity sa ating bansa ay dapat nakaayon sa utos ng Saligang Batas.

asr-006375
06:46:00.000 --> 06:46:05.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na bawat Pilipino ay may karapatan sa isang balanced at healthful ecology.

asr-006376
06:46:06.520 --> 06:46:11.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Sponsor, sa pagsagot sa mga tanong na iyan.

asr-006377
06:46:11.640 --> 06:46:19.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngayon po, nais ko naman pong balikan ang issue patungkol sa Financial or Technical Assistance Agreements o FTAA.

asr-006378
06:46:20.700 --> 06:46:26.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Noong budget briefing po, na-raise ko ang tungkol sa renewal ng FTAAs.

asr-006379
06:46:26.100 --> 06:46:29.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the DNR explain their role in the FTAA?

asr-006380
06:46:30.000 --> 06:46:45.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Isa lang, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague. Sa Region 1, yung Altamina Exploration and Resources, Iron Ore, Gold and Vanadium Resources (Philippines), Inc.

asr-006381
06:46:45.800 --> 06:46:48.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa Region 2, yung OceanaGold.

asr-006382
06:46:49.940 --> 06:46:56.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa MIMAROPA, sa amin, yung Agusan Petroleum and Minerals Corporation, pero hindi pa ito pinayagan.

asr-006383
06:46:57.080 --> 06:46:58.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Region 12, Sagittarius Mines.

asr-006384
06:46:58.840 --> 06:46:59.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lahat ito.

asr-006385
06:47:00.000 --> 06:47:06.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, ano po kaya ang role ng DNR dito sa FTAAs?

asr-006386
06:47:06.040 --> 06:47:08.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nagmo-monitor lang, Mr. Speaker, ng compliance.

asr-006387
06:47:08.220 --> 06:47:09.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Monitoring. Salamat po.

asr-006388
06:47:09.980 --> 06:47:18.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kinoconfirm din po sa budget hearing na DNR na merong allocated budget para sa monitoring at enforcement ng FTAAs.

asr-006389
06:47:19.460 --> 06:47:29.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished Sponsor, paano ginagamit ng DNR ang halagang ito para palakasin ang monitoring at enforcement ng FTAAs?

asr-006390
06:47:29.080 --> 06:47:36.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, siyempre, kung may pera sila, they have to travel kasi they cannot do the monitoring dito lang sila sa Manila.

asr-006391
06:47:36.500 --> 06:47:38.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pumunta katulad sa Cebu yan, they have to go there.

asr-006392
06:47:39.060 --> 06:47:41.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Katulad doon sa Humonhon, kailangan pumunta sila doon.

asr-006393
06:47:42.320 --> 06:47:43.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang daming mina.

asr-006394
06:47:43.860 --> 06:47:48.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa Palawan nga, meron kaming mining moratorium for 50 years, pinirmahan nila.

asr-006395
06:47:49.060 --> 06:47:52.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, wala na kaming bagong ina-accept ng mga application.

asr-006396
06:47:52.960 --> 06:47:58.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya yung ibang mga probinsya, sabihin mo, Mr. Speaker, gumawa din ng mining moratorium.

asr-006397
06:47:59.080 --> 06:48:03.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-006398
06:48:03.420 --> 06:48:14.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Iko-confirm ko lang din po na sakaling may nahuli kayo dito na lumalabag sa FTAAs po during your monitoring, ano po yung ginagawa nila?

asr-006399
06:48:15.600 --> 06:48:16.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor.

asr-006400
06:48:20.080 --> 06:48:24.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung nag-ooperate pa yan, Mr. Speaker, suspended immediately.

asr-006401
06:48:25.220 --> 06:48:29.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pagkatapos, pag nag-violet pa talaga, eh talagang hindi lang suspended.

asr-006402
06:48:29.080 --> 06:48:30.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yan, multahan yan.

asr-006403
06:48:31.040 --> 06:48:38.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung hindi naman madala sa multa, eh ang DNR, baka ilibing na lang nila yun doon sa gamitin yung bakho, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006404
06:48:39.300 --> 06:48:40.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kinakasuhan din po ba natin?

asr-006405
06:48:41.160 --> 06:48:43.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Eh, due process pala. I'm sorry.

asr-006406
06:48:43.540 --> 06:48:48.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pala pwede yung bakho gagamitin doon pag hindi sumunod sa DNR.

asr-006407
06:48:50.120 --> 06:48:52.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, kinakasuhan po natin sakaling lumabag?

asr-006408
06:48:52.760 --> 06:48:53.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaso, multa.

asr-006409
06:48:53.700 --> 06:48:57.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pa talaga pumayag sa multa.

asr-006410
06:48:57.080 --> 06:48:57.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bakho.

asr-006411
06:48:57.480 --> 06:48:58.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, lalo na kung hindi.

asr-006412
06:48:59.080 --> 06:49:03.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya naman, Pilipino citizen, eh alam mo na kung anong parosa, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006413
06:49:04.220 --> 06:49:04.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po.

asr-006414
06:49:05.040 --> 06:49:12.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasama rin po ba rito ang pagsuri kung compliant ang isang FTAA proposal sa mga requirements

asr-006415
06:49:12.160 --> 06:49:17.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gaya ng Environmental Compliance Certificate or FPIC bago ito ma-approve?

asr-006416
06:49:18.120 --> 06:49:20.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tama, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague. You're very correct.

asr-006417
06:49:20.800 --> 06:49:28.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na-e-ensure ba ng DNR na ang mga renewal ay di nagiging automatic at sumasailalim pa rin

asr-006418
06:49:28.440 --> 06:49:30.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa pagpasa ng mga requirements?

asr-006419
06:49:30.560 --> 06:49:33.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, hindi automatic. Talagang ina-isa-isa yan.

asr-006420
06:49:33.900 --> 06:49:37.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po sa pag-confirm, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-006421
06:49:38.280 --> 06:49:45.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, ngayong araw ko lang po natanggap ang sagot ng DNR

asr-006422
06:49:45.360 --> 06:49:50.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hinggil sa FTAA No. 1 ng Oceana Gold Philippines Inc.

asr-006423
06:49:50.280 --> 06:49:54.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at FTAA No. 2 ng Tampakan Project.

asr-006424
06:49:54.860 --> 06:49:58.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang paliwanag ng DNR ay sa FTAA No. 1,

asr-006425
06:49:58.440 --> 06:50:05.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: walang grave abuse of discretion dahil ito raw ay sumusunod sa intention of the agreement.

asr-006426
06:50:05.800 --> 06:50:11.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ang FTAA No. 2, restoration of the lost term naman daw po.

asr-006427
06:50:12.420 --> 06:50:18.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano po ito na ipapaliwanag ng DNR sa ating mga lokal, sa ating mga katutubo?

asr-006428
06:50:19.860 --> 06:50:27.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Binababaan po ba natin ang ating mga komunidad para sabihin ang ganitong technical na reasoning sa kanila?

asr-006429
06:50:28.440 --> 06:50:36.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Siyempre, Mr. Speaker, unang-una, hirap ka mang pumasok doon kung may mga katutubong nagbabantay.

asr-006430
06:50:36.760 --> 06:50:38.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, kailangan kasapin mo yan sila.

asr-006431
06:50:39.120 --> 06:50:43.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Katulad ng Tampakan, eh patagal yan natulog ang Tampakan eh. Ngayon na lang yan tinatampak.

asr-006432
06:50:43.920 --> 06:50:48.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, hopefully, if you ask me, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006433
06:50:48.860 --> 06:50:50.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yung mina hindi naman talagang masama per se.

asr-006434
06:50:51.360 --> 06:50:54.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Basta huwag lang mag-abuso. Lalong-lalo na kung yung nagmimina ay Pilipino.

asr-006435
06:50:55.440 --> 06:50:58.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang ayaw natin makita, kung yung nagmimina,

asr-006436
06:50:58.440 --> 06:51:01.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: hindi Pilipino. Dahil ang mina, reserve lang yan, natural resources,

asr-006437
06:51:02.320 --> 06:51:05.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: is reserved only for Pilipino citizens.

asr-006438
06:51:05.780 --> 06:51:07.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I repeat that, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006439
06:51:08.060 --> 06:51:11.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006440
06:51:12.160 --> 06:51:15.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pakiusap naman po at pakisabihan ang DNR,

asr-006441
06:51:15.880 --> 06:51:18.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hindi pa po nila nabababaan ang komunidad.

asr-006442
06:51:19.380 --> 06:51:23.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi pa po nila nasasabihan, naa-update sa status.

asr-006443
06:51:23.540 --> 06:51:25.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nagpadala po kayo sa akin ng sulat,

asr-006444
06:51:25.820 --> 06:51:28.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero hindi nyo po sinabihan sa baba.

asr-006445
06:51:28.440 --> 06:51:31.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang LGU lamang po ang sinabihan ninyo,

asr-006446
06:51:31.440 --> 06:51:33.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero ang komunidad ay hindi.

asr-006447
06:51:33.440 --> 06:51:38.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In closing, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006448
06:51:38.200 --> 06:51:43.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa usapin ng pagprotekta sa ating kalikasan at pagtanggol sa katutubo,

asr-006449
06:51:43.720 --> 06:51:47.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: dapat lang ay hindi nawawalan ng boses at karapatan

asr-006450
06:51:47.960 --> 06:51:51.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang ating mga komunidad na direktang apektado.

asr-006451
06:51:51.280 --> 06:51:58.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang DNR ay hindi Department of Extract Our Natural Resources.

asr-006452
06:51:58.280 --> 06:52:05.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang DNR ay pinagkatiwala ng taong bayan kasama ang mga katutubong Pilipino

asr-006453
06:52:05.280 --> 06:52:08.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na pangalagaan ang ating kalikasan.

asr-006454
06:52:08.280 --> 06:52:13.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Distinguished Sponsor, for yielding to my question.

asr-006455
06:52:13.280 --> 06:52:14.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

asr-006456
06:52:14.280 --> 06:52:17.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006457
06:52:17.280 --> 06:52:19.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Takang salamat.

asr-006458
06:52:19.280 --> 06:52:24.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Next time pwede at i-allow nila magbinisaya at nakaka-kapoy kay magtinagalog.

asr-006459
06:52:25.280 --> 06:52:27.280
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-006460
06:52:28.280 --> 06:52:31.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Madam Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor,

asr-006461
06:52:31.280 --> 06:52:37.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: I move to recognize Representative Christopher Sheen Gonzales

asr-006462
06:52:37.280 --> 06:52:40.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: from the Lone District of Eastern Samar.

asr-006463
06:52:40.280 --> 06:52:42.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: So move, Madam Speaker.

asr-006464
06:52:42.280 --> 06:52:46.280
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Christopher Sheen Gonzales from the Lone District of Eastern Samar

asr-006465
06:52:46.280 --> 06:52:48.280
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: is hereby recognized for his interpolation.

asr-006466
06:52:48.280 --> 06:52:55.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker, to colleagues and to the good sponsor.

asr-006467
06:52:55.280 --> 06:52:57.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Magandang hapon po sa ating lahat.

asr-006468
06:52:58.280 --> 06:53:02.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Will the good sponsor yield for a few questions po?

asr-006469
06:53:02.280 --> 06:53:05.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Gladly, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006470
06:53:05.280 --> 06:53:07.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please, go ahead.

asr-006471
06:53:07.280 --> 06:53:15.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Madam Speaker, nung nakaraang budget briefing sa budget ng Department of Environment and Natural Resources,

asr-006472
06:53:15.280 --> 06:53:26.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: nag-commit ang ahensya particular po ang Mines and Geosciences Bureau na personal napuntahan ang isla ng Humonhon sa giwan Eastern Samar

asr-006473
06:53:26.280 --> 06:53:33.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: para mag-imbestiga ng mga reported issues and concerns sa ginagawang mining activities po doon.

asr-006474
06:53:33.280 --> 06:53:39.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sa ngayon po, ang question ko po, Madam Speaker, to the good sponsor,

asr-006475
06:53:39.280 --> 06:53:45.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: nakapagsagawa po ba ng imbistigasyon ng ahensya sa isla ng Humonhon?

asr-006476
06:53:45.280 --> 06:53:53.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Nakapagsagawa po ba ng mga actual inspection ng DENR o MGB sa isla ng Humonhon?

asr-006477
06:53:53.280 --> 06:53:55.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, yes.

asr-006478
06:53:56.280 --> 06:54:11.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang tanong ko po, alam ko naman na nakita doon ng nag-inspeksyon ng mga taga-DENR.

asr-006479
06:54:11.280 --> 06:54:23.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Madam Speaker, kung mapatunayan po na may mga violations ang MPSA o mga nagmimina po doon,

asr-006480
06:54:23.280 --> 06:54:45.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: inaasahan po ng representasyong ito na gagawa po ng mga hakbang ang DENR at ang representasyon po ito ay babantayan ang mga pangyayaring ito.

asr-006481
06:54:45.280 --> 06:54:50.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, sa tingin ko po, Madam Speaker,

asr-006482
06:54:50.280 --> 06:55:00.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: ang nararapat po ba na sanksyon sa mga nag-iiligal kung meron man po, gagawin po ba ng DENR?

asr-006483
06:55:00.280 --> 06:55:11.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, ito lahat sila sa likod ko nagkocommit sa iyo na pag may mga violation dyan sa mina,

asr-006484
06:55:11.280 --> 06:55:17.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: lalong-lalong na hindi Pilipino yung gumagawa ng mina, eh...

asr-006485
06:55:17.280 --> 06:55:18.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006486
06:55:18.280 --> 06:55:19.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006487
06:55:20.280 --> 06:55:26.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sobrang sila isandaan dito. They fully commit to support the local.

asr-006488
06:55:26.280 --> 06:55:28.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: O yun, palakpak!

asr-006489
06:55:28.280 --> 06:55:30.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Salamat, salamat.

asr-006490
06:55:36.280 --> 06:55:47.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: During, with regards to the MPSA, during the DENR budget briefing, concerns were raised regarding possible violations of the terms and conditions

asr-006491
06:55:47.280 --> 06:55:48.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: governing these mining operations in MPSA.

asr-006492
06:55:48.280 --> 06:55:57.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: The MPSA itself requires compliance with the Mining Act.

asr-006493
06:55:57.280 --> 06:56:04.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Its implementing rules, Madam Speaker, approve work programs and other applicable laws.

asr-006494
06:56:04.280 --> 06:56:14.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: DENR, on the other hand, retains regularity, supervisory, and monitoring authority.

asr-006495
06:56:14.280 --> 06:56:16.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang tanong,

asr-006496
06:56:16.280 --> 06:56:37.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: maaari po bang mangako ulit ang DENR na ang kanilang isa sa gawa ay comprehensive review ng MPSA na ito, kasama ang lahat ng mga amendments, assignment, operating agreements, at kung nasusunod ba talaga ang mga terms and conditions dito?

asr-006497
06:56:37.280 --> 06:56:39.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Madam Speaker, to the board sponsor...

asr-006498
06:56:39.280 --> 06:56:44.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, lahat sila nung sa likod ko, in-ok.

asr-006499
06:56:44.280 --> 06:56:58.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sabi nila, pag ikaw ang nag-lead doon sa inspection team at nakita nila, in spite doon sa mga monitoring nila, kung mayroon pang ibang violation, hindi lang suspension.

asr-006500
06:56:58.280 --> 06:57:03.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung hindi, talagang iteterminate yung pagmimina doon dahil napakaliit nung is lang yan.

asr-006501
06:57:03.280 --> 06:57:07.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nadaan nga ako raw, wala nang matamnan eh, hukay na lang sila ng hukay.

asr-006502
06:57:07.280 --> 06:57:11.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ayaw natin na yung humungun, pareha sa nauru.

asr-006503
06:57:11.280 --> 06:57:13.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung nauru, wala nang, wala nang phosphate.

asr-006504
06:57:14.280 --> 06:57:17.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang mga tao doon ngayon sa Australia na nakatira.

asr-006505
06:57:17.280 --> 06:57:21.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lihit na lang yung village na naiwan kasi kot-kot sila ng kot-kot.

asr-006506
06:57:21.280 --> 06:57:24.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Naubos yung phosphate doon, wala na silang matirahan.

asr-006507
06:57:24.280 --> 06:57:25.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kawawa.

asr-006508
06:57:25.280 --> 06:57:29.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dati, they were multi, multi-billion island.

asr-006509
06:57:29.280 --> 06:57:33.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngayon, I was there like 10 years ago.

asr-006510
06:57:33.280 --> 06:57:37.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Naawa ako dahil napakaliit nung isla.

asr-006511
06:57:37.280 --> 06:57:40.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung island of Nauru in the Pacific.

asr-006512
06:57:40.280 --> 06:57:42.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Going there, nawala pa kami sa Pasipiko.

asr-006513
06:57:42.280 --> 06:57:43.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Haha.

asr-006514
06:57:43.280 --> 06:57:45.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Buti na lang naka-landing kami sa Guam.

asr-006515
06:57:45.280 --> 06:57:46.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006516
06:57:46.280 --> 06:57:51.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker and Distinguished Colleague, we will be with you na kung may mga violation yan.

asr-006517
06:57:51.280 --> 06:57:55.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Needless to say, hindi lang i-suspend.

asr-006518
06:57:55.280 --> 06:57:56.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Terminate talaga.

asr-006519
06:57:56.280 --> 06:57:59.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung hindi, ah, un-terminate, hindi.

asr-006520
06:57:59.280 --> 06:58:00.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Very kind pa yung terminate.

asr-006521
06:58:00.280 --> 06:58:02.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Babawiin yung MPSA.

asr-006522
06:58:02.280 --> 06:58:04.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006523
06:58:04.280 --> 06:58:06.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po to the good sponsor.

asr-006524
06:58:06.280 --> 06:58:08.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker.

asr-006525
06:58:08.280 --> 06:58:11.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ah, napaka sarap pakinggan.

asr-006526
06:58:11.280 --> 06:58:12.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam niyo po.

asr-006527
06:58:12.280 --> 06:58:14.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam niyo po kasi yung isla ng Humonhon.

asr-006528
06:58:14.280 --> 06:58:17.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ah, dito po nag-umpisa ang Kristyanismo.

asr-006529
06:58:17.280 --> 06:58:20.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Napaka-historic po yung lugar na to.

asr-006530
06:58:20.280 --> 06:58:25.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kaya sa mga statement po ng ating butihing sponsor, Madam Speaker,

asr-006531
06:58:25.280 --> 06:58:33.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: ito po ay nagpapakita sa kaseryosohan na pagmamahal sa mga tao at sa isla ng Humonhon.

asr-006532
06:58:33.280 --> 06:58:39.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At ako po ay nagagalak. Maraming salamat po, ah, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-006533
06:58:39.280 --> 06:58:40.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: And to the, ah,

asr-006534
06:58:40.280 --> 06:58:45.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: DNR family, if that's so.

asr-006535
06:58:45.280 --> 06:58:54.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam po natin lahat na nangyayaring ito to the DNR family, especially sa ating butihing sekretary.

asr-006536
06:58:54.280 --> 06:58:57.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi po ito ngayon.

asr-006537
06:58:57.280 --> 06:59:06.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi po ito nangyari sa pamumunuan po, sa incumbency niyo po sa ating butihing sekretary.

asr-006538
06:59:06.280 --> 06:59:09.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ito po ay naman na sa mga nakaraang administrasyon.

asr-006539
06:59:10.280 --> 06:59:21.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ah, gusto ko pong i-highlight yung sinasabi po ng ating good sponsor regarding yung ownership na requirement.

asr-006540
06:59:21.280 --> 06:59:30.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi identifying the authorized operator leads us to an even more fundamental issue.

asr-006541
06:59:30.280 --> 06:59:36.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Who actually owns and controls the mining operations in Humonhon.

asr-006542
06:59:36.280 --> 06:59:38.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Madam Speaker,

asr-006543
06:59:38.280 --> 06:59:51.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: the Constitution requires at least 60% Philippine ownership for corporations entering into production sharing agreement involving our natural resources.

asr-006544
06:59:51.280 --> 06:59:59.280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: We have received information that foreign interest, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006545
07:00:00.000 --> 07:00:13.860
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Foreign interest may be involved in the ownership, management, or actual operations of certain mining activities in the island of Humonhon.

asr-006546
07:00:14.700 --> 07:00:20.060
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Let me emphasize that we are not presenting this an established fact.

asr-006547
07:00:20.960 --> 07:00:25.560
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: We are asking the DENR to verify this.

asr-006548
07:00:25.560 --> 07:00:33.040
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: And if I confirm what I am saying, like the stand of our good sponsor, Madam Speaker,

asr-006549
07:00:33.960 --> 07:00:43.220
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: and here comes the DENR's responsibility to answer the violations of mining operators in the island of Humonhon.

asr-006550
07:00:55.560 --> 07:00:58.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Madam Speaker,

asr-006551
07:00:59.460 --> 07:01:22.760
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Can the DENR therefore commit to undertake the necessary verification in coordination with the appropriate agencies to determine kung mga foreign national po ba ito ang nag-ooperate o talagang mga Pilipino 100% ang nag-ooperate.

asr-006552
07:01:22.760 --> 07:01:25.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006553
07:01:25.560 --> 07:01:36.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang DENR family, we will request them to write to PAOCC, we'll write to NBI, and also Bureau of Immigration.

asr-006554
07:01:37.200 --> 07:01:44.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para in one sweep, malalaman natin, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, kung meron bang mga foreign interest dito.

asr-006555
07:01:45.560 --> 07:01:51.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maska reading as Pilipino, ahil napakahirap, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006556
07:01:51.000 --> 07:01:55.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang natural resources exclusively reserved.

asr-006557
07:01:55.560 --> 07:01:59.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: For Pilipino citizens, only pa. Exclusive, may only pa.

asr-006558
07:01:59.520 --> 07:02:00.800
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I agree, Madam Speaker.

asr-006559
07:02:01.760 --> 07:02:11.180
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi alam naman po natin na siyempre dapat makikinabang dito ay Pilipino, hindi mga foreign national.

asr-006560
07:02:12.260 --> 07:02:17.340
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: My last manifestation, not even a question.

asr-006561
07:02:19.980 --> 07:02:24.120
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Actually, marami naman akong katunungan, pero there's a proper forum.

asr-006562
07:02:25.560 --> 07:02:34.340
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Anyway, I have a pending resolution para po sa pag-imbestiga ng issue na ito.

asr-006563
07:02:35.240 --> 07:02:41.160
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Pero ang appeal ko lang po, Madam Speaker, to a good sponsor, ang appeal ko lang po sa DENR.

asr-006564
07:02:42.920 --> 07:02:48.620
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Sana hindi na po humantong sa investigasyon na sinasabi ko.

asr-006565
07:02:48.940 --> 07:02:51.620
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kayo naman po yung nag-iimbestiga.

asr-006566
07:02:53.280 --> 07:02:55.520
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang sabi nyo po kanina, kayo misunod.

asr-006567
07:02:55.560 --> 07:02:57.980
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang DENR na mismo ay pumunta na sa isla ng Humonhon.

asr-006568
07:02:59.540 --> 07:03:03.180
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Nakita nyo, sigurado ako, nakita nyo ang mga pangyayaring doon.

asr-006569
07:03:03.840 --> 07:03:05.880
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Mga pangyayari na hindi maganda doon.

asr-006570
07:03:06.720 --> 07:03:10.880
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So para sa akin po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006571
07:03:11.800 --> 07:03:17.260
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: hindi na paabutin na mabuksan ang imbestigasyon

asr-006572
07:03:17.260 --> 07:03:24.840
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: at yung DENR na mismo sa lalong madaling panahon ay maaksyonan ang nararapat po sa isla ng Humonhon.

asr-006573
07:03:25.560 --> 07:03:32.680
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, with this, Madam Speaker, to the good sponsor, maraming salamat po sa suporta.

asr-006574
07:03:33.520 --> 07:03:36.880
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I am doing this, hindi po para sa sarili ko.

asr-006575
07:03:37.860 --> 07:03:44.740
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: I am doing this para po sa probinsya ng Eastern Samar at sa mga tao na nasasakupan ko po.

asr-006576
07:03:45.580 --> 07:03:47.100
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Salamat po sa pag-intindi nyo.

asr-006577
07:03:47.820 --> 07:03:50.920
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At para sa akin, I will fully support.

asr-006578
07:03:51.840 --> 07:03:54.780
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: With this representation, I will fully support.

asr-006579
07:03:55.560 --> 07:03:57.800
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: The budget of the DENR.

asr-006580
07:03:58.000 --> 07:03:59.960
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po at mabuhay po.

asr-006581
07:03:59.960 --> 07:04:03.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maraming salamat din, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006582
07:04:03.820 --> 07:04:07.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And yung mga minanipest mo, I am sure.

asr-006583
07:04:07.760 --> 07:04:17.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I am one with you and I'll also look after that these promises will be soon implemented.

asr-006584
07:04:17.860 --> 07:04:18.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-006584-split-2
07:04:18.860 --> 07:04:19.580
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Thank you, [unclear] colleague.

asr-006585
07:04:20.100 --> 07:04:20.800
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-006586
07:04:21.580 --> 07:04:24.720
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Madam Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor,

asr-006587
07:04:24.720 --> 07:04:36.020
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: I move to recognize Representative Sarah Jane I. Elago from Partylist, Gabriela Women's Party.

asr-006588
07:04:36.180 --> 07:04:37.140
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: So move, Madam Speaker.

asr-006589
07:04:37.620 --> 07:04:40.620
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Sarah Jane Elago of Gabriela Women's Party.

asr-006590
07:04:40.620 --> 07:04:42.800
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: This is hereby recognized for her interpolation.

asr-006591
07:04:44.980 --> 07:04:46.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-006592
07:04:48.060 --> 07:04:54.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Una sa lahat, maraming salamat sa mga naisumite na ulat sa representasyon na ito mula sa Gabriela Women's Party.

asr-006593
07:04:54.720 --> 07:05:01.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tungkol sa mga pangunahing issue na naihapag natin sa harap ng budget briefing ng DENR.

asr-006594
07:05:02.380 --> 07:05:08.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais ko na lang po nasundan ang ilan sa mga hinihingi pa na clarification,

asr-006595
07:05:08.880 --> 07:05:14.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagpapaliwanag, lalong-lalo na tungkol po sa kapalara ng mga puno sa Marikina City.

asr-006596
07:05:15.340 --> 07:05:18.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakaugnay ng ADB Metro Manila Bridges Project.

asr-006597
07:05:18.780 --> 07:05:21.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, noong September 14,

asr-006598
07:05:22.600 --> 07:05:24.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula sa naipaulat na,

asr-006599
07:05:24.720 --> 07:05:36.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 23 o 20 puno na puputulin para sa proyekto na iulat ng DPWH sa konsultasyon na labing dalawa rito ang isasalba

asr-006600
07:05:36.720 --> 07:05:42.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at 8 na i-earthball kahit mga mature ang mga trees na ito.

asr-006601
07:05:44.180 --> 07:05:50.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na po bang application para sa earthballing permit ang 8 puno na ito?

asr-006602
07:05:50.060 --> 07:05:52.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At napag-aralan po ba ng DENR?

asr-006603
07:05:53.380 --> 07:05:54.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung tungkol dito.

asr-006604
07:05:54.720 --> 07:06:00.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dito sa ulat na ito, tungkol sa kapalara ng mga puno.

asr-006605
07:06:00.060 --> 07:06:00.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kapalara.

asr-006606
07:06:03.640 --> 07:06:04.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Saan ito?

asr-006607
07:06:05.260 --> 07:06:06.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa Marikina.

asr-006608
07:06:07.400 --> 07:06:08.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa Marikina.

asr-006609
07:06:09.800 --> 07:06:15.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, wala pa po ang application, consultation pa lang.

asr-006610
07:06:16.420 --> 07:06:20.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And I will join you to object pag in-earthball yung napakalaking puno.

asr-006611
07:06:21.640 --> 07:06:24.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dahil ang earthballing ay pwede lang po yun sa medyo...

asr-006612
07:06:24.720 --> 07:06:28.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: breast height, diameter, 45 cm, and below.

asr-006613
07:06:29.320 --> 07:06:32.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pwede mo earthball yun, Madam Speaker, the Stringis Kulig.

asr-006614
07:06:32.960 --> 07:06:38.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero yung akasya na sing tanda ko, e hindi na ma-earthball yun, Madam Speaker.

asr-006615
07:06:38.620 --> 07:06:42.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung 82 years old to 100 years old na akasya, hindi pwede yung earthball, mamamatay.

asr-006616
07:06:43.680 --> 07:06:45.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mamamatay yun ng mamamatay na.

asr-006617
07:06:45.260 --> 07:06:47.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung maari, palitan na lang yun.

asr-006618
07:06:47.560 --> 07:06:54.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung isang akasya ang putulin na centennial na ang edad, e palitan na lang ng dalawang daang akasya kung saan nila maitanim.

asr-006619
07:06:54.720 --> 07:06:56.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yan ang magandang...

asr-006620
07:06:56.720 --> 07:07:05.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, ang sabi ng ating distinguished sponsor, may consultation pero wala pang application para sa earthballing permit.

asr-006621
07:07:06.200 --> 07:07:13.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari bang maibahagi ng ating distinguished sponsor kung ano po ang outputs mula sa consultation na ito?

asr-006622
07:07:13.960 --> 07:07:14.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Anong output?

asr-006623
07:07:15.580 --> 07:07:16.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Output?

asr-006624
07:07:16.660 --> 07:07:18.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Anong nangyari sa consultation?

asr-006625
07:07:18.280 --> 07:07:18.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Anong nangyari sa consultation?

asr-006629
07:07:24.720 --> 07:07:37.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, from 22 trees, e merong 12 na maybe i-allow nila kasi dati.

asr-006630
07:07:37.400 --> 07:07:38.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung karsada ang gagawin.

asr-006631
07:07:41.540 --> 07:07:44.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ah, masi-save pala yung 12 out of the 22.

asr-006632
07:07:45.080 --> 07:07:46.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006633
07:07:47.440 --> 07:07:47.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-006634
07:07:47.940 --> 07:07:50.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Consultation pala. Wala pang application to cut.

asr-006635
07:07:51.700 --> 07:07:54.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, tulad ng nasabi ng ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-006636
07:07:54.720 --> 07:07:59.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakahirap po kung i-earthball pa yung mga mature na mga trees.

asr-006637
07:07:59.720 --> 07:08:00.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi talaga pwede, Madam Speaker.

asr-006638
07:08:01.460 --> 07:08:07.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, sinusuportahan natin ang panawagan ng mga residente ng Marikina na isalba ang mga puno na ito.

asr-006639
07:08:07.960 --> 07:08:19.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bagamat lumiit yung bilang na sinasabi na i-earthball, ay nararapat pa rin na huwag nang aprobahan ng DENR itong earthballing permit

asr-006640
07:08:19.100 --> 07:08:24.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung magkakaroon man ng application para sa walong nasabing puno na ito.

asr-006641
07:08:24.720 --> 07:08:31.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayon sa mga eksperto, Madam Speaker, maaaring umabot ng isang taon ang pag-recovery ng puno matapos mailipat.

asr-006642
07:08:32.320 --> 07:08:42.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ipinapakita rin ng mga pag-aaral na mas mataas ang survival rate ng bata o maliit hanggang katamtaman ng mga puno kapag inililipat.

asr-006643
07:08:42.820 --> 07:08:49.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mas mahirap din ilipat ang mga malalaki at matatandang puno dahil malalim at malawak ang ugat nito.

asr-006644
07:08:49.040 --> 07:08:54.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tulad nga ng halimbawa na naibahagi ng ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-006645
07:08:54.720 --> 07:09:05.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na rin tayong mga karanasan noon, Madam Speaker, sa Baguio City, kung saan mahigit 183s ang planong ilipat para bigang daan ang isang mall project.

asr-006646
07:09:05.620 --> 07:09:16.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Naaprobahan ito ng DENR, ngunit tuluyan ding naipahinto ng Supreme Court noong parehong taon, bagamat merong ilang puno na naputol bago ang ruling.

asr-006647
07:09:16.800 --> 07:09:22.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa Cebu naman, nasa 228 trees ang nailipat noong 2023.

asr-006648
07:09:23.320 --> 07:09:24.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa Cebu, Boss.

asr-006649
07:09:24.720 --> 07:09:33.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Rapid Transit Project, gayon man, naiulat na may mga punong hindi nakaligtas sa parehong pagkakataon.

asr-006650
07:09:34.080 --> 07:09:38.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Doon man sa Baguio, ata meron din po sa Cebu na hindi na nakaligtas.

asr-006651
07:09:39.500 --> 07:09:47.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nananawagan tayo, Madam Speaker, na hindi dapat maging kapalit ang mga proyektong pang-infrastruktura, ang pagkasira ng kalikasan.

asr-006652
07:09:47.980 --> 07:09:54.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinusuportahan natin ang mga proyekto na pangkaunlaran, ngunit hindi dapat maisakripisyon.

asr-006653
07:09:54.720 --> 07:10:03.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May mga pagtutol din ang mga residente ng Provident Villages hinggil sa ADB Metro Manila Bridges Project.

asr-006654
07:10:04.020 --> 07:10:13.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa katunayan, nagsasagawa po sila ngayon ng Stations of the Cross bilang pagtutol sa proyektong magdudulot ng pagputol sa ilang matatandang puno sa Marikina.

asr-006655
07:10:14.260 --> 07:10:20.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa information po ba ng DENR, ito pong consultation ninyo na nabanggit kanina sa Bridge 1 lang.

asr-006656
07:10:20.560 --> 07:10:23.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron din po bang consultation na ginawa?

asr-006657
07:10:23.360 --> 07:10:24.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakaugnay?

asr-006658
07:10:24.040 --> 07:10:28.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakaugnay ng Bridge 2 and 3, nakaugnay ng Metro Manila Bridges Project.

asr-006659
07:10:29.680 --> 07:10:30.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Saan yun?

asr-006660
07:10:36.840 --> 07:10:47.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Oo. Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, we are with you in preserving all these malalaking puno.

asr-006661
07:10:47.500 --> 07:10:53.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But if the national project like widening of roads will redound to the communities,

asr-006662
07:10:54.040 --> 07:11:04.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: at saka yun namang malaking puno ay matandang-matanda na, remember, no tree in this planet will survive forever.

asr-006663
07:11:05.280 --> 07:11:10.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mamamatay din yung punong yan. Tulad natin tao, mamamatay din.

asr-006664
07:11:11.280 --> 07:11:22.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya, yung DENR naman, kung mas tinitingnan nila na mag-benefit doon yung community sa pagwiding ng road,

asr-006665
07:11:22.600 --> 07:11:24.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kaysa i-preserve ang isang akasya,

asr-006666
07:11:24.240 --> 07:11:26.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: eh magtanim na lang tayo ng dalawang daang akasya

asr-006667
07:11:27.180 --> 07:11:44.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: somewhere else para naman yung paligiran at kalikasan may balik mo yung oxygen at saka pag-withdraw ng halaman ng carbon dioxide from the atmosphere at magbuga sila ng oxygen.

asr-006668
07:11:44.920 --> 07:11:47.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So kung isang puno lang yun at palitan mo ng isang daan,

asr-006669
07:11:47.640 --> 07:11:52.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kung ang kapakanan ay yung carbon dioxide,

asr-006670
07:11:53.160 --> 07:11:53.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ah,

asr-006671
07:11:53.320 --> 07:11:53.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: na kinakain

asr-006672
07:11:54.040 --> 07:11:56.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ng halaman at ine-exhale niya oxygen,

asr-006673
07:11:56.580 --> 07:11:59.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ay mas marami ang benepisyo sa maraming puno.

asr-006674
07:12:00.280 --> 07:12:02.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: May Madam Speaker, Distinguished Kuling.

asr-006675
07:12:03.320 --> 07:12:05.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sulirin natin dito, Madam Speaker,

asr-006676
07:12:05.560 --> 07:12:07.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi lang isang punong ating pinag-uusapan.

asr-006677
07:12:08.140 --> 07:12:10.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May pag-aaral ang Lichelle Technologies

asr-006678
07:12:10.340 --> 07:12:14.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na naisumite ng DPWH at ng ADB

asr-006679
07:12:14.440 --> 07:12:19.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na tinatayang nasa 1,069

asr-006680
07:12:19.340 --> 07:12:21.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na trees ang kinakailang putulin

asr-006681
07:12:21.600 --> 07:12:24.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa Bridges 1, 2, and 3

asr-006682
07:12:24.360 --> 07:12:27.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kaugnay ng ADB Metro Manila Bridges Project.

asr-006683
07:12:28.220 --> 07:12:30.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa Bridge 1, may 514.

asr-006684
07:12:30.980 --> 07:12:34.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang update nga po dito, dahil very vocal din yung mga residente

asr-006685
07:12:34.020 --> 07:12:36.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol sa pagligtas ng mga puno,

asr-006686
07:12:36.760 --> 07:12:39.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa 20 na lang, 12 maisasalba

asr-006687
07:12:39.740 --> 07:12:44.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at may 8 na lang na i-apply for earthballing.

asr-006688
07:12:44.660 --> 07:12:47.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: For Bridge 2 naman, nasa 232.

asr-006689
07:12:47.760 --> 07:12:49.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para naman sa Bridge 3,

asr-006690
07:12:49.340 --> 07:12:50.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay 350.

asr-006691
07:12:51.360 --> 07:12:54.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita na po ba ng DENR ang pag-aaral na ito?

asr-006692
07:13:04.360 --> 07:13:07.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung Phase 1 daw at saka Phase 2 at saka Phase 3,

asr-006693
07:13:07.940 --> 07:13:08.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: hindi kasama yung Phase 3.

asr-006694
07:13:10.320 --> 07:13:12.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sabi niya sa'yo, ano yung, sorry, club speaker.

asr-006695
07:13:12.760 --> 07:13:14.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin lahat, no?

asr-006696
07:13:14.660 --> 07:13:15.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lahat, meron na.

asr-006697
07:13:16.560 --> 07:13:19.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi. Phase 1 at saka Phase 2.

asr-006698
07:13:19.340 --> 07:13:20.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Puro pa yung consultation.

asr-006699
07:13:21.040 --> 07:13:22.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Saka wala pa rin application eh.

asr-006700
07:13:22.640 --> 07:13:25.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, walang application para sa lahat.

asr-006701
07:13:25.380 --> 07:13:29.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero, itong mga sinasabi na maapektuhang puno,

asr-006702
07:13:29.880 --> 07:13:33.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lahat po ito ay parte ng tree inventory ng DENR.

asr-006703
07:13:35.920 --> 07:13:40.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nasa inventory stage pa lang yan sa lahat ng maapektuhang puno,

asr-006704
07:13:40.560 --> 07:13:41.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: madam speaker.

asr-006705
07:13:42.740 --> 07:13:46.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At saka yung importante, yung community consultation,

asr-006706
07:13:47.020 --> 07:13:49.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: sana nandun ka rin para, madam speaker,

asr-006707
07:13:49.340 --> 07:13:54.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: para mapagtulungan natin na mabigyan sila ng tamang desisyon

asr-006708
07:13:54.740 --> 07:13:58.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: na kung ang community magsabi, ay putulin na yan dahil matanda na yan,

asr-006709
07:13:58.540 --> 07:14:00.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: palitan na lang natin, ay pumayag na tayo.

asr-006710
07:14:01.280 --> 07:14:03.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero kung ang community mismo mag-resist,

asr-006711
07:14:03.480 --> 07:14:05.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ayaw nila, gusto nila makitin lang yung karsadang nila,

asr-006712
07:14:06.140 --> 07:14:08.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: so be it, madam speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006713
07:14:09.180 --> 07:14:13.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Diba? Kaysa putulin mo yung 100-year-old, 150-year-old na akasya.

asr-006714
07:14:14.940 --> 07:14:16.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, malinaw, madam speaker,

asr-006715
07:14:17.420 --> 07:14:19.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: wala pang kahit anong application.

asr-006716
07:14:19.340 --> 07:14:24.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa three cutting permits sa Bridge 2 and 3,

asr-006717
07:14:24.940 --> 07:14:29.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at wala pang kahit anong application sa ngayon na aaprubahan.

asr-006718
07:14:30.100 --> 07:14:30.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay.

asr-006719
07:14:31.780 --> 07:14:35.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung gayon, madam speaker, meron na bang environmental impact assessment

asr-006720
07:14:35.760 --> 07:14:38.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang buong ADB Metro Manila Bridges?

asr-006721
07:14:39.540 --> 07:14:41.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paari ba kaming makahingi ng kopya ngayon?

asr-006722
07:14:43.260 --> 07:14:46.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang magawa nila, per merong yan, madam speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-006723
07:14:46.740 --> 07:14:48.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ay yung AIS.

asr-006724
07:14:48.600 --> 07:14:49.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Magawa lang yan.

asr-006725
07:14:49.340 --> 07:14:50.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pag may application na.

asr-006726
07:14:50.480 --> 07:14:52.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But, before the application,

asr-006727
07:14:52.320 --> 07:14:53.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: pag meron nang nagre-reklamo,

asr-006728
07:14:53.660 --> 07:14:55.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: pwede na nila i-eyeball yun, puntahan nila yun,

asr-006729
07:14:56.080 --> 07:14:56.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: i-ocular nila.

asr-006730
07:14:57.260 --> 07:14:59.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para lang makita nila kung ano yung gagawin nila.

asr-006731
07:15:00.000 --> 07:15:09.040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In the future. So, yung AIS naman, pag meron ng application, bago sila hihingi ng environmental impact study.

asr-006732
07:15:11.320 --> 07:15:17.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero Madam Speaker, kung sa ECC naman, no lahat ito meron ng ECC, ang Bridges 1, 2, and 3.

asr-006733
07:15:17.580 --> 07:15:22.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At maghihingi po ng kopya ang representasyon na ito mula sa Gabriela Women's Park.

asr-006734
07:15:22.860 --> 07:15:24.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: May ECC ba yung pagbutol ng puno?

asr-006735
07:15:24.340 --> 07:15:38.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: O, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, hindi ko pa alam na meron palang ECC yung pagbutol ng puno.

asr-006736
07:15:38.880 --> 07:15:45.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi yung environmental impact study, it will suffice.

asr-006737
07:15:45.720 --> 07:15:52.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Because the AIS will tell you whether an ECC is applicable or not.

asr-006738
07:15:53.200 --> 07:15:54.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, ganun yun.

asr-006739
07:15:54.340 --> 07:15:56.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006740
07:15:57.860 --> 07:16:03.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, kasi ho, kasabi din sa atin ng DPWH nung hinarap natin ang issue na ito.

asr-006741
07:16:03.480 --> 07:16:04.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi sila yung mag-a-apply.

asr-006742
07:16:05.240 --> 07:16:06.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: DPWH, Madam Speaker?

asr-006743
07:16:06.420 --> 07:16:08.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes. O, sila kasi yung mag-a-apply.

asr-006744
07:16:08.500 --> 07:16:09.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, sinabi naman nila.

asr-006745
07:16:09.580 --> 07:16:11.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang proponent, DPWH, Madam Speaker?

asr-006746
07:16:13.060 --> 07:16:23.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi nila sa atin na baka yung Bridges 2 ay magkaroon ng pagbabago sa kanilang design.

asr-006747
07:16:23.800 --> 07:16:25.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O kung saan dadaan ang mga lugar.

asr-006748
07:16:25.480 --> 07:16:28.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi meron din mga pagtutol yung mga villages.

asr-006749
07:16:28.760 --> 07:16:38.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi nila, nag-uusap na daw ang DPWH at ang DepDev na magkakaroon ng restructuring sa buong proyekto.

asr-006750
07:16:39.760 --> 07:16:43.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang DNR po ba nabalitaan tungkol dito o wala pa sa ngayon?

asr-006751
07:16:45.000 --> 07:16:46.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala. Wala pa, Madam Speaker.

asr-006752
07:16:48.040 --> 07:16:49.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, Madam Speaker.

asr-006753
07:16:49.380 --> 07:16:53.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang ngayon naman po sa ibang issue na may kinalaman.

asr-006754
07:16:53.800 --> 07:16:54.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa LLDA.

asr-006755
07:16:55.100 --> 07:17:03.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang aming opisina ay nakatanggap ng liham mula sa nagkakaisang mamamayan ng Tadlac 1A.

asr-006756
07:17:04.400 --> 07:17:15.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ay naka-address sa Department of Environment and Natural Resources, sa DNR, at sa Laguna Lake Development Authority, sa LLDA.

asr-006757
07:17:16.760 --> 07:17:23.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi po dito, sila daw po ay humihingi sa inyo ng sertifikasyon, ng klasifikasyon,

asr-006758
07:17:23.800 --> 07:17:27.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng lupa para sa kanilang lupa na tinitirhan.

asr-006759
07:17:28.440 --> 07:17:41.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa ngayon po sa kanila, ito daw po ay itinuturing na domain land at bahagi ng hindi maipagbibiling pampublikong lupa, inalienable public land.

asr-006760
07:17:41.940 --> 07:17:47.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit sa ngayon po, meron daw pong nagkiklaim na private owner dun sa kanilang lupa.

asr-006761
07:17:48.540 --> 07:17:53.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natanggap na po ba ito ng LLDA at ng DNR?

asr-006762
07:17:53.800 --> 07:17:56.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Naipadala daw po ito ngayong May 2026.

asr-006763
07:17:58.780 --> 07:18:26.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, tungkol doon sa mga nare-reclaim sa Laguna Lake, alam mo naman, na-diyaryo 'yan lately. May mga concerned high individuals na sangkot diyan. Mahirap na magkomento, ngunit ang DENR mismo nagsasabi ay wala pa silang na-issue na reclamation permit. Wala, walang mga na-issue. Ilegal po 'yun, Madam Speaker.

asr-006763-split-2
07:18:26.700 --> 07:18:34.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang isyo na ito, Madam Speaker, ay meron ng mga pinapalayas na mga magsasaka at naninirahan dun sa lugar.

asr-006764
07:18:35.680 --> 07:18:44.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang kwento po nila, noong 1980s, sumubok daw po sila, in early 2000s, na magkaroon ng titulo yung mga lupa na yun.

asr-006765
07:18:44.280 --> 07:18:46.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang paliwanag nga sa kanila ay hindi yun pwede matitulohan.

asr-006766
07:18:47.880 --> 07:18:53.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, nabigla po sila ngayon na merong private claimant.

asr-006767
07:18:53.960 --> 07:19:00.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na hindi po nila kakilala at niminsan ay hindi nila nakita dun sa lugar na nagsasabi na sa kanila daw po yung lupa.

asr-006768
07:19:00.680 --> 07:19:08.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, ang punto ng liham na ito na is po nilang mag-ocular visit.

asr-006769
07:19:08.020 --> 07:19:19.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mag-karoon ng inspeksyon dun sa lugar, ang DNR, ang LLDA, para makita talaga nila yung sitwasyon ng pagpapalayas sa mga magsasaka.

asr-006770
07:19:19.740 --> 07:19:23.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At matiyak natin na mapapangalagaan, hindi lang yung kabuhayan.

asr-006771
07:19:23.800 --> 07:19:34.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Itong mga magsasaka, kundi matiyak din yung kanilang karapatan sa panirahan sa lupa na kanilang sinasaka o malapit sa kanilang sinasaka.

asr-006772
07:19:35.060 --> 07:19:47.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, lalo na kung mga illegal yun na pagtambak doon at saka in-occupy ng ating mga kapatid na maralita, magsasaka ito o mangingisda?

asr-006773
07:19:48.560 --> 07:19:52.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mga magsasaka at meron din pong ilan na nagfifish pond.

asr-006774
07:19:52.620 --> 07:19:53.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Magsasaka sa pil?

asr-006775
07:19:53.800 --> 07:19:53.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-006776
07:19:53.960 --> 07:19:56.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa lupa at saka yung mangingisda sa lawa?

asr-006777
07:19:56.860 --> 07:19:57.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-006778
07:19:57.320 --> 07:19:59.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tapos sila daw ay matagal nang nakatira.

asr-006779
07:20:00.460 --> 07:20:02.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Karamihan yan, yung mga illegal tambak dyan.

asr-006780
07:20:02.900 --> 07:20:09.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala silang, ang DNR wala pa pong pangkalahatang solusyon dyan.

asr-006781
07:20:09.660 --> 07:20:13.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dahil hindi man yan na legal na reclamation.

asr-006782
07:20:13.480 --> 07:20:23.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung reclamation na yan na pinadaan sa PRA, na binigyan ng PRA ng permit para, tandaan mo Madam Speaker,

asr-006783
07:20:23.800 --> 07:20:30.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kung ang reclamation sa lawa o sa dagat ay land for the landless, that is permitted.

asr-006784
07:20:31.380 --> 07:20:39.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya yung mga maku-occupy doon na kasunod sa pagtambak ng may pahintulot ang PRA ay hindi po yun illegal.

asr-006785
07:20:39.920 --> 07:20:41.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, extinguish kulig.

asr-006786
07:20:41.900 --> 07:20:45.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon Madam Speaker, wala po itong kahit anong permit mula sa PRA.

asr-006787
07:20:45.520 --> 07:20:50.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron pong pribado na pumapasok na gustong magtayo ng resort doon sa lugar at sila ay pinapanayos.

asr-006788
07:20:50.560 --> 07:20:53.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, ang kalawakan ng tinutukoy mo.

asr-006789
07:20:53.800 --> 07:20:57.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngunit dyan sa lawa, wala talagang binibigyan ng permit dyan para mag-reclaim.

asr-006790
07:20:58.280 --> 07:21:05.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Except yung mga karsada na gagawin dyan na pinag-aaralan pa hanggang ngayon Madam Speaker, extinguish kulig.

asr-006791
07:21:05.720 --> 07:21:17.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yan nga ang dahilan Madam Speaker kung bakit hiniingin ang representasyon na ito na bisitahin natin yung lugar dito na binabanggit sa Purok 1A, Barangay Tadlac, Los Baños, Laguna.

asr-006792
07:21:17.580 --> 07:21:18.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, kailangan.

asr-006793
07:21:18.720 --> 07:21:23.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At para makita po ninyo mismo yung sitwasyon at makita natin, marinig natin.

asr-006794
07:21:23.800 --> 07:21:25.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Wala doon sa ating mga kababayan mismo.

asr-006795
07:21:26.020 --> 07:21:32.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ba yung issue? Anong kinakailang aksyon? At paano tayo magtutulungan para matugunan ang kanilang issue?

asr-006796
07:21:32.980 --> 07:21:34.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, extinguish kulig.

asr-006797
07:21:34.580 --> 07:21:42.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I suggest that yung letter mo na yan, iproward mo sa concerned department sa DNR para matugunan ka agad yan.

asr-006798
07:21:43.080 --> 07:21:43.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes.

asr-006799
07:21:43.300 --> 07:21:50.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para alam mo naman ang DNR kung sino yung walang lupa ay binibigyan, hindi yung maraming lupa ang binibigyan.

asr-006800
07:21:51.840 --> 07:21:53.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sinisiguro ko yan Madam Speaker dahil...

asr-006801
07:21:53.800 --> 07:21:58.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Siyempre, the government is there for the side of the landless.

asr-006802
07:21:58.940 --> 07:22:10.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, just for the record po, when this was sent to the DNR and the LLDA, this representation was furnished with a copy.

asr-006803
07:22:11.280 --> 07:22:16.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And with due diligence, we forwarded the letter to the concerned agencies.

asr-006805
07:22:17.880 --> 07:22:23.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And then, dahil po ngayon, pinapaabot na po natin ulit at sana maaksyonan ito agad ng LLDA.

asr-006806
07:22:23.920 --> 07:22:26.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat.

asr-006807
07:22:26.300 --> 07:22:29.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, extinguish kulig. Please give me a copy of that letter.

asr-006808
07:22:30.340 --> 07:22:34.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And I assure you, Madam Speaker, gagawa ng aksyon yung mga taga-DNR.

asr-006809
07:22:35.840 --> 07:22:36.440
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-006810
07:22:37.080 --> 07:22:45.960
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Madam Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Rene Louie M. Co. from Kabataan Partylist.

asr-006811
07:22:45.960 --> 07:22:47.040
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: So move, Madam Speaker.

asr-006812
07:22:47.600 --> 07:22:52.320
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Rene Louie M. Co. from Kabataan Partylist is hereby recognized for her interpolation.

asr-006813
07:22:53.140 --> 07:22:53.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

asr-006814
07:22:53.800 --> 07:23:00.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Madam Speaker. And good afternoon to our distinguished sponsor and the Department of Environment and Natural Resources.

asr-006815
07:23:01.400 --> 07:23:10.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May the gentleman yield to a couple of questions in relation to the spending of the DNR as planned by fiscal year 2027.

asr-006816
07:23:10.380 --> 07:23:12.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Gladly, Madam Speaker. Extinguish kulig. Go ahead, please.

asr-006817
07:23:13.620 --> 07:23:19.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor. My first question would be in relation to Paxilica.

asr-006818
07:23:20.120 --> 07:23:23.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This representation is heartened to receive.

asr-006819
07:23:23.800 --> 07:23:34.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The at least preliminary briefer from the DNR in relation to its findings of Paxilica with the available information.

asr-006820
07:23:34.180 --> 07:23:42.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We'd like to supplement a little further given that we've been asking various agencies what they know of this project.

asr-006821
07:23:43.120 --> 07:23:53.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And of course, what we would like to ensure and to clarify dahil nakadulot po ito talaga ng maraming mga tanong, concerns.

asr-006822
07:23:53.800 --> 07:23:56.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa mga mamayan tungkol sa iba't-ibang issues.

asr-006823
07:23:57.160 --> 07:24:04.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang pinaka-na-perview naman po ng DNR dito ay yung usaping kalikasan, usaping tubig, usaping lupa.

asr-006824
07:24:05.420 --> 07:24:17.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: In the last Committee on Appropriations for DTI meeting, Undersecretary Ridolfo stated that investors are expected to provide their own power and water for the proposed Paxilica development in New Clark City.

asr-006826
07:24:17.520 --> 07:24:23.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But contrary to this, the government, through a Malacañang press conference, has publicly assured

asr-006827
07:24:23.800 --> 07:24:53.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that the said development will have sufficient water without compromising the supply of surrounding communities. The National Water Resources Board reportedly stated that available sources within the project area can meet the proposed facilities' requirements and that community water needs will remain the priority. BCDA has separately stated that the proposed surface water harvesting system could initially supply up to 120 million liters per day, compared

asr-006828
07:24:53.800 --> 07:25:05.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: With an estimated Paxilica requirement of approximately 65 to 90 million liters per day, with potential expansion of the system to 300 million liters per day.

asr-006829
07:25:05.060 --> 07:25:12.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So ang pansin po natin, iba-iba yung nire-report sa atin ng iba't-ibang ahensya tungkol sa tubig.

asr-006830
07:25:12.840 --> 07:25:16.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung una, sige pahala po yung Paxilica na maghanap ng tubig.

asr-006831
07:25:17.260 --> 07:25:23.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tapos ngayon, meron na pong mga iba't-ibang sources na tinutukoy at may pag-aaral at pag-iimbestiga na po.

asr-006832
07:25:23.800 --> 07:25:25.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa kung paano ba bibigyan yan.

asr-006833
07:25:26.260 --> 07:25:33.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So may I ask, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, pwede po bang ipaliwanag ng DENR yung contradictions between the two statements

asr-006834
07:25:33.020 --> 07:25:40.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at ikumpirma sa publiko, once and for all, ano po ba ang totoo at established for the sake of public knowledge?

asr-006835
07:25:41.300 --> 07:25:46.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, my favorite topic, Paxilica.

asr-006836
07:25:49.140 --> 07:25:53.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Out of the more than 3,000 hectares na BCDA property,

asr-006837
07:25:53.800 --> 07:26:00.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: dyan sa Northern Luzon, 960 lang yung original na envision for Paxilica.

asr-006838
07:26:01.760 --> 07:26:12.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung Paxilica, for the information of everyone, this is just an advanced planning kasi kung mawawala yung Taiwan which has four chips maker.

asr-006839
07:26:12.540 --> 07:26:16.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang isa, TSMC, NVIDA, hindi ko lang matandaan yung dalawa.

asr-006840
07:26:17.100 --> 07:26:22.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung ma-overrun ng China ang Taiwan, ay at least may replacement sila na magpakukunan.

asr-006841
07:26:22.280 --> 07:26:26.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lahat ng ating kabuhayan ngayon ay dependent na po sa chips.

asr-006842
07:26:27.000 --> 07:26:32.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung telepono na ginagamit ng ating distinguished colleague, yung telepono ko,

asr-006843
07:26:33.240 --> 07:26:42.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: eh kung wala yung mga chips maker na yan, yung mga drones, yung mga AI instruments,

asr-006844
07:26:43.380 --> 07:26:52.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: halos lahat ng ating future requirements ay magagampanan ng project na yung Paxilica.

asr-006845
07:26:52.280 --> 07:26:59.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Now, if you are so concerned about the water resources in the Philippines, napakarami nating tubig.

asr-006846
07:27:00.940 --> 07:27:06.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi lang natin iniipon yung tubig natin at saka ginagamit.

asr-006847
07:27:06.840 --> 07:27:14.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung mapunta ka sa bayan ng Korea, Madam Speaker, lahat ng ridges doon sa bundok mayroong impounding dam sa baba.

asr-006848
07:27:15.300 --> 07:27:21.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya maski abot sila ng limang buwan hanggang anum na buwan na ilin ninyo, ay hindi po sila naubusan ng tubig.

asr-006849
07:27:22.280 --> 07:27:25.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Doon sa atin, sa Central Luzon, napakaraming underground water.

asr-006850
07:27:25.700 --> 07:27:33.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But if I were the government, I will not allow this kind of project to extract water from the underground aquifer, Madam Speaker,

asr-006851
07:27:34.320 --> 07:27:38.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: because the underground aquifer is not an infinite source.

asr-006852
07:27:40.060 --> 07:27:46.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Walang tubig na nanggagaling sa ilalim ng lupa. Lahat yan ay recharged ng rainfall.

asr-006853
07:27:46.940 --> 07:27:52.140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Papunta po, nag-infiltrate sa ilalim ng lupa. Kaya na-stack up sila doon sa underground aquifer.

asr-006854
07:27:52.280 --> 07:27:57.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung marami naman ang extraction natin, makakaroon niya ng mga land subsidence.

asr-006855
07:27:58.020 --> 07:28:07.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya dyan sa Northern Luzon, starting from Pampanga up doon sa mga kabundukan sa Sierra Madre, ay maraming tubig dyan.

asr-006856
07:28:08.260 --> 07:28:11.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngunit, that is reserved for the communities.

asr-006857
07:28:12.080 --> 07:28:16.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If itong Paxilica, if I were the government, they will have to bring their own power.

asr-006858
07:28:16.980 --> 07:28:18.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: They will have to bring their own water.

asr-006859
07:28:18.860 --> 07:28:21.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung water naman, ayaw kang create water.

asr-006860
07:28:22.280 --> 07:28:23.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: You can rely on the water on the underground.

asr-006861
07:28:24.580 --> 07:28:26.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: You can rely on the surface water.

asr-006862
07:28:27.440 --> 07:28:38.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung sinasabi nilang 100 million liters a day is only 100,000 cubic meters yan, Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-006863
07:28:38.860 --> 07:28:45.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya naman, kung 10 million liters, 100 million liters ang kailangan nila isang araw,

asr-006864
07:28:46.200 --> 07:28:47.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: i-reduce mo yan to cubic meters.

asr-006865
07:28:47.820 --> 07:28:49.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi masyadong marami yan.

asr-006866
07:28:49.980 --> 07:28:51.880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If you measure, Madam Speaker,

asr-006867
07:28:52.280 --> 07:28:53.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: distinguished colleague,

asr-006868
07:28:53.900 --> 07:28:56.780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yung outflow ng tubig natin sa Central Luzon,

asr-006869
07:28:57.320 --> 07:28:59.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: sa Lower Luzon, at saka sa Upper Luzon,

asr-006870
07:29:00.020 --> 07:29:00.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: papuntang dagat,

asr-006871
07:29:01.240 --> 07:29:05.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: that is only one second output ng tubig papunta sa dagat.

asr-006872
07:29:05.580 --> 07:29:08.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya huwag tayo matakot na walang tubig sa Pilipinas.

asr-006873
07:29:08.800 --> 07:29:11.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napakarami natin tubig dito sa Pilipinas.

asr-006874
07:29:11.420 --> 07:29:12.940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sobra-sobra ang tubig dito.

asr-006875
07:29:13.460 --> 07:29:18.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngunit, pinagsasayang lang natin, tinatapo natin sa dagat, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-006876
07:29:18.900 --> 07:29:20.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006877
07:29:22.280 --> 07:29:26.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pinagsasayang lang natin dito ay mismong mga anecdotes ng mga pinuntahan nating mga komunidad

asr-006878
07:29:26.740 --> 07:29:30.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na malapit sa ini-estimate na tatayo ang Paxilica site.

asr-006879
07:29:31.020 --> 07:29:32.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kulang daw yung tubig nila.

asr-006880
07:29:32.840 --> 07:29:36.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po sila makapagsurvive in a day nang hindi nawawala yung tubig.

asr-006881
07:29:36.720 --> 07:29:40.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, assuming if true yung sinabi po ng ating distinguished sponsor na marami,

asr-006882
07:29:41.260 --> 07:29:46.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ngunit hindi rin po maayos yung sistema ng pagkalap nito at even yung distribution,

asr-006883
07:29:46.260 --> 07:29:51.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: no, sana ito ay mag-reflect doon sa magiging assessment ng DENR,

asr-006884
07:29:51.680 --> 07:29:56.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung paano i-recommend, kung paano kunin ng Paxilica yung tubig nila.

asr-006885
07:29:56.560 --> 07:29:59.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ngunit ang next natanong ko po, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006887
07:30:00.000 --> 07:30:14.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Considering that the Water Resources Vulnerability and Sustainability Assessment Program ng DNR is being reduced by 26.73% ng budget sa fiscal year 2027 ng NEP,

asr-006888
07:30:14.300 --> 07:30:23.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: how will WRB finance the additional hydrological and climate risk assessments required by a development of this magnitude?

asr-006889
07:30:23.300 --> 07:30:31.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang na-mention nga po ng ating good sponsor is that this is some 900 hectares or 3,000 hectares in vision.

asr-006890
07:30:32.280 --> 07:30:41.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pag susukatin po ng DNR kung paano po gagawa ng paraan na may tubig po ang mga locators at kung ano pong i-establish dito,

asr-006891
07:30:41.560 --> 07:30:44.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kaya po ba ito ng budget ng NWRB?

asr-006892
07:30:45.360 --> 07:30:50.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung budget ng DNR ngayon, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, maliit nga para dyan.

asr-006893
07:30:51.680 --> 07:30:53.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, kung ako yung gabi,

asr-006894
07:30:53.300 --> 07:30:56.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kung ako yung gobyerno, siyempre, eh paghahandaan natin ito.

asr-006895
07:30:57.560 --> 07:31:00.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung sinabi ko maraming tubig ang buong Pilipinas, totoo po yan.

asr-006896
07:31:01.480 --> 07:31:03.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa district ko lang, I have 27 rivers eh.

asr-006897
07:31:04.440 --> 07:31:11.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, dito sa Northern Luzon, I don't know the count of how many rivers is from the Caldera area going to the east,

asr-006898
07:31:12.120 --> 07:31:17.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: from the Caldera area sa Isabela going to the west side.

asr-006899
07:31:17.120 --> 07:31:22.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At dito naman sa Central Plain natin, yung mga tubig na iimbak sa mga dam,

asr-006900
07:31:22.680 --> 07:31:23.120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: napagsuburan.

asr-006901
07:31:23.300 --> 07:31:26.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa dam na i-release, that becomes flood doon sa Pampanga.

asr-006902
07:31:27.120 --> 07:31:33.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh lahat, Madam Speaker, that's why I earnestly urge our distinguished colleague

asr-006903
07:31:33.320 --> 07:31:38.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: to recommend the increased budget of the DNR para naman lahat yan matugunan.

asr-006904
07:31:39.160 --> 07:31:41.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pa namang application yung silika.

asr-006905
07:31:41.360 --> 07:31:45.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pinag-uusapan pa lang yung investment forum na nangyari dyan sa BGC.

asr-006906
07:31:46.140 --> 07:31:49.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, pinag-uusapan pa lang yung mga requirements sa Paksilika.

asr-006907
07:31:49.440 --> 07:31:50.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At saka ilang kumpanya.

asr-006908
07:31:51.160 --> 07:31:53.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung mga kababayan natin,

asr-006909
07:31:53.300 --> 07:31:54.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: nag-demonstrate doon.

asr-006910
07:31:54.620 --> 07:31:56.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nandun si Teddy Casino, nakita ko.

asr-006911
07:31:57.260 --> 07:31:58.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dyan sa BGC.

asr-006912
07:31:58.960 --> 07:31:59.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006913
07:31:59.960 --> 07:32:01.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Very premature yung Madam Speaker.

asr-006914
07:32:01.720 --> 07:32:04.580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi hindi pa, naku-quantify, ikaw ilan talaga.

asr-006915
07:32:05.000 --> 07:32:06.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Haka-haka lang yun.

asr-006916
07:32:06.180 --> 07:32:08.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang kuryente gamitin, ganito karami.

asr-006917
07:32:08.300 --> 07:32:09.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang tubig, ganito karami.

asr-006918
07:32:09.960 --> 07:32:11.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kulang ang tubig para sa mamamayan.

asr-006919
07:32:12.340 --> 07:32:14.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh lahat yan, Madam Speaker, masolusyonan man yan.

asr-006920
07:32:14.620 --> 07:32:15.540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala mang problema yan.

asr-006921
07:32:16.000 --> 07:32:18.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Basta, there is political will.

asr-006922
07:32:19.080 --> 07:32:21.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: It can be done, Madam Speaker.

asr-006923
07:32:21.420 --> 07:32:23.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: distinguished colleague.

asr-006925
07:32:23.300 --> 07:32:26.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Kulig.

asr-006926
07:32:26.660 --> 07:32:32.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang sinasabi po ba ay kung kailangan po ng DNR na tignan

asr-006927
07:32:32.100 --> 07:32:38.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung paano yung hydrological climate risk assessments,

asr-006928
07:32:38.460 --> 07:32:40.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kulang yung budget niya sa ngayon?

asr-006929
07:32:41.380 --> 07:32:41.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: As proposed?

asr-006930
07:32:41.840 --> 07:32:46.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, kung patuloy tayo doon sa diskusyon ng Paksilika,

asr-006931
07:32:46.180 --> 07:32:47.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: abutin tayo ng umaga rito.

asr-006932
07:32:47.800 --> 07:32:49.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Suggestion ko na lang, Madam Speaker,

asr-006933
07:32:49.420 --> 07:32:51.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ilipat natin yung Paksilika sa Palawan.

asr-006934
07:32:51.220 --> 07:32:52.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ako ng bahala sa tubig.

asr-006935
07:32:52.780 --> 07:32:53.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ako ng bahala.

asr-006936
07:32:53.300 --> 07:32:54.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ilipat natin yung bahala sa kuryente nila.

asr-006937
07:32:55.380 --> 07:32:56.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Well, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-006938
07:32:57.120 --> 07:33:02.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We're actually requesting more information on the DNR's budget and their capacity.

asr-006939
07:33:02.760 --> 07:33:08.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That's why we have to predicate our questions doon sa mga mangyayaring

asr-006940
07:33:08.280 --> 07:33:13.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: meron ng konklusyon na ganito kalaki ang factory na ilalagay,

asr-006941
07:33:14.200 --> 07:33:17.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ang konsumo ng ilang factory, ganito karaming tubig, ganito karaming kuryente.

asr-006942
07:33:18.300 --> 07:33:20.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: We will require them to put up their own power.

asr-006943
07:33:20.620 --> 07:33:22.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Just like what I did in Palawan.

asr-006944
07:33:23.300 --> 07:33:29.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang 250 milyong daran na leaching plant, yung sumitomo para ma-process yung mga low-grade nickel ores.

asr-006945
07:33:30.000 --> 07:33:31.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sabi ko, magdalagay ng kuryente.

asr-006946
07:33:31.360 --> 07:33:32.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala kaming kuryente.

asr-006947
07:33:32.180 --> 07:33:32.800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Naglagay sila.

asr-006948
07:33:33.220 --> 07:33:35.080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 43 megawatt o coal plant.

asr-006949
07:33:35.460 --> 07:33:36.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala naman nakreklamo.

asr-006950
07:33:36.520 --> 07:33:37.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maraming nakatrabaho.

asr-006951
07:33:37.760 --> 07:33:38.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Happy lahat.

asr-006952
07:33:38.740 --> 07:33:39.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi naupas ang tubig namin.

asr-006953
07:33:40.800 --> 07:33:43.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, ganun dapat.

asr-006954
07:33:43.940 --> 07:33:49.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero, so Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, I'd like to take your answer dahil nga po tinatanong natin,

asr-006955
07:33:49.620 --> 07:33:53.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may inaasahan tayo at nabigay.

asr-006956
07:33:53.300 --> 07:34:01.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaya, maliit ang budget, hindi enough at kailangan ng mas marami kung kailangan pong gawin yung impact assessment na ito

asr-006957
07:34:01.180 --> 07:34:07.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in terms of yung water na iko-konsumo, if ever, ng sapak silika.

asr-006958
07:34:07.320 --> 07:34:09.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But nonetheless, Madam Speaker, ang next naman nating tanong,

asr-006959
07:34:10.420 --> 07:34:14.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil may na-mention na nga po, inaasahang El Nino,

asr-006960
07:34:15.240 --> 07:34:19.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: will that also be part of the agency's assessment?

asr-006961
07:34:19.300 --> 07:34:23.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung titignan nga po yung mga konsumo na,

asr-006962
07:34:23.300 --> 07:34:26.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na gagamitin ng buong inisiyative na ito,

asr-006963
07:34:26.780 --> 07:34:32.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: anong assumptions po ba ang gagamitin concerning dry season river flows,

asr-006964
07:34:32.760 --> 07:34:34.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: drought and El Nino conditions,

asr-006965
07:34:35.040 --> 07:34:36.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: groundwater recharge,

asr-006966
07:34:36.860 --> 07:34:37.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: agricultural demand,

asr-006967
07:34:38.240 --> 07:34:39.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: future population growth,

asr-006968
07:34:39.420 --> 07:34:42.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: will these be part of DNR's assessment?

asr-006969
07:34:43.340 --> 07:34:46.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, yung executive,

asr-006970
07:34:47.620 --> 07:34:49.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: we'll cross the bridge when we get there.

asr-006971
07:34:50.000 --> 07:34:50.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pa ngayon yan eh.

asr-006972
07:34:51.040 --> 07:34:52.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lahat yan ang nakaplano pa lang.

asr-006973
07:34:52.380 --> 07:34:53.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In fact,

asr-006974
07:34:53.300 --> 07:34:56.900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: wala pang masyadong yung BCDA,

asr-006975
07:34:57.080 --> 07:35:01.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: that's why it was pinpointed because of the ease of securing the land.

asr-006976
07:35:02.220 --> 07:35:05.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron naman nagsasabi na yung mga katutubo doon, merong claim.

asr-006977
07:35:05.760 --> 07:35:07.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh madari, naman yung pacified eh.

asr-006978
07:35:07.620 --> 07:35:10.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tabi mo lang sila, bigyan mo sila ng kabuhayan doon sa,

asr-006979
07:35:10.920 --> 07:35:15.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: huwag silang mag-claim dyan sa envision as 960 hectares na yan.

asr-006980
07:35:16.080 --> 07:35:19.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That's more than 3,000 hectares yung BCDA dyan sa Northern Luzon.

asr-006981
07:35:20.520 --> 07:35:22.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So wala pang in-endorse,

asr-006982
07:35:22.680 --> 07:35:25.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: wala pang binigay ang executive dito sa DNR

asr-006983
07:35:25.880 --> 07:35:28.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kung ano yung mga parameters na pag-aralan nila.

asr-006984
07:35:28.500 --> 07:35:32.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pwede na mabasa mo lang sa dyaryo yung DNR, magre-react ka agad.

asr-006985
07:35:32.540 --> 07:35:33.300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala man sila.

asr-006986
07:35:33.700 --> 07:35:36.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kanino nila, Madam Speaker, i-request yung AIA,

asr-006987
07:35:37.060 --> 07:35:39.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yung Environmental Impact Study?

asr-006988
07:35:39.200 --> 07:35:40.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala eh. Wala pa nag-a-apply eh.

asr-006989
07:35:41.240 --> 07:35:44.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron nga nagsasabi na sa dyaryo na yan,

asr-006990
07:35:44.920 --> 07:35:48.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kaya nga nung isang araw na nakita ko,

asr-006991
07:35:48.660 --> 07:35:51.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: may mga kababayan natin nag-demonstrate doon sa

asr-006992
07:35:51.600 --> 07:35:52.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: kung saan na

asr-006993
07:35:52.480 --> 07:35:53.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ginawa yung Investment Forum,

asr-006994
07:35:54.240 --> 07:35:55.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: eh that is too early.

asr-006995
07:35:55.980 --> 07:36:00.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That is too eager to, too soon to say na masama yung Paxilica.

asr-006996
07:36:00.820 --> 07:36:02.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-006997
07:36:02.740 --> 07:36:05.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: naghahanda na po ba ang DNR dito?

asr-006998
07:36:05.480 --> 07:36:10.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I assume kahit po preliminary preparations para po mangyari ito,

asr-006999
07:36:11.160 --> 07:36:15.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dapat po ina-undertake na, may earmarking na pong nangyayari

asr-007000
07:36:15.540 --> 07:36:19.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po kung ano man po yung output ay handa ang DNR.

asr-007001
07:36:20.780 --> 07:36:22.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pangunguna lang.

asr-007002
07:36:22.480 --> 07:36:25.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At dahil dyan sa Pampanga River at saka yung Bulacan River, palaging may baha.

asr-007003
07:36:26.240 --> 07:36:29.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung DNR, meron na silang assessment doon sa Pampanga River. Una pa lang yan.

asr-007004
07:36:30.280 --> 07:36:35.360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pag yung Pampanga River at saka yung Bulacan River, nakapture nila yan at sinannel nila papuntang Paxilica,

asr-007005
07:36:35.540 --> 07:36:38.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: sobra-sobra na yung tubig doon, Madam Speaker, Stingvisco League.

asr-007006
07:36:38.720 --> 07:36:40.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Malulunod yung mga foreign investor dyan.

asr-007007
07:36:41.360 --> 07:36:45.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh nagre-reklamo na nga si Congresswoman Bundog sa akin na palaging may baha doon eh.

asr-007008
07:36:45.480 --> 07:36:48.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh kung matsannel lang natin yung baha na yung papunta sa Paxilica,

asr-007009
07:36:49.060 --> 07:36:50.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ang tubig,

asr-007010
07:36:50.440 --> 07:36:51.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: maski gaano kadumi,

asr-007011
07:36:51.720 --> 07:36:53.200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: napakadali ilinisin.

asr-007012
07:36:54.260 --> 07:36:58.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, hihingi na lang po ang representasyon na ito

asr-007013
07:36:58.480 --> 07:37:03.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng kopya ng existing hydrological assessments,

asr-007014
07:37:03.480 --> 07:37:06.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: lalo na po may El Nino din naman din pong parating,

asr-007015
07:37:06.540 --> 07:37:12.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: inaasahan natin maapektahan din po ang Region 3 at mga karating na region, lalo na po ang Tarlac.

asr-007016
07:37:12.640 --> 07:37:16.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na po at gagamitin din po ito sa Paxilica kung ito ay itatayo.

asr-007017
07:37:17.140 --> 07:37:21.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pag natapos, Madam Speaker, ang assessment nila pampanga river at saka yung Bulacan River,

asr-007018
07:37:21.720 --> 07:37:25.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I'll get a copy for you, ah, these two English colleagues. Walang problema.

asr-007019
07:37:25.900 --> 07:37:26.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-007020
07:37:26.480 --> 07:37:27.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At your service.

asr-007021
07:37:27.760 --> 07:37:28.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good sponsor.

asr-007022
07:37:29.240 --> 07:37:36.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang susunod po nating tanong ay pang-call naman po sa Critical Minerals Agreement na ang tingin nga po natin ay may connection eh.

asr-007023
07:37:36.900 --> 07:37:46.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero nonetheless, ang gusto ko pong itanong, ito po ay isang February 2026 agreement na pinasukan ng Pilipinas at ng Estados Unidos.

asr-007024
07:37:46.560 --> 07:37:50.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: From the United States State Department fact sheet,

asr-007025
07:37:50.440 --> 07:37:59.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron daw pong 38 memoranda of understanding or minerals frameworks that they've agreed with other countries.

asr-007026
07:38:00.080 --> 07:38:06.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This is 38. Isa lang yung Pilipinas sa maraming sumama na may ganitong mga endeavors.

asr-007027
07:38:06.680 --> 07:38:19.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At sa pagkakalap at pag-analisa ng mamamayan ng publicly available pronouncements and documents, nakikita na 27 such deals exist.

asr-007028
07:38:20.440 --> 07:38:25.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: To date, this is 15 MOUs and 12 framework agreements.

asr-007029
07:38:25.620 --> 07:38:35.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Less than half of the MOUs announced have been made fully public, only two of which were released by the U.S. government, and the rest are public thanks to partner countries.

asr-007030
07:38:35.960 --> 07:38:47.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At gusto ko lang pong magbigay ng konteksto na isa rin po ang Myanmar na may single mine na sinuspende ang operations in 2023.

asr-007031
07:38:47.580 --> 07:38:49.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At nung nangyari po iyon,

asr-007032
07:38:50.440 --> 07:39:08.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at meron din naman po na mga ibat-ibang endeavors by which yung pagmimina kapag ito'y nakakompromise by U.S. sanctions, the world supply suffers.

asr-007033
07:39:09.860 --> 07:39:14.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang tanong po natin, nakakuha na po tayo ng kopya ng Memorandum of Understanding

asr-007034
07:39:14.760 --> 07:39:17.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng Critical Minerals na...

asr-007035
07:39:18.360 --> 07:39:19.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on Critical Minerals.

asr-007036
07:39:20.440 --> 07:39:21.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng U.S. at Pilipinas.

asr-007037
07:39:22.320 --> 07:39:24.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At DENR po ang signatory dito.

asr-007038
07:39:24.620 --> 07:39:31.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tinanong po natin yung DFA kung may kopya sila, may wisdom po ba sa pag-enter nito.

asr-007039
07:39:32.960 --> 07:39:40.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang sinasabi po nila, huli DENR yung naglatag ng pangailangan nito at nag-agree nito.

asr-007040
07:39:40.640 --> 07:39:43.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And can I get a preliminary confirmation?

asr-007041
07:39:44.520 --> 07:39:49.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron daw pong national importance document na tinransmit ang DENR.

asr-007042
07:39:50.440 --> 07:39:58.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa DFA, na kaya po ay na mabilis na napirmahan ang Critical Minerals MOU.

asr-007043
07:39:58.380 --> 07:40:00.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Is this correct, Madam Speaker? Good sponsor?

asr-007044
07:40:01.960 --> 07:40:06.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, synopsis pa lang yun.

asr-007045
07:40:07.700 --> 07:40:13.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bigyan kita ng kopya nito para at least kung may akahaka, may mga katanungan.

asr-007046
07:40:13.940 --> 07:40:14.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pa yun.

asr-007047
07:40:15.100 --> 07:40:17.740
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh yung EO tungkol sa Critical Minerals.

asr-007048
07:40:17.740 --> 07:40:19.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If you ask me,

asr-007049
07:40:20.440 --> 07:40:22.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: saan ka ba, Madam Speaker?

asr-007050
07:40:23.320 --> 07:40:26.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung mineral na natutulog doon sa ilalim ng bundok o sa ilalim ng lupa,

asr-007051
07:40:27.760 --> 07:40:30.400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: eh dapat pakinabangan na yan sa henerasyon na ito.

asr-007052
07:40:30.960 --> 07:40:34.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung hindi man maubos yan, then we will reserve it for the next generation.

asr-007053
07:40:35.700 --> 07:40:39.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh aanhin mo yung mineral na yun kung hindi ma-extract ng tama.

asr-007054
07:40:39.720 --> 07:40:43.340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Provided, during the extraction process,

asr-007055
07:40:43.340 --> 07:40:49.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: the environmental requirements are fully complied with.

asr-007056
07:40:50.320 --> 07:40:50.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi.

asr-007057
07:40:50.440 --> 07:40:56.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi natin sinisira yung kapaligiran kasi hindi naman nangangahulugan na pag hinukay mo yung lupa,

asr-007058
07:40:57.420 --> 07:40:59.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: isinira mo na kaagad yung kapaligiran.

asr-007059
07:40:59.840 --> 07:41:03.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh pag hinukay mo, kinuha mo yung mineral, tinabakan mo ulit, tinanamay mo ng puno,

asr-007060
07:41:03.520 --> 07:41:04.860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: sino pa makakita, di wala na.

asr-007061
07:41:05.580 --> 07:41:05.920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi ba?

asr-007062
07:41:06.540 --> 07:41:14.660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, but the DNR must be the policeman of the whole country in extraction of the minerals.

asr-007063
07:41:14.660 --> 07:41:19.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang ibig-ibig, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, na yung DNR natin ay inutil.

asr-007064
07:41:20.020 --> 07:41:20.420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I don't know.

asr-007065
07:41:20.440 --> 07:41:21.320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I don't subscribe to that.

asr-007066
07:41:21.700 --> 07:41:22.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi naman sila inutil.

asr-007067
07:41:23.140 --> 07:41:24.460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kulang lang sila sa budget.

asr-007068
07:41:25.000 --> 07:41:32.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya nga, I request, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, that you move to increase the budget of the DNR

asr-007069
07:41:32.160 --> 07:41:41.160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: para mas mapangalagaan ang ating kabundukan, kagubatan, at saka sa ilalim ng lupa ito.

asr-007070
07:41:41.400 --> 07:41:44.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I'll give you a copy of this so that hindi nakakahaka.

asr-007071
07:41:44.580 --> 07:41:48.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I would like to request din as well and we'll wait for that document.

asr-007072
07:41:48.120 --> 07:41:49.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero, Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ang tanong ko po.

asr-007073
07:41:50.440 --> 07:41:59.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tama po ba that the DNR transmitted to the DFA national significance or national importance document or certification

asr-007074
07:41:59.660 --> 07:42:08.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na yun po ang naging key na mas mabilis na napirmahan at na-finalize in Critical Minerals Memorandum of Understanding.

asr-007075
07:42:08.440 --> 07:42:08.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Is this correct?

asr-007076
07:42:10.640 --> 07:42:14.220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: On the claim that the MOU was kept secret.

asr-007077
07:42:15.840 --> 07:42:16.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Title of the MOU.

asr-007078
07:42:16.980 --> 07:42:19.440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: MOU, remember, is not an MOA.

asr-007079
07:42:19.780 --> 07:42:20.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, po.

asr-007080
07:42:20.160 --> 07:42:22.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I'd actually ask, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-007081
07:42:22.300 --> 07:42:28.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Between the government of the Republic of the Philippines and the government of the United States of America

asr-007082
07:42:28.600 --> 07:42:36.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: concerning cooperation to diversify globally critical mineral supply chains and promote investment.

asr-007083
07:42:36.960 --> 07:42:37.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yun lang po, yun eh.

asr-007084
07:42:38.720 --> 07:42:40.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: MOU lang, hindi MOA.

asr-007085
07:42:42.180 --> 07:42:45.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Memorandum of Understanding has no financial impact.

asr-007086
07:42:46.520 --> 07:42:49.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May I get a confirmation on the question, Madam Speaker, good sponsor?

asr-007087
07:42:50.160 --> 07:43:00.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Did the DNR issue a national significance certification that allowed the passage of the Critical Minerals MOU?

asr-007088
07:43:01.940 --> 07:43:04.180
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Oh, na-clear pa sila sa DFA.

asr-007089
07:43:04.480 --> 07:43:04.720
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes.

asr-007090
07:43:05.700 --> 07:43:06.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: MOU lang ito.

asr-007091
07:43:09.120 --> 07:43:17.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ah, Madam Speaker, my distinguished colleague, Mr. Erice, is number one miner in the country.

asr-007092
07:43:18.040 --> 07:43:19.480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, Madam Speaker.

asr-007093
07:43:20.160 --> 07:43:26.000
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pabor siya dito sa EO ng Critical Minerals.

asr-007094
07:43:26.600 --> 07:43:29.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, ang dami nating mga kababayan, makinabangan nito eh.

asr-007095
07:43:30.920 --> 07:43:32.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-007096
07:43:33.540 --> 07:43:37.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Natanong na rin naman po, na-bring up na iba ang MOU sa MOA.

asr-007097
07:43:38.120 --> 07:43:44.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po ba nating matanong, ang DNR po ba ay tumulong sa pag-draft ng MOU?

asr-007098
07:43:44.600 --> 07:43:47.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or ito po ba ay boilerplate?

asr-007099
07:43:47.680 --> 07:43:50.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pare-pareho na pinapirmahan sa iba.

asr-007100
07:43:50.120 --> 07:43:53.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ibang mga bansa nakasama sa Critical Minerals Summit.

asr-007101
07:43:54.020 --> 07:43:59.280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, all of these are initiated by the Department of Trade.

asr-007102
07:43:59.460 --> 07:44:00.520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sila yung interesado eh.

asr-007103
07:44:00.520 --> 07:44:03.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung naman government natin, siyempre makinig yun.

asr-007104
07:44:03.440 --> 07:44:03.980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Anong department?

asr-007105
07:44:04.240 --> 07:44:06.600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: O, sino yung Critical Minerals?

asr-007106
07:44:06.700 --> 07:44:07.700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Siyempre, DNR, di ba?

asr-007107
07:44:07.860 --> 07:44:08.640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mines Bureau.

asr-007108
07:44:09.260 --> 07:44:15.960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, wala pa pong overall scope itong EO tungkol sa Critical Minerals.

asr-007109
07:44:16.600 --> 07:44:19.500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And, Madam Spencer, Madam Speaker,

asr-007110
07:44:20.120 --> 07:44:29.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: distinguished colleague, I, for one, would endorse the utilization of all Critical Minerals in country.

asr-007111
07:44:29.760 --> 07:44:30.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bakit?

asr-007112
07:44:30.680 --> 07:44:32.680
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, let's use it for this AIDS.

asr-007113
07:44:32.880 --> 07:44:41.260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi na-AIDS ko, ngunit, AIDS, Madam Speaker, ng ating distinguished colleague, bata pa yan, Madam Speaker.

asr-007114
07:44:41.560 --> 07:44:42.560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kailangan nila ito.

asr-007115
07:44:42.860 --> 07:44:45.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In the next generation, sila makinabang dito.

asr-007116
07:44:46.020 --> 07:44:48.020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi na yung generation namin, Madam Speaker.

asr-007117
07:44:48.220 --> 07:44:49.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-007118
07:44:50.120 --> 07:44:56.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We asked a question tungkol sa boilerplate po ba ito?

asr-007119
07:44:56.460 --> 07:44:59.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May DNR participation po ba sa pag-draft nito?

asr-007120
07:45:00.000 --> 07:45:04.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Signature po ng former Secretary Lotelia ang naroon

asr-007121
07:45:04.940 --> 07:45:08.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Gusto po natin itanong dahil sa assessment natin

asr-007122
07:45:08.180 --> 07:45:10.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng Critical Minerals MOU

asr-007123
07:45:10.540 --> 07:45:14.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mas malaki ang ganansya ng US kaysa po sa Pilipinas

asr-007124
07:45:14.460 --> 07:45:21.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The distinguished sponsor is citing that ito po ay gaganansya ng kabataan

asr-007125
07:45:21.160 --> 07:45:25.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and sa dulo nito kailangan pong gamitin ang minerales kaysa po patulugin

asr-007126
07:45:25.680 --> 07:45:31.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero kung ang paraan po ng pag-extract nito ay makakawasa

asr-007127
07:45:31.240 --> 07:45:35.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at hindi lang yun, pupunta rin po para sa benepisyo ng ibang bansa

asr-007128
07:45:35.960 --> 07:45:40.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po natin makikita bilang ito'y ganansya ng kabataan

asr-007129
