Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: distinguished colleague.

asr-009057
08:50:34.380 --> 08:50:36.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron talaga agreement.

asr-009058
08:50:36.380 --> 08:50:38.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero pinapadaan sa ASEAN.

asr-009059
08:50:38.380 --> 08:50:41.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, one ASEAN country cannot just

asr-009060
08:50:41.380 --> 08:50:43.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: demand compensation from the other.

asr-009061
08:50:43.380 --> 08:50:45.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maybe they will write na,

asr-009062
08:50:45.380 --> 08:50:48.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Uy, for two days, three days kami sa buong Pilipinas,

asr-009063
08:50:48.380 --> 08:50:51.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: apektado kami ng inyong pagsusunog dyan

asr-009064
08:50:51.380 --> 08:50:53.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ng mga punong kahoy sa Sumatra at saka sa Kalimantan.

asr-009065
08:50:54.380 --> 08:50:59.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya kung hindi ninyo ma-stop yung pagsusunog dyan

asr-009066
08:50:59.380 --> 08:51:01.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: at saka yung pollution, yung haze pollution,

asr-009067
08:51:01.380 --> 08:51:04.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: nagtatravel from Singapore down to Kalimantan,

asr-009068
08:51:04.380 --> 08:51:05.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: down to the Philippines,

asr-009069
08:51:05.380 --> 08:51:08.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ay dapat i-compensate nyo kami.

asr-009070
08:51:08.380 --> 08:51:10.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Siguro, ganun ang ibig mong sabihin na,

asr-009071
08:51:10.380 --> 08:51:12.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-009072
08:51:12.380 --> 08:51:14.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: DNR will do that through the ASEAN.

asr-009073
08:51:14.380 --> 08:51:16.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pa nila nagagawa yan.

asr-009074
08:51:16.380 --> 08:51:18.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: We admit, it is not yet being done.

asr-009075
08:51:18.380 --> 08:51:20.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And there is such an agreement.

asr-009076
08:51:20.380 --> 08:51:21.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Correct po kayo.

asr-009077
08:51:21.380 --> 08:51:22.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-009078
08:51:22.380 --> 08:51:25.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron pong mga meeting na naganap.

asr-009079
08:51:25.380 --> 08:51:28.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung mga ibang bansa na affected, kasama po doon,

asr-009080
08:51:28.380 --> 08:51:33.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Indonesia, even Brunei, and East Timor.

asr-009081
08:51:33.380 --> 08:51:40.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Naganap ito sa Bali last July.

asr-009082
08:51:40.380 --> 08:51:45.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dumalo po ba ang Pilipinas sa meeting na to?

asr-009083
08:51:45.380 --> 08:51:51.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Precisely on the topic of trans-border haze pollution.

asr-009084
08:51:51.380 --> 08:51:53.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dumalo po ba ang Pilipinas?

asr-009085
08:51:53.380 --> 08:51:56.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang DNR specifically sa meeting na ito?

asr-009086
08:51:56.380 --> 08:51:58.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi, Madam Speaker.

asr-009087
08:51:58.380 --> 08:51:59.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I'm sorry.

asr-009088
08:51:59.380 --> 08:52:01.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi hindi tayo member.

asr-009089
08:52:01.380 --> 08:52:04.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa subcommittee, what that is.

asr-009090
08:52:04.380 --> 08:52:06.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi kayo member.

asr-009091
08:52:06.380 --> 08:52:07.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-009092
08:52:07.380 --> 08:52:10.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa October,

asr-009093
08:52:10.380 --> 08:52:13.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: magkakaroon po ng meeting sa Da Nang,

asr-009094
08:52:13.380 --> 08:52:15.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa Vietnam,

asr-009095
08:52:15.380 --> 08:52:19.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ministerial...

asr-009096
08:52:19.380 --> 08:52:20.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meeting.

asr-009097
08:52:20.380 --> 08:52:23.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ministerial subcommittee meeting.

asr-009098
08:52:23.380 --> 08:52:24.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No, no, sorry.

asr-009099
08:52:24.380 --> 08:52:25.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Conference of parties.

asr-009100
08:52:25.380 --> 08:52:34.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Conference of parties to the agreement on trans-border haze pollution.

asr-009101
08:52:34.380 --> 08:52:37.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dadalo po ba ang DNR dito?

asr-009102
08:52:37.380 --> 08:52:38.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tinanong ko yan sa DFA.

asr-009103
08:52:38.380 --> 08:52:39.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi nila, tanong nyo sa DNR.

asr-009104
08:52:39.380 --> 08:52:41.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tinatanong ko po sa inyo ngayon.

asr-009105
08:52:41.380 --> 08:52:43.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dadalo po ba kayo?

asr-009106
08:52:43.380 --> 08:52:46.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Speaker, upcoming, they will attend daw.

asr-009107
08:52:46.380 --> 08:52:48.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We will attend.

asr-009108
08:52:48.380 --> 08:52:49.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-009109
08:52:49.380 --> 08:52:58.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Magiging agenda po ba ang pinsala na nangyayari sa Pilipinas at sa mga mamamayang Pilipino?

asr-009110
08:52:58.380 --> 08:53:03.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dala nito sa ASEAN Summit sa November.

asr-009111
08:53:03.380 --> 08:53:06.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagaganapin dito mismo sa Pilipinas.

asr-009112
08:53:06.380 --> 08:53:08.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Siguro habang nandito sila sa PICC po yun.

asr-009113
08:53:08.380 --> 08:53:14.030
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, mararanasan nung lahat yung usok na yan.

asr-009114
08:53:14.030 --> 08:53:15.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pag November, wala na yung usok.

asr-009116
08:53:15.380 --> 08:53:17.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: First issue lang, I don't know how to collect.

asr-009117
08:53:17.380 --> 08:53:25.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If you can help verbalize or memorize, memorialize what you are saying today.

asr-009118
08:53:25.380 --> 08:53:29.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: That will help the DNR in order to present our case.

asr-009119
08:53:29.380 --> 08:53:33.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Speaker, to wrap up, dahil lagpas na po tayo sa oras.

asr-009120
08:53:33.380 --> 08:53:35.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala na eh, time expired ka na, sayang.

asr-009121
08:53:35.380 --> 08:53:45.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, nakikita po natin kung gaano ka, inutil, walang ginagawa ang Marcos Jr. Administration sa issue ng trans-border haze pollution.

asr-009122
08:53:45.380 --> 08:53:46.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-009123
08:53:46.380 --> 08:53:56.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Right now, September 17, yung Deputy Prime Minister ng Malaysia ay nasa Indonesia nakikipag-meeting.

asr-009124
08:53:56.380 --> 08:54:02.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Naniningil sila. Ano bang pwede natin gawin para huwag na maulit ito and so on.

asr-009125
08:54:02.380 --> 08:54:14.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ganon po ka high level ang usapin dahil naisprotektahan ng Malaysia, katulad din ng Singapore, ang kanilang mamamayan, populasyon sa epekto ng pollution.

asr-009126
08:54:14.380 --> 08:54:19.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero dito sa Pilipinas, abay, pabanjing-banjing lang ang Malacanang.

asr-009127
08:54:19.380 --> 08:54:22.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hayaan nyo na lang, mag-mask na lang daw kayo.

asr-009128
08:54:22.380 --> 08:54:27.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O kaya mag-cancel tayo ng klase pagkasobra na ang haze.

asr-009129
08:54:27.380 --> 08:54:40.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kaya po, we expect that the DNR and Malacanang will do its job in protecting the health of the Filipino people and our environment.

asr-009130
08:54:40.380 --> 08:54:43.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So hanggang doon na lang po, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat.

asr-009131
08:54:44.380 --> 08:54:46.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-009132
08:54:46.380 --> 08:54:49.060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Madam Speaker, thank you. Distinguished colleague, thank you.

asr-009133
08:54:49.060 --> 08:54:57.730
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Madam Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor, I move to recognize, last but not least.

asr-009133-split-2
08:54:57.730 --> 08:54:59.990
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Oo, hindi matagal.

asr-009133-split-3
08:54:59.990 --> 08:55:06.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Representative Edgar Erice from the 2nd District of Caloocan City.

asr-009134
08:55:06.380 --> 08:55:07.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-009135
08:55:07.380 --> 08:55:13.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Gentlemen from Caloocan, Representative Edgar Erice is hereby recognized for his interpolation.

asr-009136
08:55:13.380 --> 08:55:14.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-009137
08:55:14.380 --> 08:55:19.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker, thank you, our Majority Leader and Mr. Sponsor.

asr-009138
08:55:19.380 --> 08:55:23.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Mahaba po itong mga tanong ko.

asr-009139
08:55:23.380 --> 08:55:25.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ready and willing.

asr-009140
08:55:25.380 --> 08:55:27.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: May silang ang sagot para...

asr-009141
08:55:27.380 --> 08:55:28.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Oo, Madam Speaker.

asr-009142
08:55:28.380 --> 08:55:39.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ikukumpirma ko lang po sa LLDA Charter kung yung mandate ng Laguna Lake Development Authority

asr-009143
08:55:39.380 --> 08:55:43.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: eh sa Laguna Lake lang o kasama yung mga nearby provinces.

asr-009144
08:55:43.380 --> 08:55:46.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Provinces, cities, and municipalities. Kasama po ba?

asr-009145
08:55:46.380 --> 08:55:48.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, kasama, Madam Speaker.

asr-009146
08:55:52.380 --> 08:56:00.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasama po dito yung mga reclamation na ginagawa doon sa iba't ibang bayan at lungsod.

asr-009147
08:56:00.380 --> 08:56:02.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, within Laguna Lake.

asr-009148
08:56:02.380 --> 08:56:05.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasama po dito yung province of Rizal.

asr-009149
08:56:05.380 --> 08:56:07.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Within Laguna Lake.

asr-009150
08:56:07.380 --> 08:56:10.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Muntinlupa and Taguig.

asr-009151
08:56:10.380 --> 08:56:20.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Has the LLDA conducted any investigation or any formal inquiry into each of the identified reclamation activities in these areas?

asr-009152
08:56:20.380 --> 08:56:23.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, what is the status of each case?

asr-009153
08:56:23.380 --> 08:56:30.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Opo, DNR has already issued notice of violation sa Taguig at saka sa Muntinlupa.

asr-009154
08:56:30.380 --> 08:56:39.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yun po bang LLDA na nag-refer na ng mga kaso sa Office of the Ombudsman pagdating po doon sa mga reclamation projects?

asr-009155
08:56:39.380 --> 08:56:44.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At ano po yung mga project na...

asr-009156
08:56:44.380 --> 08:56:47.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pa po, Madam Speaker, the distinguished colleague.

asr-009157
08:56:47.380 --> 08:56:48.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala na po?

asr-009158
08:56:48.380 --> 08:56:49.380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pa.

asr-009159
08:56:49.380 --> 08:56:53.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala pa po. Okay. Salamat po. At alam ko nyo, nakikisa ko.

asr-009160
08:56:53.380 --> 08:56:58.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Alam ko yung DNR is one of the most professional agencies in the government.

asr-009161
08:56:58.380 --> 08:57:05.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: In fact, alam ko ang kauna-unang nag-ISO yung Environmental Management Bureau.

asr-009162
08:57:05.380 --> 08:57:08.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, in that case,

asr-009163
08:57:08.380 --> 08:57:11.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: I would like to move to terminate.

asr-009164
08:57:11.380 --> 08:57:21.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: In behalf of the minority, I would like to terminate the consideration of the DNR's budget.

asr-009165
08:57:21.380 --> 08:57:22.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Salamat po.

asr-009166
08:57:22.380 --> 08:57:24.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: What does the House say?

asr-009167
08:57:24.380 --> 08:57:28.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Madam Speaker, on the part of the majority,

asr-009168
08:57:28.380 --> 08:57:34.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: we join the minority in the motion to terminate the interpolations

asr-009169
08:57:34.380 --> 08:57:38.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: on the proposed budget of the Department of Environment,

asr-009170
08:57:38.380 --> 08:57:41.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: and Natural Resources. Madam Speaker.

asr-009171
08:57:41.380 --> 08:57:46.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpolations of the proposed budget

asr-009172
08:57:46.380 --> 08:57:49.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: of the Department of Environment and Natural Resources,

asr-009173
08:57:49.380 --> 08:57:52.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: including attached agencies and corporations.

asr-009174
08:57:52.380 --> 08:57:54.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Is there any objection?

asr-009175
08:57:54.380 --> 08:57:59.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair hears none. The interpolations in the proposed budget of said agencies is hereby terminated.

