asr-009291
09:12:42.040 --> 09:12:44.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with a classified matter

asr-009292
09:12:44.260 --> 09:12:46.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: committed in time of war or peace

asr-009293
09:12:46.860 --> 09:12:49.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: through physical, electronic, cyber

asr-009294
09:12:49.000 --> 09:12:50.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or any other means.

asr-009295
09:12:50.500 --> 09:12:52.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: It criminalizes accessing a sketch,

asr-009296
