Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: map, or graphical or multimedia

asr-009297
09:12:54.820 --> 09:12:57.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: representation of a prohibited place

asr-009298
09:12:57.580 --> 09:12:59.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or piece of critical infrastructure

asr-009299
09:13:00.000 --> 09:13:01.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and makes unauthorized possession

asr-009300
09:13:01.680 --> 09:13:03.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of surveillance or mapping equipment

asr-009301
09:13:03.640 --> 09:13:06.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: like cameras, drones, tracking devices.

asr-009302
09:13:06.860 --> 09:13:09.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Conspiracy and even the mere proposal

asr-009303
09:13:09.360 --> 09:13:10.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to commit espionage

asr-009304
09:13:10.460 --> 09:13:12.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: are separately punishable

asr-009305
09:13:12.380 --> 09:13:16.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with conspiracy carrying the same life sentence

asr-009306
09:13:16.040 --> 09:13:17.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: as the underlying offense.

asr-009307
09:13:18.480 --> 09:13:19.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The bill also empowers

asr-009308
09:13:19.700 --> 09:13:21.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the Anti-Money Laundering Council

asr-009309
09:13:21.760 --> 09:13:23.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to investigate, freeze,

asr-009310
09:13:24.080 --> 09:13:25.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and forfeit assets connected

asr-009311
09:13:25.560 --> 09:13:26.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to any of these offenses

asr-009312
09:13:26.960 --> 09:13:29.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and allows military and law enforcement

asr-009313
09:13:29.140 --> 09:13:31.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: personnel to wiretap

asr-009314
09:13:31.600 --> 09:13:33.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and intercept the communications

asr-009315
09:13:33.760 --> 09:13:35.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of anyone merely suspected

asr-009316
09:13:35.840 --> 09:13:37.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: merely suspected

asr-009317
09:13:37.120 --> 09:13:38.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of committing them.

asr-009318
09:13:39.020 --> 09:13:40.900
