asr-009348
09:14:23.920 --> 09:14:25.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: upang supilin

asr-009349
09:14:25.040 --> 09:14:25.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang mga mamamayan

asr-009350
09:14:25.860 --> 09:14:27.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa mga gawagawang kaso,

asr-009351
09:14:27.400 --> 09:14:28.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Making it more easier

asr-009352
09:14:28.640 --> 09:14:30.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po sila ay

asr-009353
09:14:30.740 --> 09:14:32.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: magawan ng ganitong mga

asr-009354
